プレイリストに同期","ディスコグラフィを生成","ゴースト トラックを削除","Dockerized と Private","Django フレームワークを使用"],"ko":["Spotify의 새로운 릴리스를 자동으로 플레이리스트에 동기화","디스코그래피를 생성","고스트 트랙을 삭제","Dockerized 와 Private","Django 프레임워크를 사용"],"es":["Auto-sincronización de nuevos lanzamientos","Generación de discografías","Limpieza de pistas fantasma","Dockerizado y privado"],"fr":["Auto-synchronisation des nouvelles sorties","Génération de discographies","Nettoyage de pistes fantômes","Dockerisé et privé"],"de":["Auto-Synchronisierung neuer Veröffentlichungen","Generierung von Diskografien","Bereinigung von Phantom-Tracks","Dockerisiert und privat"],"pt":["Rastreamento de lançamentos do Spotify","Auto-sincronização de novos lançamentos em playlists","Geração de discografias","Limpeza de faixas fantasma","Dockerizada e privada"],"ru":["Отслеживание релизов Spotify","Авто-синхронизация новых релизов в плейлисты","Генерация дискографий","Очистка привидений-треков","Dockerизирован и приватный"],"ar":["تتبع إصدارات سبوتيفاي","تزامن الإصدارات الجديدة تلقائيًا مع قوائم التشغيل","توليد ديسكографيات","تنظيف المسارات الشبح","تم حاوصلتها وخاصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 Django Expert","什么是 Spotify 发行跟踪","Django Expert 替代品","Django Expert 与其他工具的比较","Django Expert 安装","Django Expert 设置指南","Spotify 发行跟踪工具","Django AI 工具"],"ja":["Django Expert の使い方","Spotify リリース トラッカー とは","Django Expert の代替","Django Expert と他のツールの比較","Django Expert のインストール","Django Expert の設定ガイド","Spotify リリース トラッカー ツール","Django AI ツール"],"ko":["Django 전문가를 사용하는 방법","Spotify 발매 트래커란","Django 전문가 대안","Django 전문가와 다른 도구의 비교","Django 전문가 설치","Django 전문가 설정 가이드","Spotify 발매 트래커 도구","Django AI 에이전트"],"es":["cómo usar django-expert","herramientas AI para música","alternativas a django-expert","django-expert vs otras herramientas","instalación de django-expert","guía de configuración de django-expert"],"fr":["comment utiliser django-expert","outils IA pour la musique","alternatives à django-expert","django-expert vs autres outils","installation de django-expert","guide de configuration de django-expert"],"de":["wie man django-expert verwendet","KI-Tools für Musik","Alternativen zu django-expert","django-expert im Vergleich zu anderen Tools","Installation von django-expert","Konfigurationsanleitung für django-expert"],"pt":["como usar django-expert","o que é agente de rastreamento de lançamentos","django-expert alternativa","django-expert vs spotipy","instalar django-expert","guia de configuração do django-expert"],"ru":["как использовать django-expert","что такое ИИ Агент для отслеживания релизов","django-expert альтернатива","django-expert vs spotipy","установить django-expert","руководство по настройке django-expert"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام django-expert","ما هي أداة تتبع الإصدارات الذكية","بديل django-expert","django-expert مقابل spotipy","تثبيت django-expert","دليل إعداد django-expert"]}},"owner":"emlopezr","repo":"TrackWatch","repoPath":"emlopezr/TrackWatch","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.713Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"django-expert","description":"Expert Django backend development guidance. Use when creating Django models, views, serializers, or APIs; debugging ORM queries or migrations; optimizing database performance; implementing authentication; writing tests; or working with Django REST Framework. Follows Django best practices and modern patterns.","bodyPreview":"# Django Expert\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides expert guidance for Django backend development with comprehensive coverage of models, views, Django REST Framework, forms, authentication, testing, and performance optimization. It follows official Django best practices and modern Python conventions to help you build robust, maintainable applications.\n\n**Key Capabilities:**\n- Model design with optimal ORM patterns\n- View implementation (FBV, CBV, DRF viewsets)\n- Django REST Framework API developm","body":"# Django Expert\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides expert guidance for Django backend development with comprehensive coverage of models, views, Django REST Framework, forms, authentication, testing, and performance optimization. It follows official Django best practices and modern Python conventions to help you build robust, maintainable applications.\n\n**Key Capabilities:**\n- Model design with optimal ORM patterns\n- View implementation (FBV, CBV, DRF viewsets)\n- Django REST Framework API development\n- Query optimization and performance tuning\n- Authentication and permissions\n- Testing strategies and patterns\n- Security best practices\n\n## When to Use\n\nInvoke this skill when you encounter these triggers:\n\n**Model & Database Work:**\n- \"Create a Django model for...\"\n- \"Optimize this queryset/database query\"\n- \"Generate migrations for...\"\n- \"Design database schema for...\"\n- \"Fix N+1 query problem\"\n\n**View & API Development:**\n- \"Create an API endpoint for...\"\n- \"Build a Django view that...\"\n- \"Implement DRF serializer/viewset\"\n- \"Add filtering/pagination to API\"\n\n**Authentication & Security:**\n- \"Implement authentication/permissions\"\n- \"Create custom user model\"\n- \"Secure this endpoint/view\"\n\n**Testing & Quality:**\n- \"Write tests for this Django app\"\n- \"Debug this Django error/issue\"\n- \"Review Django code for issues\"\n\n**Performance & Optimization:**\n- \"This Django view is slow\"\n- \"Optimize database queries\"\n- \"Add caching to...\"\n\n**Production Deployment:**\n- \"Deploy Django to production\"\n- \"Configure Django for production\"\n- \"Set up HTTPS/SSL for Django\"\n- \"Production settings checklist\"\n- \"Configure production database/cache\"\n\n## Instructions\n\nFollow this workflow when handling Django development requests:\n\n### 1. Analyze the Request and Gather Context\n\n**Identify the task type:**\n- Model design (database schema, relationships, migrations)\n- View/API development (FBV, CBV, DRF viewsets, serializers)\n- Query optimization (N+1 problems, database performance)\n- Authentication/permissions (user models, access control)\n- Testing (unit tests, integration tests, fixtures)\n- Security review (CSRF, XSS, SQL injection, permissions)\n- Production deployment (settings, HTTPS, database, caching, monitoring)\n- Template rendering (Django templates, context processors)\n\n**Leverage available context:**\n- If `django-ai-boost` MCP server is available, use it to understand project structure and existing patterns\n- Read relevant existing code to understand conventions\n- Check Django version for compatibility considerations\n\n### 2. Load Relevant Reference Documentation\n\nBased on the task type, reference the appropriate bundled documentation:\n\n- **Models/ORM work** -> `references/models-and-orm.md`\n  - Model design patterns and field choices\n  - Relationship configurations (ForeignKey, ManyToMany)\n  - Custom managers and QuerySet methods\n  - Migration strategies\n\n- **View/API development** -> `references/views-and-urls.md` + `references/drf-guidelines.md`\n  - FBV vs CBV decision criteria\n  - DRF serializers, viewsets, and routers\n  - URL configuration patterns\n  - Middleware and request/response handling\n\n- **Performance issues** -> `references/performance-optimization.md`\n  - Query optimization techniques (select_related, prefetch_related)\n  - Caching strategies (Redis, Memcached, database caching)\n  - Database indexing and query profiling\n  - Connection pooling and async patterns\n\n- **Production deployment** -> `references/production-deployment.md`\n  - Critical settings (DEBUG, SECRET_KEY, ALLOWED_HOSTS)\n  - HTTPS and SSL/TLS configuration\n  - Database and cache configuration\n  - Static/media file serving\n  - Error monitoring and logging\n  - Deployment process and health checks\n\n- **Security concerns** -> `references/security-checklist.md`\n  - CSRF/XSS/SQL injection prevention\n  - Authentication and authorization patterns\n  - Secure configuration practices\n  - Input validation and sanitization\n\n- **Testing tasks** -> `references/testing-strategies.md`\n  - Test structure and organization\n  - Fixtures and factories\n  - Mocking external dependencies\n  - Coverage and CI/CD integration\n\n### 3. Implement Following Django Best Practices\n\n**Code quality standards:**\n- Follow PEP 8 and Django coding style\n- Use Django built-ins over third-party packages when possible\n- Keep views thin, use services/managers for business logic\n- Write descriptive variable names and add docstrings for complex logic\n- Handle errors gracefully with appropriate exceptions\n\n**Django-specific patterns:**\n- Use `select_related()` for FK/OneToOne, `prefetch_related()` for reverse FK/M2M\n- Leverage class-based views and mixins for code reuse\n- Use Django forms/serializers for validation\n- Follow Django''s migration workflow (never edit applied migrations)\n- Use Django''s built-in security features (CSRF tokens, auth decorators)\n\n**API development (DRF):**\n- Use ModelSerializer for standard CRUD operations\n- Implement proper pagination and filtering\n- Use appropriate permission classes\n- Follow RESTful conventions for endpoints\n- Version APIs when making breaking changes\n\n### 4. Validate and Test\n\nBefore presenting the solution:\n\n**Code review:**\n- Check for N+1 query problems (use Django Debug Toolbar mentally)\n- Verify proper error handling and edge cases\n- Ensure security best practices are followed\n- Confirm migrations are clean and reversible\n\n**Testing considerations:**\n- Suggest or write appropriate tests for new functionality\n- Verify test coverage for critical paths\n- Check that fixtures/factories are maintainable\n\n**Performance check:**\n- Review database queries for efficiency\n- Consider caching opportunities\n- Verify proper use of database indexes\n\n## Bundled Resources\n\n**references/** - Comprehensive Django documentation loaded into context as needed\n\nThese reference files provide detailed guidance beyond this SKILL.md overview:\n\n- **`references/models-and-orm.md`** (~11k words)\n  - Model field types and best practices\n  - Relationship configurations (ForeignKey, OneToOne, ManyToMany)\n  - Custom managers and QuerySet methods\n  - Migration patterns and common pitfalls\n  - Database-level constraints and indexes\n\n- **`references/views-and-urls.md`** (~17k words)\n  - Function-based vs class-based view trade-offs\n  - CBV mixins and inheritance patterns\n  - URL routing and reverse resolution\n  - Middleware implementation\n  - Request/response lifecycle\n\n- **`references/drf-guidelines.md`** (~18k words)\n  - Serializer patterns (ModelSerializer, nested serializers)\n  - ViewSet and router configurations\n  - Pagination, filtering, and search\n  - Authentication and permission classes\n  - API versioning strategies\n  - Performance optimization for APIs\n\n- **`references/testing-strategies.md`** (~18k words)\n  - Test organization and structure\n  - Factory patterns vs fixtures\n  - Testing views, models, and serializers\n  - Mocking external services\n  - Test database optimization\n  - CI/CD integration\n\n- **`references/security-checklist.md`** (~12k words)\n  - CSRF protection implementation\n  - XSS prevention techniques\n  - SQL injection defense\n  - Authentication best practices\n  - Permission and authorization patterns\n  - Secure settings configuration\n\n- **`references/performance-optimization.md`** (~14k words)\n  - Query optimization (select_related, prefetch_related, only, defer)\n  - Database indexing strategies\n  - Caching layers (Redis, Memcached, database cache)\n  - Database connection pooling\n  - Profiling and monitoring tools\n  - Async views and background tasks\n\n- **`references/production-deployment.md`** (~20k words)\n  - Critical settings (DEBUG, SECRET_KEY, ALLOWED_HOSTS)\n  - Database configuration and connection pooling\n  - HTTPS/SSL configuration and security headers\n  - Static and media file serving\n  - Caching with Redis/Memcached\n  - Email configuration for production\n  - Error monitoring with Sentry\n  - Logging and health checks\n  - Zero-downtime deployment strategies\n\n- **`references/examples.md`** - Practical implementation examples\n  - Model design with custom managers\n  - N+1 query optimization\n  - DRF API endpoint implementation\n  - Writing Django tests\n\n## Additional Notes\n\n**Django Version Compatibility:**\n- Consider LTS releases (4.2, 5.2) for production\n- Check deprecation warnings when upgrading\n- Use `django-upgrade` tool for automated migration\n\n**Common Pitfalls to Avoid:**\n- Circular imports (use lazy references)\n- Missing `related_name` on relationships\n- Forgetting database indexes on frequently queried fields\n- Using `get()` without exception handling\n- N+1 queries in templates and serializers\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:45:29.552Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Backend Agents needing robust Django application development with expertise in models, views, and Django REST Framework.","zh":"非常适合需要强大的Django应用程序开发的后端代理，具有模型、视图和Django REST Framework的专业知识。","ja":"Djangoアプリケーション開発に強力なバックエンドエージェントが必要な場合に最適で、モデル、ビュー、Django REST Frameworkの専門知識を備えています。","ko":"강력한 Django 애플리케이션 개발이 필요한 백엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며 모델, 뷰 및 Django REST Framework에 대한 전문 지식을 보유하고 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Backend que necesitan un desarrollo de aplicaciones Django robusto con experiencia en modelos, vistas y Django REST Framework.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Backend qui ont besoin d''un développement d''applications Django robuste avec une expertise dans les modèles, les vues et le framework Django REST.","de":"Perfekt für Backend-Agents, die eine robuste Django-Anwendungsentwicklung mit Erfahrung in Modellen, Views und Django REST Framework benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Backend que precisam de desenvolvimento de aplicativos robustos Django com especialização em modelos, visualizações e Django REST Framework.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Backend, которым требуется надежное развитие приложений Django с опытом работы с моделями, видами и Django REST Framework.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الخلفية الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير تطبيقات Django قوية مع خبرة في النماذج والمشاهد وإطار العمل Django REST."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design optimal ORM patterns, implement viewsets with Django REST Framework, and develop high-performance APIs using modern Python conventions and official Django best practices, including authentication and testing.","zh":"赋予代理设计最优的ORM模式、使用Django REST Framework实现视图集，并使用现代Python约定和官方Django最佳实践开发高性能API，包括身份验证和测试。","ja":"エージェントに最適なORMパターンを設計し、Django REST Frameworkを使用してビューセットを実装し、モダンなPythonの規約と公式のDjangoのベストプラクティスを使用して、高パフォーマンスのAPIを開発することを可能にし、認証とテストを含みます。","ko":"에이전트가 최적의 ORM 패턴을 설계하고 Django REST Framework를 사용하여 뷰셋을 구현하며 최신 Python 규칙과 공식 Django 모범 사례를 사용하여 고성능 API를 개발할 수 있도록 하며, 인증 및 테스트도 포함됩니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar patrones de ORM óptimos, implementar viewsets con Django REST Framework y desarrollar API de alto rendimiento utilizando convenciones Python modernas y las mejores prácticas oficiales de Django, incluyendo autenticación y pruebas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des modèles de ORM optimaux, de mettre en œuvre des viewsets avec Django REST Framework et de développer des API haute performance en utilisant des conventions Python modernes et les meilleures pratiques officielles de Django, y compris l''authentification et les tests.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, optimale ORM-Muster zu entwerfen, Viewsets mit Django REST Framework zu implementieren und Hochleistungs-APIs unter Verwendung moderner Python-Konventionen und offizieller Django-Best-Practices zu entwickeln, einschließlich Authentifizierung und Tests.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar padrões de ORM ótimos, implementar conjuntos de visualizações com Django REST Framework e desenvolver APIs de alto desempenho usando convenções Python modernas e práticas recomendadas oficiais do Django, incluindo autenticação e teste.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать оптимальные модели ORM, реализовывать наборы представлений с помощью Django REST Framework и разрабатывать высокопроизводительные API с использованием современных соглашений Python и официальных рекомендаций Django, включая аутентификацию и тестирование.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تصميم أنماط ORM مثالية وتنفيذ مجموعات مناظير مع إطار العمل Django REST و تطوير واجهات برمجة تطبيقات عالية الأداء باستخدام اتفاقيات بايثون الحديثة وأفضل الممارسات الرسمية لإطار العمل Django، بما في ذلك التوثق والاختبار."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing scalable database models with Django ORM","Implementing RESTful APIs using Django REST Framework","Optimizing application performance through testing and authentication"],"zh":["使用Django ORM设计可扩展的数据库模型","使用Django REST Framework实现RESTful API","通过测试和身份验证优化应用程序性能"],"ja":["Django ORMを使用してスケーラブルなデータベースモデルを設計する","Django REST Frameworkを使用してRESTful APIを実装する","テストと認証を通じてアプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化する"],"ko":["Django ORM을 사용하여 확장 가능한 데이터베이스 모델을 설계한다","Django REST Framework를 사용하여 RESTful API를 구현한다","테스트 및 인증을 통해 애플리케이션 성능을 최적화한다"],"es":["Diseñar modelos de base de datos escalables con Django ORM","Implementar API RESTful utilizando Django REST Framework","Optimizar el rendimiento de la aplicación a través de pruebas y autenticación"],"fr":["Concevoir des modèles de base de données évolutifs avec Django ORM","Mettre en œuvre des API RESTful en utilisant Django REST Framework","Optimiser les performances de l''application grâce aux tests et à l''authentification"],"de":["Entwerfen von skalierbaren Datenbankmodellen mit Django ORM","Implementieren von RESTful-APIs unter Verwendung von Django REST Framework","Optimieren der Anwendungsleistung durch Tests und Authentifizierung"],"pt":["Projetar modelos de banco de dados escaláveis com Django ORM","Implementar APIs RESTful usando Django REST Framework","Otimizar o desempenho da aplicação por meio de testes e autenticação"],"ru":["Проектировать масштабируемые модели баз данных с помощью Django ORM","Реализовывать RESTful API с помощью Django REST Framework","Оптимизировать производительность приложения с помощью тестирования и аутентификации"],"ar":["تصميم نماذج قواعد البيانات القابلة للتحجيم باستخدام Django ORM","تنفيذ واجهات برمجة تطبيقات RESTful باستخدام إطار العمل Django REST","تحسين أداء التطبيق من خلال الاختبارات والتوثق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python and Django installation","Django-specific, may not be compatible with other frameworks"],"zh":["需要Python和Django安装","特定于Django，可能与其他框架不兼容"],"ja":["PythonとDjangoのインストールが必要","Django専用で、他のフレームワークと互換性がない可能性がある"],"ko":["Python 및 Django 설치가 필요하다","Django 전용으로, 다른 프레임워크와 호환되지 않을 수 있다"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Python y Django","Específico de Django, puede que no sea compatible con otros frameworks"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Python et de Django","Spécifique à Django, peut ne pas être compatible avec d''autres frameworks"],"de":["Benötigt Python- und Django-Installation","Django-spezifisch, kann möglicherweise nicht mit anderen Frameworks kompatibel sein"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Python e do Django","Específico do Django, pode não ser compatível com outros frameworks"],"ru":["Требует установки Python и Django","Специфичен для Django, может быть несовместим с другими фреймворками"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت بايثون و django","محدد لإطار العمل Django، قد لا يكون متوافقًا مع إطارات العمل الأخرى"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a4919acb26157e182b2d5da524f85efa8c837eaeff3596cbeadf8ec6b61702bb","qualityScore":50}');
