Produktivität und Effizienz","wie man Laravel für die Rechtsberatung verwendet","Alternativen zu Laravel für die Rechtsberatung"],"pt":["como usar Laravel","o que é Laravel","Laravel alternative","Laravel vs CodeIgniter","instalar Laravel","guia de configuração do Laravel"],"ru":["как использовать Laravel","что такое Laravel","ИИ Агенты для Laravel","Laravel альтернатива","Laravel vs Yii","установить Laravel","руководство по настройке Laravel"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Laravel","ما هو Laravel","AI Agents للaravel","بديل Laravel","Laravel مقابل Symfony","تثبيت Laravel","دليل إعداد Laravel"]}},"owner":"danieledelgiudice","repo":"shiny-disco","repoPath":"danieledelgiudice/shiny-disco","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.715Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"laravel-specialist","description":"Use when building Laravel 10+ applications requiring Eloquent ORM, API resources, or queue systems. Invoke for Laravel models, Livewire components, Sanctum authentication, Horizon queues.","bodyPreview":"# Laravel Specialist\n\nSenior Laravel specialist with deep expertise in Laravel 10+, Eloquent ORM, and modern PHP 8.2+ development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior PHP engineer with 10+ years of Laravel experience. You specialize in Laravel 10+ with PHP 8.2+, Eloquent ORM, API resources, queue systems, and modern Laravel patterns. You build elegant, scalable applications with powerful features.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building Laravel 10+ applications\n- Implementing Eloquent models an","body":"# Laravel Specialist\n\nSenior Laravel specialist with deep expertise in Laravel 10+, Eloquent ORM, and modern PHP 8.2+ development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior PHP engineer with 10+ years of Laravel experience. You specialize in Laravel 10+ with PHP 8.2+, Eloquent ORM, API resources, queue systems, and modern Laravel patterns. You build elegant, scalable applications with powerful features.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building Laravel 10+ applications\n- Implementing Eloquent models and relationships\n- Creating RESTful APIs with API resources\n- Setting up queue systems and jobs\n- Building reactive interfaces with Livewire\n- Implementing authentication with Sanctum\n- Optimizing database queries and performance\n- Writing comprehensive tests with Pest/PHPUnit\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze requirements** - Identify models, relationships, APIs, queue needs\n2. **Design architecture** - Plan database schema, service layers, job queues\n3. **Implement models** - Create Eloquent models with relationships, scopes, casts\n4. **Build features** - Develop controllers, services, API resources, jobs\n5. **Test thoroughly** - Write feature and unit tests with >85% coverage\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Eloquent ORM | `references/eloquent.md` | Models, relationships, scopes, query optimization |\n| Routing & APIs | `references/routing.md` | Routes, controllers, middleware, API resources |\n| Queue System | `references/queues.md` | Jobs, workers, Horizon, failed jobs, batching |\n| Livewire | `references/livewire.md` | Components, wire:model, actions, real-time |\n| Testing | `references/testing.md` | Feature tests, factories, mocking, Pest PHP |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Use PHP 8.2+ features (readonly, enums, typed properties)\n- Type hint all method parameters and return types\n- Use Eloquent relationships properly (avoid N+1)\n- Implement API resources for transforming data\n- Queue long-running tasks\n- Write comprehensive tests (>85% coverage)\n- Use service containers and dependency injection\n- Follow PSR-12 coding standards\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Use raw queries without protection (SQL injection)\n- Skip eager loading (causes N+1 problems)\n- Store sensitive data unencrypted\n- Mix business logic in controllers\n- Hardcode configuration values\n- Skip validation on user input\n- Use deprecated Laravel features\n- Ignore queue failures\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing Laravel features, provide:\n1. Model file (Eloquent model with relationships)\n2. Migration file (database schema)\n3. Controller/API resource (if applicable)\n4. Service class (business logic)\n5. Test file (feature/unit tests)\n6. Brief explanation of design decisions\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nLaravel 10+, Eloquent ORM, PHP 8.2+, API resources, Sanctum/Passport, queues, Horizon, Livewire, Inertia, Octane, Pest/PHPUnit, Redis, broadcasting, events/listeners, notifications, task scheduling\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **Fullstack Guardian** - Full-stack Laravel features\n- **Test Master** - Comprehensive testing strategies\n- **DevOps Engineer** - Laravel deployment and CI/CD\n- **Security Reviewer** - Laravel security audits\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:48:10.127Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing advanced Laravel application development with Eloquent ORM and PHP 8.2+","zh":"非常适合需要高级Laravel应用开发的全栈代理，包括Eloquent ORM和PHP 8.2+","ja":"Laravelアプリケーション開発にEloquent ORMとPHP 8.2+を必要とするフルスタックエージェントに最適","ko":"Eloquent ORM 및 PHP 8.2+가 필요한 고급 Laravel 애플리케이션 개발을 위한 풀스택 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Full Stack que necesitan desarrollo avanzado de aplicaciones Laravel con Eloquent ORM y PHP 8.2+","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Full Stack nécessitant un développement d''application Laravel avancé avec Eloquent ORM et PHP 8.2+","de":"Perfekt für Full Stack Agents, die fortgeschrittene Laravel-Anwendungsentwicklung mit Eloquent ORM und PHP 8.2+ benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que necessitam de desenvolvimento avançado de aplicações Laravel com Eloquent ORM e PHP 8.2+","ru":"Идеально подходит для Full Stack агентов, которым требуется продвинутая разработка приложений Laravel с Eloquent ORM и PHP 8.2+","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء Full Stack الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير متقدم لتطبيقات Laravel مع Eloquent ORM و PHP 8.2+"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build scalable Laravel 10+ applications with powerful features, leveraging Eloquent models, API resources, and modern queue systems, all while utilizing PHP 8.2+ development standards","zh":"赋予代理构建可扩展的Laravel 10+应用程序的能力，利用强大的功能，利用Eloquent模型，API资源和现代队列系统，同时遵循PHP 8.2+开发标准","ja":"Eloquentモデル、APIリソース、モダンなキュー システムを利用し、PHP 8.2+の開発基準を利用して、スケーラブルなLaravel 10+アプリケーションを構築するエージェントの能力を付与する","ko":"Eloquent 모델, API 리소스 및 현대적인 큐 시스템을 활용하여 PHP 8.2+ 개발 표준을 준수하면서 확장 가능한 Laravel 10+ 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여","es":"Empodera a los agentes para construir aplicaciones escalables Laravel 10+ con características potentes, aprovechando modelos Eloquent, API resources y sistemas de colas modernos, todo mientras utiliza los estándares de desarrollo de PHP 8.2+","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des applications Laravel 10+ évolutives avec des fonctionnalités puissantes, en tirant parti des modèles Eloquent, des API resources et des systèmes de file d''attente modernes, le tout en utilisant les standards de développement PHP 8.2+","de":"Ermöglicht Agents den Bau skalierbarer Laravel 10+-Anwendungen mit leistungsstarken Funktionen unter Nutzung von Eloquent-Modellen, API-Ressourcen und modernen Queue-Systemen, alles unter Einhaltung der PHP 8.2+-Entwicklungsstandards","pt":"Capacita os agentes a construir aplicações Laravel 10+ escaláveis com recursos poderosos, aproveitando modelos Eloquent, API resources e sistemas de fila modernos, tudo enquanto utiliza os padrões de desenvolvimento PHP 8.2+","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать масштабируемые приложения Laravel 10+ с мощными функциями, используя модели Eloquent, API resources и современные системы очередей, все с применением стандартов разработки PHP 8.2+","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات Laravel 10+ قابلة للتوسع بميزات قوية، والاستفادة من نماذج Eloquent، وموارد API، وأنظمة الطابور الحديثة، كل ذلك مع استخدام معايير تطوير PHP 8.2+"},"useCases":{"en":["Building Laravel 10+ applications from scratch","Implementing Eloquent models for complex data relationships","Developing API resources for secure and efficient data exchange"],"zh":["从零开始构建Laravel 10+应用程序","为复杂数据关系实现Eloquent模型","开发安全高效的数据交换API资源"],"ja":["Laravel 10+アプリケーションをスクラッチから構築する","複雑なデータ関係のEloquentモデルを実装する","セキュアで効率的なデータ交換のためのAPIリソースを開発する"],"ko":["Laravel 10+ 애플리케이션을 스크래치부터 구축","복잡한 데이터 관계를 위한 Eloquent 모델 구현","보안 및 효율적인 데이터 교환을 위한 API 리소스 개발"],"es":["Construir aplicaciones Laravel 10+ desde cero","Implementar modelos Eloquent para relaciones de datos complejas","Desarrollar API resources para un intercambio de datos seguro y eficiente"],"fr":["Construire des applications Laravel 10+ à partir de zéro","Implémenter des modèles Eloquent pour des relations de données complexes","Développer des API resources pour un échange de données sécurisé et efficace"],"de":["Laravel 10+-Anwendungen von Grund auf bauen","Eloquent-Modelle für komplexe Datenbeziehungen implementieren","API-Ressourcen für sicheren und effizienten Datenaustausch entwickeln"],"pt":["Construir aplicações Laravel 10+ do zero","Implementar modelos Eloquent para relações de dados complexas","Desenvolver API resources para troca de dados segura e eficiente"],"ru":["Создание приложений Laravel 10+ с нуля","Реализация моделей Eloquent для сложных отношений данных","Разработка API resources для безопасного и эффективного обмена данными"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات Laravel 10+ من الصفر","تنفيذ نماذج Eloquent لعلاقات البيانات المعقدة","تطوير موارد API لتبادل البيانات بشكل آمن وفعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PHP 8.2+ environment","Laravel 10+ specific","Eloquent ORM expertise necessary"],"zh":["需要PHP 8.2+环境","仅适用于Laravel 10+","需要Eloquent ORM专长"],"ja":["PHP 8.2+環境が必要","Laravel 10+専用","Eloquent ORMの専門知識が必要"],"ko":["PHP 8.2+ 환경 필요","Laravel 10+ 전용","Eloquent ORM 전문 지식 필요"],"es":["Requiere un entorno PHP 8.2+","Específico para Laravel 10+","Se necesita experiencia en Eloquent ORM"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement PHP 8.2+","Spécifique à Laravel 10+","Une expertise en Eloquent ORM est nécessaire"],"de":["Erfordert eine PHP 8.2+-Umgebung","Spezifisch für Laravel 10+","Eloquent ORM-Expertise ist notwendig"],"pt":["Requer ambiente PHP 8.2+","Específico para Laravel 10+","É necessária experiência em Eloquent ORM"],"ru":["Требует среду PHP 8.2+","Специфично для Laravel 10+","Необходим опыт работы с Eloquent ORM"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة PHP 8.2+","مخصص لإصدار Laravel 10+","الخبرة في Eloquent ORM ضرورية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"5e85c1de4e904e51d620eb680c7069b4041fc3321c3c5c4d9122007877d930e9","qualityScore":50}');
