imisation des ressources","Amélioration de l''interactivité","Surveillance de la stabilité visuelle","Rapports détaillés et recommandations"],"de":["Ladezeitanalyse","Ressourcenoptimierung","Interaktivitätsverbesserung","Überwachung der visuellen Stabilität","Detaillierte Berichte und Empfehlungen"],"pt":["Otimização de desempenho da web","Análise de métricas de desempenho","Recomendações de melhoria","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Suporte a múltiplos navegadores"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности веб-приложений","Анализ метрик производительности","Рекомендации по улучшению","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Поддержка нескольких браузеров"],"ar":["تحسين أداء الويب","تحليل معايير الأداء","توصيات للتحسين","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","دعم متصفحات متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用核心网页生命体征AI工具","什么是核心网页生命体征","核心网页生命体征AI工具替代品","核心网页生命体征AI工具安装","Web性能优化技巧","AI驱动的Web开发"],"ja":["Core Web Vitals AIエージェントの使い方","Core Web Vitalsとは","Core Web Vitals AIエージェントの代替","Core Web Vitals AIエージェントのインストール","Webパフォーマンス最適化のテクニック","AI駆動のWeb開発"],"ko":["코어 웹 비탈스 AI 에이전트 사용법","코어 웹 비탈스란","코어 웹 비탈스 AI 에이전트 대체","코어 웹 비탈스 AI 에이전트 설치","웹 페이지 성능 최적화 기술","AI 기반 웹 개발"],"es":["core-web-vitals","herramientas de desarrollo web","mejora de la velocidad de carga","optimización de recursos","core-web-vitals vs lighthouse","cómo usar core-web-vitals","guía de instalación de core-web-vitals","alternativas a core-web-vitals"],"fr":["core-web-vitals","outils de développement web","amélioration de la vitesse de chargement","optimisation des ressources","core-web-vitals vs lighthouse","comment utiliser core-web-vitals","guide d''installation de core-web-vitals","alternatives à core-web-vitals"],"de":["core-web-vitals","web-entwicklungstools","geschwindigkeitsverbesserung","ressourcenoptimierung","core-web-vitals vs lighthouse","wie man core-web-vitals verwendet","installationsanleitung für core-web-vitals","alternativen zu core-web-vitals"],"pt":["como usar core web vitals","o que é core web vitals","core web vitals vs lighthouse","instalar core web vitals","guia de configuração core web vitals","ferramentas de inteligência artificial para desenvolvedores","otimização de desempenho da web","análise de métricas de desempenho"],"ru":["как использовать core web vitals","что такое core web vitals","core web vitals vs lighthouse","установить core web vitals","руководство по настройке core web vitals","инструменты искусственного интеллекта для веб-разработчиков","оптимизация производительности веб-приложений","анализ метрик производительности"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام core web vitals","ما هو core web vitals","core web vitals vs lighthouse","تثبيت core web vitals","دليل إعداد core web vitals","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للطورين","تحسين أداء الويب","تحليل معايير الأداء"]}},"owner":"sayeedjoy","repo":"seucampusmate-web","repoPath":"sayeedjoy/seucampusmate-web","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.772Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"core-web-vitals","description":"Optimize Core Web Vitals (LCP, INP, CLS) for better page experience and search ranking. Use when asked to improve Core Web Vitals, fix LCP, reduce CLS, optimize INP, page experience optimization, or fix layout shifts.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Core Web Vitals optimization\n\nTargeted optimization for the three Core Web Vitals metrics that affect Google Search ranking and user experience.\n\n## The three metrics\n\n| Metric | Measures | Good | Needs work | Poor |\n|--------|----------|------|------------|------|\n| **LCP** | Loading | ≤ 2.5s | 2.5s – 4s | > 4s |\n| **INP** | Interactivity | ≤ 200ms | 200ms – 500ms | > 500ms |\n| **CLS** | Visual Stability | ≤ 0.1 | 0.1 – 0.25 | > 0.25 |\n\nGoogle measures at the **75th percentile** — 75% of page","body":"# Core Web Vitals optimization\n\nTargeted optimization for the three Core Web Vitals metrics that affect Google Search ranking and user experience.\n\n## The three metrics\n\n| Metric | Measures | Good | Needs work | Poor |\n|--------|----------|------|------------|------|\n| **LCP** | Loading | ≤ 2.5s | 2.5s – 4s | > 4s |\n| **INP** | Interactivity | ≤ 200ms | 200ms – 500ms | > 500ms |\n| **CLS** | Visual Stability | ≤ 0.1 | 0.1 – 0.25 | > 0.25 |\n\nGoogle measures at the **75th percentile** — 75% of page visits must meet \"Good\" thresholds.\n\n---\n\n## LCP: Largest Contentful Paint\n\nLCP measures when the largest visible content element renders. Usually this is:\n- Hero image or video\n- Large text block\n- Background image\n- `<svg>` element\n\n### Common LCP issues\n\n**1. Slow server response (TTFB > 800ms)**\n```\nFix: CDN, caching, optimized backend, edge rendering\n```\n\n**2. Render-blocking resources**\n```html\n<!-- ❌ Blocks rendering -->\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/all-styles.css\">\n\n<!-- ✅ Critical CSS inlined, rest deferred -->\n<style>/* Critical above-fold CSS */</style>\n<link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/styles.css\" as=\"style\" \n      onload=\"this.onload=null;this.rel=''stylesheet''\">\n```\n\n**3. Slow resource load times**\n```html\n<!-- ❌ No hints, discovered late -->\n<img src=\"/hero.jpg\" alt=\"Hero\">\n\n<!-- ✅ Preloaded with high priority -->\n<link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/hero.webp\" as=\"image\" fetchpriority=\"high\">\n<img src=\"/hero.webp\" alt=\"Hero\" fetchpriority=\"high\">\n```\n\n**4. Client-side rendering delays**\n```javascript\n// ❌ Content loads after JavaScript\nuseEffect(() => {\n  fetch(''/api/hero-text'').then(r => r.json()).then(setHeroText);\n}, []);\n\n// ✅ Server-side or static rendering\n// Use SSR, SSG, or streaming to send HTML with content\nexport async function getServerSideProps() {\n  const heroText = await fetchHeroText();\n  return { props: { heroText } };\n}\n```\n\n### LCP optimization checklist\n\n```markdown\n- [ ] TTFB < 800ms (use CDN, edge caching)\n- [ ] LCP image preloaded with fetchpriority=\"high\"\n- [ ] LCP image optimized (WebP/AVIF, correct size)\n- [ ] Critical CSS inlined (< 14KB)\n- [ ] No render-blocking JavaScript in <head>\n- [ ] Fonts don''t block text rendering (font-display: swap)\n- [ ] LCP element in initial HTML (not JS-rendered)\n```\n\n### LCP element identification\n```javascript\n// Find your LCP element\nnew PerformanceObserver((list) => {\n  const entries = list.getEntries();\n  const lastEntry = entries[entries.length - 1];\n  console.log(''LCP element:'', lastEntry.element);\n  console.log(''LCP time:'', lastEntry.startTime);\n}).observe({ type: ''largest-contentful-paint'', buffered: true });\n```\n\n---\n\n## INP: Interaction to Next Paint\n\nINP measures responsiveness across ALL interactions (clicks, taps, key presses) during a page visit. It reports the worst interaction (at 98th percentile for high-traffic pages).\n\n### INP breakdown\n\nTotal INP = **Input Delay** + **Processing Time** + **Presentation Delay**\n\n| Phase | Target | Optimization |\n|-------|--------|--------------|\n| Input Delay | < 50ms | Reduce main thread blocking |\n| Processing | < 100ms | Optimize event handlers |\n| Presentation | < 50ms | Minimize rendering work |\n\n### Common INP issues\n\n**1. Long tasks blocking main thread**\n```javascript\n// ❌ Long synchronous task\nfunction processLargeArray(items) {\n  items.forEach(item => expensiveOperation(item));\n}\n\n// ✅ Break into chunks with yielding\nasync function processLargeArray(items) {\n  const CHUNK_SIZE = 100;\n  for (let i = 0; i < items.length; i += CHUNK_SIZE) {\n    const chunk = items.slice(i, i + CHUNK_SIZE);\n    chunk.forEach(item => expensiveOperation(item));\n    \n    // Yield to main thread\n    await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 0));\n    // Or use scheduler.yield() when available\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**2. Heavy event handlers**\n```javascript\n// ❌ All work in handler\nbutton.addEventListener(''click'', () => {\n  // Heavy computation\n  const result = calculateComplexThing();\n  // DOM updates\n  updateUI(result);\n  // Analytics\n  trackEvent(''click'');\n});\n\n// ✅ Prioritize visual feedback\nbutton.addEventListener(''click'', () => {\n  // Immediate visual feedback\n  button.classList.add(''loading'');\n  \n  // Defer non-critical work\n  requestAnimationFrame(() => {\n    const result = calculateComplexThing();\n    updateUI(result);\n  });\n  \n  // Use requestIdleCallback for analytics\n  requestIdleCallback(() => trackEvent(''click''));\n});\n```\n\n**3. Third-party scripts**\n```javascript\n// ❌ Eagerly loaded, blocks interactions\n<script src=\"https://heavy-widget.com/widget.js\"></script>\n\n// ✅ Lazy loaded on interaction or visibility\nconst loadWidget = () => {\n  import(''https://heavy-widget.com/widget.js'')\n    .then(widget => widget.init());\n};\nbutton.addEventListener(''click'', loadWidget, { once: true });\n```\n\n**4. Excessive re-renders (React/Vue)**\n```javascript\n// ❌ Re-renders entire tree\nfunction App() {\n  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <Counter count={count} />\n      <ExpensiveComponent /> {/* Re-renders on every count change */}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\n// ✅ Memoized expensive components\nconst MemoizedExpensive = React.memo(ExpensiveComponent);\n\nfunction App() {\n  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <Counter count={count} />\n      <MemoizedExpensive />\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### INP optimization checklist\n\n```markdown\n- [ ] No tasks > 50ms on main thread\n- [ ] Event handlers complete quickly (< 100ms)\n- [ ] Visual feedback provided immediately\n- [ ] Heavy work deferred with requestIdleCallback\n- [ ] Third-party scripts don''t block interactions\n- [ ] Debounced input handlers where appropriate\n- [ ] Web Workers for CPU-intensive operations\n```\n\n### INP debugging\n```javascript\n// Identify slow interactions\nnew PerformanceObserver((list) => {\n  for (const entry of list.getEntries()) {\n    if (entry.duration > 200) {\n      console.warn(''Slow interaction:'', {\n        type: entry.name,\n        duration: entry.duration,\n        processingStart: entry.processingStart,\n        processingEnd: entry.processingEnd,\n        target: entry.target\n      });\n    }\n  }\n}).observe({ type: ''event'', buffered: true, durationThreshold: 16 });\n```\n\n---\n\n## CLS: Cumulative Layout Shift\n\nCLS measures unexpected layout shifts. A shift occurs when a visible element changes position between frames without user interaction.\n\n**CLS Formula:** `impact fraction × distance fraction`\n\n### Common CLS causes\n\n**1. Images without dimensions**\n```html\n<!-- ❌ Causes layout shift when loaded -->\n<img src=\"photo.jpg\" alt=\"Photo\">\n\n<!-- ✅ Space reserved -->\n<img src=\"photo.jpg\" alt=\"Photo\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\">\n\n<!-- ✅ Or use aspect-ratio -->\n<img src=\"photo.jpg\" alt=\"Photo\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 4/3; width: 100%;\">\n```\n\n**2. Ads, embeds, and iframes**\n```html\n<!-- ❌ Unknown size until loaded -->\n<iframe src=\"https://ad-network.com/ad\"></iframe>\n\n<!-- ✅ Reserve space with min-height -->\n<div style=\"min-height: 250px;\">\n  <iframe src=\"https://ad-network.com/ad\" height=\"250\"></iframe>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ✅ Or use aspect-ratio container -->\n<div style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\">\n  <iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/...\" \n          style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%;\"></iframe>\n</div>\n```\n\n**3. Dynamically injected content**\n```javascript\n// ❌ Inserts content above viewport\nnotifications.prepend(newNotification);\n\n// ✅ Insert below viewport or use transform\nconst insertBelow = viewport.bottom < newNotification.top;\nif (insertBelow) {\n  notifications.prepend(newNotification);\n} else {\n  // Animate in without shifting\n  newNotification.style.transform = ''translateY(-100%)'';\n  notifications.prepend(newNotification);\n  requestAnimationFrame(() => {\n    newNotification.style.transform = '''';\n  });\n}\n```\n\n**4. Web fonts causing FOUT**\n```css\n/* ❌ Font swap shifts text */\n@font-face {\n  font-family: ''Custom'';\n  src: url(''custom.woff2'') format(''woff2'');\n}\n\n/* ✅ Optional font (no shift if slow) */\n@font-face {\n  font-family: ''Custom'';\n  src: url(''custom.woff2'') format(''woff2'');\n  font-display: optional;\n}\n\n/* ✅ Or match fallback metrics */\n@font-face {\n  font-family: ''Custom'';\n  src: url(''custom.woff2'') format(''woff2'');\n  font-display: swap;\n  size-adjust: 105%; /* Match fallback size */\n  ascent-override: 95%;\n  descent-override: 20%;\n}\n```\n\n**5. Animations triggering layout**\n```css\n/* ❌ Animates layout properties */\n.animate {\n  transition: height 0.3s, width 0.3s;\n}\n\n/* ✅ Use transform instead */\n.animate {\n  transition: transform 0.3s;\n}\n.animate.expanded {\n  transform: scale(1.2);\n}\n```\n\n### CLS optimization checklist\n\n```markdown\n- [ ] All images have width/height or aspect-ratio\n- [ ] All videos/embeds have reserved space\n- [ ] Ads have min-height containers\n- [ ] Fonts use font-display: optional or matched metrics\n- [ ] Dynamic content inserted below viewport\n- [ ] Animations use transform/opacity only\n- [ ] No content injected above existing content\n```\n\n### CLS debugging\n```javascript\n// Track layout shifts\nnew PerformanceObserver((list) => {\n  for (const entry of list.getEntries()) {\n    if (!entry.hadRecentInput) {\n      console.log(''Layout shift:'', entry.value);\n      entry.sources?.forEach(source => {\n        console.log(''  Shifted element:'', source.node);\n        console.log(''  Previous rect:'', source.previousRect);\n        console.log(''  Current rect:'', source.currentRect);\n      });\n    }\n  }\n}).observe({ type: ''layout-shift'', buffered: true });\n```\n\n---\n\n## Measurement tools\n\n### Lab testing\n- **Chrome DevTools** → Performance panel, Lighthouse\n- **WebPageTest** → Detailed waterfall, filmstrip\n- **Lighthouse CLI** → `npx lighthouse <url>`\n\n### Field data (real users)\n- **Chrome User Experience Report (CrUX)** → BigQuery or API\n- **Search Console** → Core Web Vitals report\n- **web-vitals library** → Send to your analytics\n\n```javascript\nimport {onLCP, onINP, onCLS} from ''web-vitals'';\n\nfunction sendToAnalytics({name, value, rating}) {\n  gtag(''event'', name, {\n    event_category: ''Web Vitals'',\n    value: Math.round(name === ''CLS'' ? value * 1000 : value),\n    event_label: rating\n  });\n}\n\nonLCP(sendToAnalytics);\nonINP(sendToAnalytics);\nonCLS(sendToAnalytics);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Framework quick fixes\n\n### Next.js\n```jsx\n// LCP: Use next/image with priority\nimport Image from ''next/image'';\n<Image src=\"/hero.jpg\" priority fill alt=\"Hero\" />\n\n// INP: Use dynamic imports\nconst HeavyComponent = dynamic(() => import(''./Heavy''), { ssr: false });\n\n// CLS: Image component handles dimensions automatically\n```\n\n### React\n```jsx\n// LCP: Preload in head\n<link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/hero.jpg\" as=\"image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" />\n\n// INP: Memoize and useTransition\nconst [isPending, startTransition] = useTransition();\nstartTransition(() => setExpensiveState(newValue));\n\n// CLS: Always specify dimensions in img tags\n```\n\n### Vue/Nuxt\n```vue\n<!-- LCP: Use nuxt/image with preload -->\n<NuxtImg src=\"/hero.jpg\" preload loading=\"eager\" />\n\n<!-- INP: Use async components -->\n<component :is=\"() => import(''./Heavy.vue'')\" />\n\n<!-- CLS: Use aspect-ratio CSS -->\n<img :style=\"{ aspectRatio: ''16/9'' }\" />\n```\n\n## References\n\n- [web.dev LCP](https://web.dev/articles/lcp)\n- [web.dev INP](https://web.dev/articles/inp)\n- [web.dev CLS](https://web.dev/articles/cls)\n- [Performance skill](../performance/SKILL.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:21:03.636Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Optimization Agents needing to boost Google Search ranking and user experience through Core Web Vitals optimization.","zh":"非常适合需要通过 Core Web Vitals 优化提升 Google 搜索排名和用户体验的 Web 优化代理。","ja":"Google Search ランキングとユーザー エクスペリエンスを Core Web Vitals 最適化によって向上させる必要がある Web 最適化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Core Web Vitals 최적화를 통해 Google 검색 순위와 사용자 경험을 향상시켜야 하는 웹 최적화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de optimización web que necesitan mejorar el ranking de búsqueda de Google y la experiencia del usuario a través de la optimización de Core Web Vitals.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation web qui ont besoin d''améliorer le classement de recherche Google et l''expérience utilisateur grâce à l''optimisation des Core Web Vitals.","de":"Perfekt für Web-Optimierungsagenten, die das Google-Suchranking und die Benutzererfahrung durch die Optimierung von Core Web Vitals verbessern müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Otimização da Web que precisam melhorar o ranking do Google Search e a experiência do usuário por meio da otimização dos Core Web Vitals.","ru":"Идеально подходит для веб-оптимизационных агентов, которым необходимо повысить рейтинг Google Search и улучшить пользовательский опыт за счет оптимизации Core Web Vitals.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكالات تحسين الويب التي تحتاج إلى تعزيز تصنيف محرك البحث جوجل وتجربة المستخدم من خلال تحسين معايير الويب الأساسية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize websites for better Loading Performance (LCP), Interactivity (INP), and Visual Stability (CLS) using targeted metrics and 75th percentile measurements, ensuring improved search engine rankings and user satisfaction.","zh":"赋予代理优化网站的能力，以提高加载性能（LCP）、交互性（INP）和视觉稳定性（CLS），使用有针对性的指标和 75th 百分位测量，确保搜索引擎排名和用户满意度的改善。","ja":"ターゲットとなる指標と 75 パーセントパーセンタイル測定を使用して、ロード パフォーマンス（LCP）、インタラクティブ性（INP）、視覚的安定性（CLS）を最適化することで、検索エンジンのランキングとユーザー満足度の向上を実現します。","ko":"목표 지표와 75 백분위 측정을 사용하여 로딩 성능(LCP), 상호 작용(INP), 시각적 안정성(CLS)을 최적화하여 검색 엔진 순위와 사용자 만족도를 향상시킵니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar sitios web para una mejor carga (LCP), interactividad (INP) y estabilidad visual (CLS) utilizando métricas dirigidas y mediciones del percentil 75, lo que garantiza un mejor posicionamiento en los motores de búsqueda y la satisfacción del usuario.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les sites web pour une meilleure performance de chargement (LCP), une interactivité (INP) et une stabilité visuelle (CLS) en utilisant des métriques ciblées et des mesures du 75e percentile, garantissant ainsi de meilleures positions dans les moteurs de recherche et une satisfaction utilisateur accrue.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Webseiten für eine bessere Ladeleistung (LCP), Interaktivität (INP) und visuelle Stabilität (CLS) zu optimieren, indem gezielte Metriken und 75. Perzentil-Messungen verwendet werden, um bessere Suchmaschinen-Rankings und Benutzerzufriedenheit sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar sites para melhor desempenho de carregamento (LCP), interatividade (INP) e estabilidade visual (CLS) usando métricas direcionadas e medições do percentil 75, garantindo melhorias nos rankings de mecanismos de busca e satisfação do usuário.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать веб-сайты для лучшей производительности загрузки (LCP), интерактивности (INP) и визуальной стабильности (CLS) с помощью целевых метрик и измерений 75-го процентиля, обеспечивая улучшение рейтинга поисковых систем и удовлетворенность пользователей.","ar":"تمكين الوكالات من تحسين المواقع الإلكترونية من أجل أداء تحميل أفضل (LCP) وتفاعل (INP) وثبات بصرية (CLS) باستخدام معايير مستهدفة وقياسات百分ة 75 ، مما يضمن تحسين تصنيف محرك البحث والرضا المستخدم."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing LCP metrics to reduce page load times","Optimizing INP for smoother user interactions","Debugging CLS issues to improve visual stability"],"zh":["分析 LCP 指标以减少页面加载时间","优化 INP 以实现更平滑的用户交互","调试 CLS 问题以提高视觉稳定性"],"ja":["LCP メトリックを分析してページ読み込み時間を短縮する","INP を最適化してユーザーとのやり取りをスムーズにする","CLS の問題をデバッグして視覚的安定性を向上させる"],"ko":["LCP 메트릭을 분석하여 페이지 로딩 시간을 줄임","INP를 최적화하여 사용자 상호 작용을 더 매끄럽게 함","CLS 문제를 디버깅하여 시각적 안정성을 개선함"],"es":["Analizar las métricas LCP para reducir los tiempos de carga de página","Optimizar INP para interacciones de usuario más suaves","Depurar problemas CLS para mejorar la estabilidad visual"],"fr":["Analyser les métriques LCP pour réduire les temps de chargement de page","Optimiser INP pour des interactions utilisateur plus fluides","Déboguer les problèmes CLS pour améliorer la stabilité visuelle"],"de":["Analyse von LCP-Metriken zur Reduzierung der Ladezeiten von Seiten","Optimierung von INP für eine reibungslosere Benutzeroberfläche","Fehlerbehebung von CLS-Problemen zur Verbesserung der visuellen Stabilität"],"pt":["Analisar métricas LCP para reduzir os tempos de carregamento de página","Otimizar INP para interações de usuário mais suaves","Depurar problemas CLS para melhorar a estabilidade visual"],"ru":["Анализ метрик LCP для уменьшения времени загрузки страницы","Оптимизация INP для более плавных взаимодействий пользователя","Отладка проблем CLS для улучшения визуальной стабильности"],"ar":["تحليل معايير LCP لتقليل أوقات تحميل الصفحة","تحسين INP لتفاعلات المستخدم الأكثر سلاسة","تصحيح أخطاء CLS لتحسين الثبات البصري"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Google Search ranking factors","Limited to web applications with measurable Core Web Vitals metrics","75th percentile measurement may require large sample sizes"],"zh":["需要了解 Google 搜索排名因素","仅限于具有可测量 Core Web Vitals 指标的 Web 应用程序","75th 百分位测量可能需要大量样本"],"ja":["Google 検索のランキング要因の理解が必要","Core Web Vitals メトリックが測定可能な Web アプリケーションに限定される","75 パーセントパーセンタイル測定には大量のサンプルが必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["Google 검색 순위 요인의 이해가 필요함","측정 가능한 Core Web Vitals 메트릭을 가진 웹 애플리케이션에만 제한됨","75 백분위 측정은大量의 샘플이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los factores de ranking de búsqueda de Google","Limitado a aplicaciones web con métricas de Core Web Vitals medibles","La medición del percentil 75 puede requerir tamaños de muestra grandes"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des facteurs de classement de recherche Google","Limité aux applications web avec des métriques de Core Web Vitals mesurables","La mesure du 75e percentile peut nécessiter des tailles d''échantillon importantes"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis der Google-Suchranking-Faktoren","Begrenzt auf Webanwendungen mit messbaren Core Web Vitals-Metriken","Die Messung des 75. Perzentils kann große Stichprobengrößen erfordern"],"pt":["Exige compreensão dos fatores de classificação do Google Search","Limitado a aplicações web com métricas Core Web Vitals mensuráveis","A medição do percentil 75 pode exigir grandes tamanhos de amostra"],"ru":["Требует понимания факторов ранжирования Google Search","Ограничен веб-приложениями с измеримыми метриками Core Web Vitals","Измерение 75-го процентиля может требовать больших размеров выборки"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم عوامل تصنيف محرك البحث جوجل","محدود للتطبيقات الويب مع معايير الويب الأساسية القابلة للقياس","قياس النسبة المئوية 75 قد يتطلب حجم عينة كبير"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b03396c9bd7a41950bbaf5964bc8f1cf60a3c81830a6171614d6413c8bff308c","qualityScore":50}');
