seのセットアップガイド","AIエージェントの比較","Langfuseの代替"],"ko":["Langfuse","AI 에이전트","디버깅 및 관측성","MCP 프로토콜","Langfuse 사용법","Langfuse 설치","Langfuse 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트 비교","Langfuse 대체"],"es":["langfuse mcp server","herramientas ia observabilidad","debugging agentes ia","como usar langfuse mcp","model context protocol setup","langfuse vs competidor","instalar servidor langfuse","observabilidad trazas ia","integracion langfuse python","query traces langfuse"],"fr":["serveur langfuse mcp","outils ia observabilité","débogage agents ia","comment utiliser langfuse mcp","model context protocol installation","langfuse alternative","installer serveur langfuse","observabilité traces ia","intégration langfuse python","requêter traces langfuse"],"de":["langfuse mcp server","ki agenten observability","debugging ki agenten","wie verwendet man langfuse mcp","model context protocol einrichtung","langfuse alternative","langfuse server installieren","observability traces ki","langfuse python integration","traces abfragen langfuse"],"pt":["como usar langfuse","o que é langfuse","langfuse vs ferramentas de depuração","instalar langfuse","guia de configuração langfuse","langfuse para agentes de ia","depuração de agentes de ia","observabilidade de agentes de ia"],"ru":["как использовать langfuse","что такое langfuse","langfuse vs инструменты отладки","установить langfuse","руководство по настройке langfuse","langfuse для ии агентов","отладка ии агентов","наблюдаемость ии агентов"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام langfuse","ما هو langfuse","langfuse مقابل أدوات فحص","تثبيت langfuse","دليل إعداد langfuse","langfuse للوكلاء الذكيين","تصحيح أعطال الوكلاء الذكيين","رصد الوكلاء الذكيين"]}},"owner":"avivsinai","repo":"langfuse-mcp","repoPath":"avivsinai/langfuse-mcp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.788Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"langfuse","description":"Debug AI traces, find exceptions, analyze sessions, and manage prompts via Langfuse MCP. Also handles MCP setup and configuration.","version":"1.0.2","bodyPreview":"# Langfuse Skill\n\nDebug your AI systems through Langfuse observability.\n\n**Triggers:** langfuse, traces, debug AI, find exceptions, set up langfuse, what went wrong, why is it slow, datasets, evaluation sets\n\n## Setup\n\n**Step 1:** Get credentials from https://cloud.langfuse.com → Settings → API Keys\n\nIf self-hosted, use your instance URL for `LANGFUSE_HOST` and create keys there.\n\n**Step 2:** Install MCP (pick one):\n\n```bash\n# Claude Code (project-scoped, shared via .mcp.json)\nclaude mcp add \\","body":"# Langfuse Skill\n\nDebug your AI systems through Langfuse observability.\n\n**Triggers:** langfuse, traces, debug AI, find exceptions, set up langfuse, what went wrong, why is it slow, datasets, evaluation sets\n\n## Setup\n\n**Step 1:** Get credentials from https://cloud.langfuse.com → Settings → API Keys\n\nIf self-hosted, use your instance URL for `LANGFUSE_HOST` and create keys there.\n\n**Step 2:** Install MCP (pick one):\n\n```bash\n# Claude Code (project-scoped, shared via .mcp.json)\nclaude mcp add \\\n  --scope project \\\n  --env LANGFUSE_PUBLIC_KEY=pk-... \\\n  --env LANGFUSE_SECRET_KEY=sk-... \\\n  --env LANGFUSE_HOST=https://cloud.langfuse.com \\\n  langfuse -- uvx --python 3.11 langfuse-mcp\n\n# Codex CLI (user-scoped, stored in ~/.codex/config.toml)\ncodex mcp add langfuse \\\n  --env LANGFUSE_PUBLIC_KEY=pk-... \\\n  --env LANGFUSE_SECRET_KEY=sk-... \\\n  --env LANGFUSE_HOST=https://cloud.langfuse.com \\\n  -- uvx --python 3.11 langfuse-mcp\n```\n\n**Step 3:** Restart CLI, verify with `/mcp` (Claude) or `codex mcp list` (Codex)\n\n**Step 4:** Test: `fetch_traces(age=60)`\n\n### Read-Only Mode\n\nFor safer observability without risk of modifying prompts or datasets, enable read-only mode:\n\n```bash\n# CLI flag\nlangfuse-mcp --read-only\n\n# Or environment variable\nLANGFUSE_MCP_READ_ONLY=true\n```\n\nThis disables write tools: `create_text_prompt`, `create_chat_prompt`, `update_prompt_labels`, `create_dataset`, `create_dataset_item`, `delete_dataset_item`.\n\nFor manual `.mcp.json` setup or troubleshooting, see `references/setup.md`.\n\n---\n\n## Playbooks\n\n### \"Where are the errors?\"\n\n```\nfind_exceptions(age=1440, group_by=\"file\")\n```\n→ Shows error counts by file. Pick the worst offender.\n\n```\nfind_exceptions_in_file(filepath=\"src/ai/chat.py\", age=1440)\n```\n→ Lists specific exceptions. Grab a trace_id.\n\n```\nget_exception_details(trace_id=\"...\")\n```\n→ Full stacktrace and context.\n\n---\n\n### \"What happened in this interaction?\"\n\n```\nfetch_traces(age=60, user_id=\"...\")\n```\n→ Find the trace. Note the trace_id.\n\nIf you don''t know the user_id, start with:\n```\nfetch_traces(age=60)\n```\n\n```\nfetch_trace(trace_id=\"...\", include_observations=true)\n```\n→ See all LLM calls in the trace.\n\n```\nfetch_observation(observation_id=\"...\")\n```\n→ Inspect a specific generation''s input/output.\n\n---\n\n### \"Why is it slow?\"\n\n```\nfetch_observations(age=60, type=\"GENERATION\")\n```\n→ Find recent LLM calls. Look for high latency.\n\n```\nfetch_observation(observation_id=\"...\")\n```\n→ Check token counts, model, timing.\n\n---\n\n### \"What''s this user experiencing?\"\n\n```\nget_user_sessions(user_id=\"...\", age=1440)\n```\n→ List their sessions.\n\n```\nget_session_details(session_id=\"...\")\n```\n→ See all traces in the session.\n\n---\n\n### \"Manage datasets\"\n\n```\nlist_datasets()\n```\n→ See all datasets.\n\n```\nget_dataset(name=\"evaluation-set-v1\")\n```\n→ Get dataset details.\n\n```\nlist_dataset_items(dataset_name=\"evaluation-set-v1\", page=1, limit=10)\n```\n→ Browse items in the dataset.\n\n```\ncreate_dataset(name=\"qa-test-cases\", description=\"QA evaluation set\")\n```\n→ Create a new dataset.\n\n```\ncreate_dataset_item(\n  dataset_name=\"qa-test-cases\",\n  input={\"question\": \"What is 2+2?\"},\n  expected_output={\"answer\": \"4\"}\n)\n```\n→ Add test cases.\n\n```\ncreate_dataset_item(\n  dataset_name=\"qa-test-cases\",\n  item_id=\"item_123\",\n  input={\"question\": \"What is 3+3?\"},\n  expected_output={\"answer\": \"6\"}\n)\n```\n→ Upsert: updates existing item by id or creates if missing.\n\n---\n\n### \"Manage prompts\"\n\n```\nlist_prompts()\n```\n→ See all prompts with labels.\n\n```\nget_prompt(name=\"...\", label=\"production\")\n```\n→ Fetch current production version.\n\n```\ncreate_text_prompt(name=\"...\", prompt=\"...\", labels=[\"staging\"])\n```\n→ Create new version in staging.\n\n```\nupdate_prompt_labels(name=\"...\", version=N, labels=[\"production\"])\n```\n→ Promote to production. (Rollback = re-apply label to older version)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool |\n|------|------|\n| List traces | `fetch_traces(age=N)` |\n| Get trace details | `fetch_trace(trace_id=\"...\", include_observations=true)` |\n| List LLM calls | `fetch_observations(age=N, type=\"GENERATION\")` |\n| Get observation | `fetch_observation(observation_id=\"...\")` |\n| Error count | `get_error_count(age=N)` |\n| Find exceptions | `find_exceptions(age=N, group_by=\"file\")` |\n| List sessions | `fetch_sessions(age=N)` |\n| User sessions | `get_user_sessions(user_id=\"...\", age=N)` |\n| List prompts | `list_prompts()` |\n| Get prompt | `get_prompt(name=\"...\", label=\"production\")` |\n| List datasets | `list_datasets()` |\n| Get dataset | `get_dataset(name=\"...\")` |\n| List dataset items | `list_dataset_items(dataset_name=\"...\", limit=N)` |\n| Create/update dataset item | `create_dataset_item(dataset_name=\"...\", item_id=\"...\")` |\n\n`age` = minutes to look back (max 10080 = 7 days)\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- `references/tool-reference.md` — Full parameter docs, filter semantics, response schemas\n- `references/setup.md` — Manual setup, troubleshooting, advanced configuration\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:26:07.865Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced observability and debugging capabilities through Langfuse trace data analysis.","zh":"非常适合需要通过 Langfuse 追踪数据分析来实现高级可观测性和调试功能的 AI Agent。","ja":"Langfuse トレースデータ分析を通じて高度な可観測性とデバッグ機能を必要とする AI Agent に最適です。","ko":"Langfuse 추적 데이터 분석을 통해 고급 가시성 및 디버깅 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de observabilidad y depuración a través del análisis de datos de seguimiento de Langfuse.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant des fonctionnalités avancées d''observabilité et de débogage via l''analyse des données de trace de Langfuse.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte Überwachungs- und Debugging-Funktionen durch Langfuse-Trace-Datenanalyse benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de observabilidade e depuração através da análise de dados de trace do Langfuse.","ru":"Идеально подходит для ИИ-агентов, которым требуются расширенные возможности наблюдаемости и отладки с помощью анализа данных трассировки Langfuse.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة للملاحظة وتصحيح الأخطاء من خلال تحليل بيانات تتبع Langfuse."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to query Langfuse trace data for enhanced debugging and observability, utilizing the Model Context Protocol (MCP) server and supporting protocols like API Keys for secure access.","zh":"该技能利用 Model Context Protocol (MCP) 服务器，并支持 API Keys 等协议以实现安全访问，使 Agent 能够查询 Langfuse 追踪数据以增强调试和可观测性。","ja":"Model Context Protocol (MCP) サーバーを利用し、安全なアクセスのための API Keys などのプロトコルをサポートすることで、エージェントがデバッグと可観測性を強化するために Langfuse トレースデータをクエリすることを可能にします。","ko":"Model Context Protocol (MCP) 서버를 활용하고 안전한 접근을 위한 API Keys와 같은 프로토콜을 지원하여, 에이전트가 향상된 디버깅 및 가시성을 위해 Langfuse 추적 데이터를 쿼리할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a consultar los datos de seguimiento de Langfuse para una depuración y observabilidad mejoradas, utilizando el servidor de protocolo de contexto de modelo (MCP) y protocolos compatibles como API Keys para un acceso seguro.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interroger les données de trace de Langfuse pour une débogage et une observabilité améliorées, en utilisant le serveur de protocole de contexte de modèle (MCP) et des protocoles compatibles comme les clés API pour un accès sécurisé.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Langfuse-Trace-Daten für erweiterte Debugging- und Überwachungsfunktionen abzufragen, unter Nutzung des Model Context Protocol (MCP)-Servers und unterstützender Protokolle wie API-Schlüssel für sicheren Zugriff.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a consultar dados de trace do Langfuse para uma depuração e observabilidade aprimoradas, utilizando o servidor Model Context Protocol (MCP) e suportando protocolos como API Keys para acesso seguro.","ru":"Позволяет агентам запрашивать данные трассировки Langfuse для улучшенной отладки и наблюдаемости, используя сервер Model Context Protocol (MCP) и поддерживая такие протоколы, как API Keys для безопасного доступа.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من الاستعلام عن بيانات تتبع Langfuse لتعزيز تصحيح الأخطاء والملاحظة، باستخدام خادم Model Context Protocol (MCP) ودعم بروتوكولات مثل مفاتيح API للوصول الآمن."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging AI system exceptions","Analyzing performance bottlenecks","Evaluating dataset quality and integrity"],"zh":["调试 AI 系统异常","分析性能瓶颈","评估数据集质量和完整性"],"ja":["AI システム例外のデバッグ","パフォーマンスボトルネックの分析","データセットの品質と完全性の評価"],"ko":["AI 시스템 예외 디버깅","성능 병목 현상 분석","데이터셋 품질 및 무결성 평가"],"es":["Depuración de excepciones del sistema de IA","Análisis de cuellos de botella de rendimiento","Evaluación de la calidad y la integridad del conjunto de datos"],"fr":["Débogage des exceptions du système d''IA","Analyse des goulets d''étranglement de performance","Évaluation de la qualité et de l''intégrité du jeu de données"],"de":["Debuggen von KI-Systemausnahmen","Analyse von Leistungsengpässen","Bewertung der Datenqualität und -integrität"],"pt":["Depuração de exceções do sistema de IA","Análise de gargalos de desempenho","Avaliação da qualidade e integridade do conjunto de dados"],"ru":["Отладка исключений в ИИ-системах","Анализ узких мест производительности","Оценка качества и целостности набора данных"],"ar":["تصحيح استثناءات نظام الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحليل اختناقات الأداء","تقييم جودة وسلامة مجموعة البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Langfuse API credentials or self-hosted instance","Dependent on MCP server installation and configuration"],"zh":["需要 Langfuse API 凭证或自托管实例","依赖于 MCP 服务器的安装和配置"],"ja":["Langfuse API 資格情報またはセルフホスト型インスタンスが必要","MCP サーバーのインストールと設定に依存"],"ko":["Langfuse API 자격 증명 또는 자체 호스팅 인스턴스 필요","MCP 서버 설치 및 구성에 종속적"],"es":["Requiere credenciales de API de Langfuse o instancia autónoma","Dependiente de la instalación y configuración del servidor MCP"],"fr":["Nécessite des informations d''identification d''API Langfuse ou une instance autonome","Dépend de l''installation et de la configuration du serveur MCP"],"de":["Benötigt Langfuse-API-Zugangsdaten oder selbstgehostete Instanz","Abhängig von der Installation und Konfiguration des MCP-Servers"],"pt":["Requer credenciais de API do Langfuse ou uma instância auto-hospedada","Dependente da instalação e configuração do servidor MCP"],"ru":["Требует учетных данных API Langfuse или самостоятельно размещенного экземпляра","Зависит от установки и настройки сервера MCP"],"ar":["يتطلب بيانات اعتماد API لـ Langfuse أو نسخة مُدارة ذاتيًا","يعتمد على تثبيت وتكوين خادم MCP"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"01be3566e99305c2ea1bd4b21e364d4c07e74bf2e9c19c276d7d5e37b0008756","qualityScore":50}');
