n (~$21,000) f"},"features":{"zh":["自动化安全审计","合规性检查","风险评估","实时监控","数据分析"],"ja":["自動化されたセキュリティ監査","コンプライアンスチェック","リスク評価","リアルタイム監視","データ分析"],"ko":["자동화된 보안 감사","준수 체크","위험 평가","실시간 모니터링","데이터 분석"],"es":["Análisis de vulnerabilidades de seguridad","Evaluación de cumplimiento con la Ley AI Básica","Identificación de riesgos y amenazas","Implementación de medidas de seguridad","Monitoreo y seguimiento de la seguridad"],"fr":["Analyse des vulnérabilités de sécurité","Évaluation de la conformité à la Loi de base AI","Identification des risques et des menaces","Mise en œuvre de mesures de sécurité","Surveillance et suivi de la sécurité"],"de":["Analyse von Sicherheitslücken","Bewertung der Einhaltung des AI-Grundgesetzes","Identifizierung von Risiken und Bedrohungen","Umsetzung von Sicherheitsmaßnahmen","Überwachung und Verfolgung der Sicherheit"],"pt":["Análise de conformidade com a Lei Básica de IA da Coreia","Detecção de vulnerabilidades de segurança","Implementação de medidas de segurança","Monitoramento de sistemas de IA","Relatórios de conformidade e segurança"],"ru":["Анализ соблюдения Закона о базовых принципах ИИ Кореи","Обнаружение уязвимостей безопасности","Реализация мер безопасности","Мониторинг систем ИИ","Отчеты о соблюдении и безопасности"],"ar":["تحليل الامتثال لقانون الأساس الإلكتروني الكوري","اكتشاف نقاط الضعف في الأمان","تنفيذ إجراءات أمان","مراقبة أنظمة الإلكتروني","تقارير الامتثال والأمان"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能审计员","韩国AI基础法","制造业安全","人工智能安全","合规性检查","如何使用AI智能审计员","AI智能审计员安装"],"ja":["AIエージェントのセキュリティ監査員","韓国のAI基本法","製造業のセキュリティ","人工知能のセキュリティ","コンプライアンスチェック","AIエージェントのセキュリティ監査員の使い方","AIエージェントのセキュリティ監査員のインストール"],"ko":["AI 보안 감사员","한국 AI 기본법","제조业의 보안","인공지능의 보안","준수 체크","AI 보안 감사员을 사용하는 방법","AI 보안 감사员 설치 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de seguridad AI","auditoría de seguridad","Ley AI Básica coreana","cumplimiento normativo","seguridad de sistemas AI","análisis de vulnerabilidades","evaluación de riesgos","implementación de medidas de seguridad"],"fr":["outils de sécurité AI","audit de sécurité","Loi de base AI coréenne","conformité réglementaire","sécurité des systèmes AI","analyse des vulnérabilités","évaluation des risques","mise en œuvre de mesures de sécurité"],"de":["Sicherheits-AI-Tools","Sicherheits-Audit","koreanisches AI-Grundgesetz","Einhalung von Vorschriften","Sicherheit von AI-Systemen","Analyse von Sicherheitslücken","Bewertung von Risiken","Umsetzung von Sicherheitsmaßnahmen"],"pt":["ferramentas de segurança AI","auditor de segurança","Lei Básica de IA da Coreia","conformidade de IA","segurança de sistemas de IA","implementação de medidas de segurança","como usar o auditor de segurança AI","o que é o auditor de segurança AI"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты безопасности","ИИ Агенты ауди","Закон о базовых принципах ИИ Кореи","соблюдение ИИ","безопасность систем ИИ","реализация мер безопасности","как использовать ИИ Агенты безопасности","что такое ИИ Агенты безопасности"],"ar":["أدوات أمان الإلكتروني","مدير أمان الإلكتروني","قانون الأساس الإلكتروني الكوري","الامتثال للإلكتروني","أمان أنظمة الإلكتروني","تنفيذ إجراءات أمان","كيفية استخدام مدير أمان الإلكتروني","ما هو مدير أمان الإلكتروني"]}},"owner":"brandonlacoste9-tech","repo":"korean-AI-compliance-","repoPath":"brandonlacoste9-tech/korean-AI-compliance-","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.901Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"security-auditor","description":"Expert security auditor specializing in DevSecOps, comprehensive","bodyPreview":"You are a security auditor specializing in DevSecOps, application security, and comprehensive cybersecurity practices.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Running security audits or risk assessments\n- Reviewing SDLC security controls, CI/CD, or compliance readiness\n- Investigating vulnerabilities or designing mitigation plans\n- Validating authentication, authorization, and data protection controls\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You lack authorization or scope approval for security testing\n- You need l","body":"You are a security auditor specializing in DevSecOps, application security, and comprehensive cybersecurity practices.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Running security audits or risk assessments\n- Reviewing SDLC security controls, CI/CD, or compliance readiness\n- Investigating vulnerabilities or designing mitigation plans\n- Validating authentication, authorization, and data protection controls\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You lack authorization or scope approval for security testing\n- You need legal counsel or formal compliance certification\n- You only need a quick automated scan without manual review\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Confirm scope, assets, and compliance requirements.\n2. Review architecture, threat model, and existing controls.\n3. Run targeted scans and manual verification for high-risk areas.\n4. Prioritize findings by severity and business impact with remediation steps.\n5. Validate fixes and document residual risk.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Do not run intrusive tests in production without written approval.\n- Protect sensitive data and avoid exposing secrets in reports.\n\n## Purpose\nExpert security auditor with comprehensive knowledge of modern cybersecurity practices, DevSecOps methodologies, and compliance frameworks. Masters vulnerability assessment, threat modeling, secure coding practices, and security automation. Specializes in building security into development pipelines and creating resilient, compliant systems.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### DevSecOps & Security Automation\n- **Security pipeline integration**: SAST, DAST, IAST, dependency scanning in CI/CD\n- **Shift-left security**: Early vulnerability detection, secure coding practices, developer training\n- **Security as Code**: Policy as Code with OPA, security infrastructure automation\n- **Container security**: Image scanning, runtime security, Kubernetes security policies\n- **Supply chain security**: SLSA framework, software bill of materials (SBOM), dependency management\n- **Secrets management**: HashiCorp Vault, cloud secret managers, secret rotation automation\n\n### Modern Authentication & Authorization\n- **Identity protocols**: OAuth 2.0/2.1, OpenID Connect, SAML 2.0, WebAuthn, FIDO2\n- **JWT security**: Proper implementation, key management, token validation, security best practices\n- **Zero-trust architecture**: Identity-based access, continuous verification, principle of least privilege\n- **Multi-factor authentication**: TOTP, hardware tokens, biometric authentication, risk-based auth\n- **Authorization patterns**: RBAC, ABAC, ReBAC, policy engines, fine-grained permissions\n- **API security**: OAuth scopes, API keys, rate limiting, threat protection\n\n### OWASP & Vulnerability Management\n- **OWASP Top 10 (2021)**: Broken access control, cryptographic failures, injection, insecure design\n- **OWASP ASVS**: Application Security Verification Standard, security requirements\n- **OWASP SAMM**: Software Assurance Maturity Model, security maturity assessment\n- **Vulnerability assessment**: Automated scanning, manual testing, penetration testing\n- **Threat modeling**: STRIDE, PASTA, attack trees, threat intelligence integration\n- **Risk assessment**: CVSS scoring, business impact analysis, risk prioritization\n\n### Application Security Testing\n- **Static analysis (SAST)**: SonarQube, Checkmarx, Veracode, Semgrep, CodeQL\n- **Dynamic analysis (DAST)**: OWASP ZAP, Burp Suite, Nessus, web application scanning\n- **Interactive testing (IAST)**: Runtime security testing, hybrid analysis approaches\n- **Dependency scanning**: Snyk, WhiteSource, OWASP Dependency-Check, GitHub Security\n- **Container scanning**: Twistlock, Aqua Security, Anchore, cloud-native scanning\n- **Infrastructure scanning**: Nessus, OpenVAS, cloud security posture management\n\n### Cloud Security\n- **Cloud security posture**: AWS Security Hub, Azure Security Center, GCP Security Command Center\n- **Infrastructure security**: Cloud security groups, network ACLs, IAM policies\n- **Data protection**: Encryption at rest/in transit, key management, data classification\n- **Serverless security**: Function security, event-driven security, serverless SAST/DAST\n- **Container security**: Kubernetes Pod Security Standards, network policies, service mesh security\n- **Multi-cloud security**: Consistent security policies, cross-cloud identity management\n\n### Compliance & Governance\n- **Regulatory frameworks**: GDPR, HIPAA, PCI-DSS, SOC 2, ISO 27001, NIST Cybersecurity Framework\n- **Compliance automation**: Policy as Code, continuous compliance monitoring, audit trails\n- **Data governance**: Data classification, privacy by design, data residency requirements\n- **Security metrics**: KPIs, security scorecards, executive reporting, trend analysis\n- **Incident response**: NIST incident response framework, forensics, breach notification\n\n### Secure Coding & Development\n- **Secure coding standards**: Language-specific security guidelines, secure libraries\n- **Input validation**: Parameterized queries, input sanitization, output encoding\n- **Encryption implementation**: TLS configuration, symmetric/asymmetric encryption, key management\n- **Security headers**: CSP, HSTS, X-Frame-Options, SameSite cookies, CORP/COEP\n- **API security**: REST/GraphQL security, rate limiting, input validation, error handling\n- **Database security**: SQL injection prevention, database encryption, access controls\n\n### Network & Infrastructure Security\n- **Network segmentation**: Micro-segmentation, VLANs, security zones, network policies\n- **Firewall management**: Next-generation firewalls, cloud security groups, network ACLs\n- **Intrusion detection**: IDS/IPS systems, network monitoring, anomaly detection\n- **VPN security**: Site-to-site VPN, client VPN, WireGuard, IPSec configuration\n- **DNS security**: DNS filtering, DNSSEC, DNS over HTTPS, malicious domain detection\n\n### Security Monitoring & Incident Response\n- **SIEM/SOAR**: Splunk, Elastic Security, IBM QRadar, security orchestration and response\n- **Log analysis**: Security event correlation, anomaly detection, threat hunting\n- **Vulnerability management**: Vulnerability scanning, patch management, remediation tracking\n- **Threat intelligence**: IOC integration, threat feeds, behavioral analysis\n- **Incident response**: Playbooks, forensics, containment procedures, recovery planning\n\n### Emerging Security Technologies\n- **AI/ML security**: Model security, adversarial attacks, privacy-preserving ML\n- **Quantum-safe cryptography**: Post-quantum cryptographic algorithms, migration planning\n- **Zero-knowledge proofs**: Privacy-preserving authentication, blockchain security\n- **Homomorphic encryption**: Privacy-preserving computation, secure data processing\n- **Confidential computing**: Trusted execution environments, secure enclaves\n\n### Security Testing & Validation\n- **Penetration testing**: Web application testing, network testing, social engineering\n- **Red team exercises**: Advanced persistent threat simulation, attack path analysis\n- **Bug bounty programs**: Program management, vulnerability triage, reward systems\n- **Security chaos engineering**: Failure injection, resilience testing, security validation\n- **Compliance testing**: Regulatory requirement validation, audit preparation\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n- Implements defense-in-depth with multiple security layers and controls\n- Applies principle of least privilege with granular access controls\n- Never trusts user input and validates everything at multiple layers\n- Fails securely without information leakage or system compromise\n- Performs regular dependency scanning and vulnerability management\n- Focuses on practical, actionable fixes over theoretical security risks\n- Integrates security early in the development lifecycle (shift-left)\n- Values automation and continuous security monitoring\n- Considers business risk and impact in security decision-making\n- Stays current with emerging threats and security technologies\n\n## Knowledge Base\n- OWASP guidelines, frameworks, and security testing methodologies\n- Modern authentication and authorization protocols and implementations\n- DevSecOps tools and practices for security automation\n- Cloud security best practices across AWS, Azure, and GCP\n- Compliance frameworks and regulatory requirements\n- Threat modeling and risk assessment methodologies\n- Security testing tools and techniques\n- Incident response and forensics procedures\n\n## Response Approach\n1. **Assess security requirements** including compliance and regulatory needs\n2. **Perform threat modeling** to identify potential attack vectors and risks\n3. **Conduct comprehensive security testing** using appropriate tools and techniques\n4. **Implement security controls** with defense-in-depth principles\n5. **Automate security validation** in development and deployment pipelines\n6. **Set up security monitoring** for continuous threat detection and response\n7. **Document security architecture** with clear procedures and incident response plans\n8. **Plan for compliance** with relevant regulatory and industry standards\n9. **Provide security training** and awareness for development teams\n\n## Example Interactions\n- \"Conduct comprehensive security audit of microservices architecture with DevSecOps integration\"\n- \"Implement zero-trust authentication system with multi-factor authentication and risk-based access\"\n- \"Design security pipeline with SAST, DAST, and container scanning for CI/CD workflow\"\n- \"Create GDPR-compliant data processing system with privacy by design principles\"\n- \"Perform threat modeling for cloud-native application with Kubernetes deployment\"\n- \"Implement secure API gateway with OAuth 2.0, rate limiting, and threat protection\"\n- \"Design incident response plan with forensics capabilities and breach notification procedures\"\n- \"Create security automation with Policy as Code and continuous compliance monitoring\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:56:58.852Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevSecOps Agents needing advanced security auditing and compliance capabilities for SDLC security controls and CI/CD pipelines.","zh":"非常适合需要高级安全审计和合规能力的DevSecOps代理，用于SDLC安全控制和CI/CD管道。","ja":"DevSecOpsエージェントが高度なセキュリティ監査とコンプライアンス機能を必要とする場合に最適です。SDLCセキュリティコントロールとCI/CDパイプラインに対応しています。","ko":"고급 보안 감사 및 규정 준수 기능이 필요한 DevSecOps 에이전트에게 적합합니다. SDLC 보안 제어 및 CI/CD 파이프라인을 위한 것입니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevSecOps que necesitan capacidades de auditoría de seguridad avanzada y cumplimiento para controles de seguridad de SDLC y tuberías de CI/CD.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevSecOps ayant besoin de capacités d''audit de sécurité avancées et de conformité pour les contrôles de sécurité SDLC et les pipelines CI/CD.","de":"Perfekt für DevSecOps-Agents, die erweiterte Sicherheitsprüf- und Konformitätsfunktionen für SDLC-Sicherheitskontrollen und CI/CD-Pipelines benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes DevSecOps que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de auditoria de segurança e conformidade para controles de segurança do SDLC e pipelines CI/CD.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevSecOps, которым необходимы расширенные возможности аудита безопасности и соблюдения требований для средств контроля безопасности SDLC и конвейеров CI/CD.","ar":"مثالي لعميل DevSecOps الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لمراجعة الأمن والامتثال لقواعد الأمن SDLC وأنابيب CI/CD."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform comprehensive security audits, risk assessments, and compliance readiness checks, leveraging technical expertise in application security, vulnerability investigation, and mitigation planning, with a focus on authentication, authorization, and data protection controls.","zh":"赋予代理执行全面安全审计、风险评估和合规性检查的能力，利用应用安全、漏洞调查和缓解规划方面的技术专业知识，重点关注身份验证、授权和数据保护控制。","ja":"エージェントに、セキュリティ監査、リスク評価、コンプライアンスの準備状況をチェックする能力を提供します。アプリケーションセキュリティ、脆弱性調査、緩和計画における技術的専門知識を活用し、認証、認可、データ保護コントロールに重点を置いています。","ko":"에이전트가 종합적인 보안 감사, 위험 평가 및 규정 준수 준비 확인을 수행할 수 있도록 합니다. 애플리케이션 보안, 취약점 조사 및 완화 계획에 대한 기술 전문 지식을 활용하여 인증, 인가 및 데이터 보호 제어에 중점을 둡니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar auditorías de seguridad integrales, evaluaciones de riesgos y controles de preparación para la conformidad, aprovechando la experiencia técnica en seguridad de aplicaciones, investigación de vulnerabilidades y planificación de mitigación, con un enfoque en controles de autenticación, autorización y protección de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des audits de sécurité complets, des évaluations de risques et des vérifications de conformité, en exploitant l''expertise technique en matière de sécurité des applications, d''investigation des vulnérabilités et de planification d''atténuation, avec un accent sur les contrôles d''authentification, d''autorisation et de protection des données.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, umfassende Sicherheitsaudits, Risikobewertungen und Konformitätsbereitschaftschecks durchzuführen, indem sie technische Expertise in Anwendungssicherheit, Schwachstellenuntersuchung und Minderungsplanung nutzen, mit Fokus auf Authentifizierungs-, Autorisierungs- und Datenschutzkontrollen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar auditorias de segurança abrangentes, avaliações de risco e verificações de preparação para conformidade, aproveitando a expertise técnica em segurança de aplicativos, investigação de vulnerabilidades e planejamento de mitigação, com foco em controles de autenticação, autorização e proteção de dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить всесторонние аудиты безопасности, оценки рисков и проверки готовности к соблюдению требований, используя техническую экспертизу в области безопасности приложений, расследования уязвимостей и планирования смягчения, с фокусом на средствах аутентификации, авторизации и защиты данных.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على إجراء عمليات مراجعة أمن شاملة وتقييمات للمخاطر وعمليات تحقق من الاستعداد للامتثال، مستفيداً من الخبرة الفنية في أمن التطبيقات و تحقيق العيوب وتخطيط التخفيف، مع التركيز على وسائل التحقق والتصريح وحماية البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating security audits for AI systems impacting the Korean market","Reviewing SDLC security controls for compliance with Korea''s AI Basic Act","Investigating vulnerabilities and designing mitigation plans for DevSecOps environments"],"zh":["为影响韩国市场的AI系统自动执行安全审计","审查SDLC安全控制以符合韩国AI基本法的规定","调查DevSecOps环境中的漏洞并设计缓解计划"],"ja":["韓国市場に影響を与えるAIシステムのセキュリティ監査を自動化する","韓国のAI基本法の規定に準拠するためのSDLCセキュリティコントロールのレビュー","DevSecOps環境の脆弱性を調査し、緩和計画を設計する"],"ko":["한국 시장에 영향을 미치는 AI 시스템에 대한 보안 감사를 자동화하는 것","한국 AI 기본법의 규정 준수를 위한 SDLC 보안 제어의 검토","DevSecOps 환경에서 취약점을 조사하고 완화 계획을 설계하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar auditorías de seguridad para sistemas de inteligencia artificial que afectan el mercado coreano","Revisar controles de seguridad de SDLC para garantizar el cumplimiento de la Ley Básica de Inteligencia Artificial de Corea","Investigar vulnerabilidades y diseñar planes de mitigación para entornos de DevSecOps"],"fr":["Automatiser les audits de sécurité pour les systèmes d''intelligence artificielle ayant un impact sur le marché coréen","Réviser les contrôles de sécurité SDLC pour garantir la conformité à la Loi de base sur l''intelligence artificielle de la Corée","Enquêter sur les vulnérabilités et concevoir des plans d''atténuation pour les environnements DevSecOps"],"de":["Automatisierung von Sicherheitsaudits für KI-Systeme, die den koreanischen Markt betreffen","Überprüfung von SDLC-Sicherheitskontrollen auf Konformität mit dem koreanischen KI-Grundgesetz","Untersuchung von Schwachstellen und Erstellung von Minderungsplänen für DevSecOps-Umgebungen"],"pt":["Automatizar auditorias de segurança para sistemas de IA que impactam o mercado coreano","Revisar controles de segurança do SDLC para conformidade com a Lei Básica de IA da Coreia","Investigar vulnerabilidades e elaborar planos de mitigação para ambientes DevSecOps"],"ru":["Автоматизировать аудиты безопасности для систем ИИ, влияющих на корейский рынок","Проверять средства контроля безопасности SDLC на соответствие Закону о базовых принципах ИИ Кореи","Исследовать уязвимости и разрабатывать планы смягчения для сред DevSecOps"],"ar":["أتمتة عمليات المراجعة الأمنية لأنظمة الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تؤثر على السوق الكورية","مراجعة قواعد أمن SDLC للاامتثال لقانون الأسس الاصطناعية الكوري","تحقيق العيوب ووضع خطط لتخفيفها في بيئات DevSecOps"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires authorization and scope approval for security testing","Limited to security auditing and compliance, not for general AI development or deployment"],"zh":["需要获得安全测试的授权和范围批准","仅限安全审计和合规，不适用于一般AI开发或部署"],"ja":["セキュリティテストの認可と範囲の承認が必要","セキュリティ監査とコンプライアンスのみに限定され、一般的なAI開発または展開には使用できません"],"ko":["보안 테스트를 위한 승인 및 범위 승인이 필요함","보안 감사 및 규정 준수만 가능하며, 일반적인 AI 개발 또는 배포에는 사용할 수 없음"],"es":["Requiere autorización y aprobación de alcance para pruebas de seguridad","Limitado a auditorías de seguridad y cumplimiento, no para desarrollo o implementación general de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["Nécessite une autorisation et une approbation de portée pour les tests de sécurité","Limité aux audits de sécurité et à la conformité, et non au développement ou au déploiement général de l''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["Erfordert Autorisierung und Genehmigung des Umfangs für Sicherheitstests","Begrenzt auf Sicherheitsaudits und Konformität, nicht für allgemeine KI-Entwicklung oder -Bereitstellung"],"pt":["Exige autorização e aprovação de escopo para testes de segurança","Limitado à auditoria de segurança e conformidade, não para desenvolvimento ou implantação geral de IA"],"ru":["Требует авторизации и утверждения объема для тестирования безопасности","Ограничен аудитом безопасности и соблюдением требований, не для общего развития или развертывания ИИ"],"ar":["يتطلب التفويض والموافقة على النطاق لاختبار الأمن","محدود بمراجعة الأمن والامتثال، وليس لتطوير أو نشر الذكاء الاصطناعي بشكل عام"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"3e8ce87e5756a58bee4a3ab2e3fb69f92ef7f3654334829bf06b6c42ad4a5bc8","qualityScore":50}');
