dart-contribute","dart-contribute vs PhysX","Installation von dart-contribute","Konfigurationsanleitung für dart-contribute","Roboter-Entwicklung mit dart-contribute","Simulierung von Animationen mit dart-contribute"],"pt":["ferramentas de física","C++20","robótica","animação","detecção de colisão","Python bindings"],"ru":["физические движки","C++20","роботика","анимация","детекция столкновений","Python-bindings"],"ar":["أدوات فيزياء","C++20","روبوتيكا","أニメ","كشف الاصطدامات","ربطات Python"]}},"owner":"dartsim","repo":"dart","repoPath":"dartsim/dart","stars":1058,"forks":296,"updatedAt":"2026-02-22T15:46:08Z","topics":["collision-detection","computer-animation","constraint-dynamics","dartpy","dynamics","gazebo","inverse-kinematics","kinematics","lie-group","mjcf","multibody-dynamics","physics-engine","python-bindings","rigid-body-dynamics","robotics","sdf","simulation","urdf"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dart-contribute","description":"DART contribution workflow - branching, PRs, code review, dual-PR for bugfixes","bodyPreview":"<!-- AUTO-GENERATED FILE - DO NOT EDIT MANUALLY -->\n<!-- Source: .claude/skills/dart-contribute/SKILL.md -->\n<!-- Sync script: scripts/sync_ai_commands.py -->\n<!-- Run `pixi run sync-ai-commands` to update -->\n\n# DART Contribution Workflow\n\nLoad this skill when contributing code to DART.\n\n## Full Documentation\n\nFor complete guide: `docs/onboarding/contributing.md`\n\nFor code style: `docs/onboarding/code-style.md`\n\n## Branch Naming\n\n- `feature/<topic>` - New features\n- `fix/<topic>` - Bug fixes\n-","body":"<!-- AUTO-GENERATED FILE - DO NOT EDIT MANUALLY -->\n<!-- Source: .claude/skills/dart-contribute/SKILL.md -->\n<!-- Sync script: scripts/sync_ai_commands.py -->\n<!-- Run `pixi run sync-ai-commands` to update -->\n\n# DART Contribution Workflow\n\nLoad this skill when contributing code to DART.\n\n## Full Documentation\n\nFor complete guide: `docs/onboarding/contributing.md`\n\nFor code style: `docs/onboarding/code-style.md`\n\n## Branch Naming\n\n- `feature/<topic>` - New features\n- `fix/<topic>` - Bug fixes\n- `refactor/<topic>` - Refactoring\n- `docs/<topic>` - Documentation\n\n## PR Workflow\n\n```bash\n# Create branch\ngit checkout -b <type>/<topic> origin/main\n\n# Make changes, then\npixi run lint\npixi run test-all\n\n# Push and create PR\ngit push -u origin HEAD\ngh pr create --draft --milestone \"DART 7.0\"\n```\n\nRule of thumb: run `pixi run lint` before committing so auto-fixes are included.\n\nUse `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md` and ensure the PR description covers Summary, Motivation, Changes, Testing, Breaking Changes, and Related Issues.\n\n## Milestones (Required)\n\nAlways set a milestone when creating PRs:\n\n| Target Branch  | Milestone                     |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `main`         | `DART 7.0` (or next major)    |\n| `release-6.16` | `DART 6.16.x` (current patch) |\n\n```bash\n# Set milestone on existing PR\ngh pr edit <PR#> --milestone \"DART 7.0\"\n\n# List available milestones\ngh api repos/dartsim/dart/milestones --jq ''.[] | .title''\n```\n\n## CRITICAL: Bug Fix Dual-PR\n\nBug fixes require PRs to **BOTH** branches:\n\n1. **`release-6.16`** - Current release\n2. **`main`** - Next release\n\nSteps:\n\n1. Fix on `release-6.16` first\n2. Cherry-pick to `main`\n3. Create separate PRs for each\n\n## CHANGELOG (After PR Created)\n\nAfter creating a PR, check if CHANGELOG.md needs updating:\n\n| Change Type                      | Update CHANGELOG?                    |\n| -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| Bug fixes                        | ✅ Yes                               |\n| New features                     | ✅ Yes                               |\n| Breaking changes                 | ✅ Yes (in Breaking Changes section) |\n| Documentation improvements       | ✅ Yes (in Tooling and Docs)         |\n| CI/tooling changes               | ✅ Yes (in Tooling and Docs)         |\n| Refactoring (no behavior change) | ⚠️ Maybe (if significant)            |\n| Dependency bumps                 | ⚠️ Maybe (if user-facing)            |\n| Typo fixes                       | ❌ No                                |\n\nFormat: `- Description. ([#PR](https://github.com/dartsim/dart/pull/PR))`\n\n```bash\n# Example entry in CHANGELOG.md under appropriate section:\n- Added AI-native documentation with AGENTS.md and module-specific guides. ([#2446](https://github.com/dartsim/dart/pull/2446))\n```\n\n## Code Review\n\n- Address all feedback\n- Keep changes minimal\n- Update tests if behavior changed\n- Run full validation before pushing fixes\n\n## CI Loop\n\n```bash\ngh run watch <RUN_ID> --interval 30\n```\n\nFix failures until green.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:27:32.972Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Robotics and Animation Agents requiring advanced physics engine integration with C++20 and Python bindings","zh":"非常适合需要与 C++20 和 Python 绑定进行高级物理引擎集成的机器人和动画代理","ja":"C++20 および Python バインディングとの高度な物理エンジン統合を必要とするロボティクスおよびアニメーションエージェントに最適","ko":"C++20 및 Python 바인딩과의 고급 물리 엔진 통합이 필요한 로봇공학 및 애니메이션 에이전트에 이상적","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Robótica y Animación que requieren una integración avanzada del motor de física con C++20 y enlaces de Python","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de robotique et d''animation nécessitant une intégration avancée du moteur de physique avec C++20 et des liaisons Python","de":"Ideal für Roboter- und Animationsagenten, die eine erweiterte Physik-Engine-Integration mit C++20 und Python-Bindings erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes de Robótica e Animação que exigem integração avançada do motor de física com C++20 e Python bindings","ru":"Идеально для роботы и анимации агентов, требующих продвинутой интеграции физического движка с C++20 и Python bindings","ar":"مثالية لوكلاء الروبوتات والرسوم المتحركة الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج محرك فيزيائي متقدم مع C++20 و Python bindings"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to contribute high-quality code to DART, leveraging collision and constraints features, while adhering to strict code style guidelines and branch naming conventions like ''feature/<topic>'' and ''fix/<topic>''","zh":"使代理能够利用碰撞和约束功能，同时遵守严格的代码风格指南和 ''feature/<topic>'' 及 ''fix/<topic>'' 等分支命名约定，为 DART 贡献高质量的代码","ja":"衝突検出と制約機能を活用し、''feature/<topic>'' や ''fix/<topic>'' などの厳格なコードスタイルガイドラインとブランチ命名規則に従いながら、エージェントが DART に高品質なコードを貢献することを可能にする","ko":"엄격한 코드 스타일 가이드라인 및 ''feature/<topic>'' 및 ''fix/<topic>''과 같은 브랜치 명명 규칙을 준수하면서 충돌 및 제약 조건 기능을 활용하여 DART에 고품질 코드를 기여할 수 있도록 에이전트를 지원합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes contribuir con código de alta calidad a DART, aprovechando las características de colisión y restricciones, mientras se adhieren a estrictas pautas de estilo de código y convenciones de nomenclatura de ramas como ''feature/<topic>'' y ''fix/<topic>''","fr":"Permet aux agents de contribuer du code de haute qualité à DART, en exploitant les fonctionnalités de collision et de contraintes, tout en respectant des directives de style de code et des conventions de nommage de branche strictes comme ''feature/<topic>'' et ''fix/<topic>''","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, hochwertigen Code zu DART beizutragen, indem sie die Kollisions- und Einschränkungsmerkmale nutzen, während sie sich an strenge Code-Stil-Richtlinien und Branch-Namenskonventionen wie ''feature/<topic>'' und ''fix/<topic>'' halten","pt":"Permite que os agentes contribuam com código de alta qualidade para o DART, aproveitando recursos de colisão e restrições, enquanto seguem diretrizes estritas de estilo de código e convenções de nomeação de branches como ''feature/<tópico>'' e ''fix/<tópico>''","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью вносить вклад в код высокого качества в DART, используя функции столкновения и ограничений, при этом придерживаясь строгих руководств по стилю кода и соглашений об именовании веток, таких как ''feature/<тема>'' и ''fix/<тема>''","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من المساهمة في كود عالي الجودة في DART، مس