s do Google Meet","Notificações personalizadas para reuniões","Integração com calendário do Google","Extensão fácil de instalar e configurar","Suporte a múltiplas contas do Google"],"ru":["Авто-вход на встречи в Google Meet","Персонализированные уведомления для встреч","Интеграция с календарем Google","Легкое расширение для установки и настройки","Поддержка нескольких аккаунтов Google"],"ar":["الدخول التلقائي إلى اجتماعات جوجل مييت","إشعارات مخصصة للاجتماعات","التكامل مع تقويم جوجل","امتداد سهل التثبيت والتهيئة","دعم حسابات جوجل متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用change-log AI工具","什么是AIエージェント","change-log AI工具安装","Google Meet自动加入","change-log AI工具设置指南","change-log AI工具替代品","change-log AI工具与其他工具比较"],"ja":["change-log AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントとは","change-log AIエージェントのインストール","Google Meet自動参加","change-log AIエージェントの設定ガイド","change-log AIエージェントの代替","change-log AIエージェントと他のツールの比較"],"ko":["change-log AI 도구 사용법","AI 에이전트是什么","change-log AI 도구 설치","구글 미트 자동 참여","change-log AI 도구 설정 가이드","change-log AI 도구 대체","change-log AI 도구와 다른 도구 비교"],"es":["herramientas de registro de cambios","cómo usar herramientas de inteligencia artificial","qué es un agente de inteligencia artificial","Meet alternative","Meet vs Zoom","instalar extensiones de navegador","guía de configuración de herramientas de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["outils de journal des modifications","comment utiliser les outils d''intelligence artificielle","qu''est-ce qu''un agent d''intelligence artificielle","Meet alternative","Meet vs Zoom","installer des extensions de navigateur","guide de configuration des outils d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["Änderungsprotokoll-Tools","wie man künstliche Intelligenz-Tools verwendet","was ist ein künstlicher Intelligenz-Agent","Meet-Alternative","Meet vs Zoom","Browser-Erweiterungen installieren","Anleitung zur Einrichtung von künstlicher Intelligenz-Tools"],"pt":["ferramenta de change-log","como usar agente de IA","o que é agente de IA","alternative ao Google Meet","guia de instalação do agente de IA","configuração do agente de IA","agente de IA para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["ИИ Агент Change-log","как использовать агента ИИ","что такое агент ИИ","альтернатива Google Meet","руководство по установке агента ИИ","настройка агента ИИ","агент ИИ для разработчиков"],"ar":["أداة سجل التغيير","كيفية استخدام وسيط الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو وسيط الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديل لجوجل مييت","دليل تثبيت وسيط الذكاء الاصطناعي","تهيئة وسيط الذكاء الاصطناعي","وسيط الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"onevcat","repo":"MeetCat","repoPath":"onevcat/MeetCat","stars":4,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-03T02:37:57Z","topics":["auto-join","extension","google-meet","meet"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"change-log","description":"Generate a full, user-facing changelog for the current in-development app version by comparing with the previous release tag (including uncommitted changes), and update the appropriate CHANGELOG.md accordingly.","bodyPreview":"## Goal\nProduce a complete, user-facing changelog for the current in-development app version and update the appropriate `CHANGELOG.md` accordingly.\n\n## When to use\n- You need to generate or refresh the changelog for the current dev version.\n- The summary must include all changes since the previous release tag, including uncommitted work.\n\n## Inputs and sources\n- App version (heuristic):\n  1) `crates/app/tauri.conf.json` (`version`).\n  2) `packages/tauri/src-tauri/tauri.conf.json` (`version`).","body":"## Goal\nProduce a complete, user-facing changelog for the current in-development app version and update the appropriate `CHANGELOG.md` accordingly.\n\n## When to use\n- You need to generate or refresh the changelog for the current dev version.\n- The summary must include all changes since the previous release tag, including uncommitted work.\n\n## Inputs and sources\n- App version (heuristic):\n  1) `crates/app/tauri.conf.json` (`version`).\n  2) `packages/tauri/src-tauri/tauri.conf.json` (`version`).\n  3) `tauri.conf.json` (repo root or first match via search).\n  4) `package.json` (`version`) as a fallback when no Tauri config exists.\n- Previous release tag: the latest reachable release tag in git history.\n- Changes since tag: commit logs + file diffs + uncommitted working tree changes.\n- Changelog file (heuristic):\n  1) `crates/app/CHANGELOG.md`.\n  2) `CHANGELOG.md` at repo root.\n  3) `packages/tauri/CHANGELOG.md` or `packages/app/CHANGELOG.md` if present.\n\n## Workflow\n1. Read the current app version using the heuristic order above. This is the target section in the changelog.\n2. Identify the previous release tag.\n   - Preferred: `git describe --tags --abbrev=0`.\n   - If ambiguous or no tag is found, list tags with `git tag --sort=-creatordate` and ask the user to pick the correct release tag.\n3. Collect the full change set (including uncommitted changes).\n   - Commit log: `git log <tag>..HEAD --reverse`.\n   - File-level changes: `git log <tag>..HEAD --name-status`.\n   - Diff for details: `git diff <tag>..HEAD`.\n   - Uncommitted changes: `git status --porcelain`, `git diff`, `git diff --staged`.\n4. Summarize changes into user-facing items only.\n   - Include only changes that impact users (features, UI, behavior, fixes).\n   - Exclude internal-only work (tests, refactors without behavior change, tooling, CI, internal-only docs).\n5. Update the selected `CHANGELOG.md`.\n   - If the target version section already exists, replace it with a full, up-to-date section. Each invocation must be a full refresh for that version.\n   - Keep the version order descending (newest first) and follow the existing formatting style.\n\n## Categorization rules\nUse these sections in this order and omit any empty section:\n1. Added\n2. Changed\n3. Fixed\n\nGuidance:\n- Added: new capabilities, new screens, new features users can now use.\n- Changed: behavior or UX changes, settings changes, performance improvements users can notice.\n- Fixed: bug fixes or incorrect behavior users might have experienced.\n- If a change cannot be clearly categorized, ask the user to choose the section.\n\n## Highlight rule\nIf there is a major milestone or standout feature, add a short highlight paragraph directly under the version header and above any section headers.\n\n## Output format\nFollow the existing Markdown style in the selected `CHANGELOG.md`.\n\nExample skeleton:\n\n```\n## 0.0.x\n\nA short highlight paragraph (only if truly major).\n\n### Added\n\n- User-facing addition.\n\n### Changed\n\n- User-facing change.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- User-facing fix.\n```\n\n## Links\nUse Markdown links if an item needs more explanation. The update dialog supports links.\n\n## Notes\n- Always include uncommitted changes in the summary. If the inclusion is uncertain, confirm with the user.\n- Do not invent changes. Every bullet must be traceable to the collected logs/diffs.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-03T13:12:20.035Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring automated changelog generation and version control.","zh":"适用于需要自动化变更日志生成和版本控制的开发代理。","ja":"自動化された変更ログの生成とバージョン管理を必要とする開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"자동화된 변경 로그 생성 및 버전 관리가 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo que requieren generación automática de registros de cambios y control de versiones.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une génération automatisée de journaux des modifications et un contrôle de version.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine automatisierte Erstellung von Änderungsprotokollen und Versionskontrolle benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que requerem geração automática de changelog e controle de versão.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих автоматического создания журнала изменений и контроля версий.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التطويريين الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد سجل التغييرات وتحكم الإصدار التلقائي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to produce comprehensive, user-facing changelogs for in-development app versions, updating CHANGELOG.md files accordingly, and leveraging version data from tauri.conf.json files.","zh":"赋予代理生成开发中应用版本的全面用户面向的变更日志的能力，相应地更新 CHANGELOG.md 文件，并利用 tauri.conf.json 文件中的版本数据。","ja":"開発中のアプリケーションバージョンの包括的なユーザー向けの変更ログを生成するエージェントを可能にし、CHANGELOG.md ファイルを最新の変更で更新し、tauri.conf.json ファイルからのバージョンデータを利用します。","ko":"개발 중인 애플리케이션 버전에 대한 포괄적인 사용자 중심의 변경 로그를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하며, CHANGELOG.md 파일을 최신 변경 사항으로 업데이트하고, tauri.conf.json 파일에서 버전 데이터를 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes producir registros de cambios integrales, orientados al usuario, para versiones de aplicaciones en desarrollo, actualizando los archivos CHANGELOG.md en consecuencia, y aprovechando los datos de versión de los archivos tauri.conf.json.","fr":"Permet aux agents de produire des journaux des modifications complets, orientés utilisateur, pour les versions d''applications en développement, en mettant à jour les fichiers CHANGELOG.md en conséquence, et en exploitant les données de version des fichiers tauri.conf.json.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, umfassende, benutzerorientierte Änderungsprotokolle für Entwicklerversionen von Apps zu erstellen, die Dateien CHANGELOG.md entsprechend zu aktualisieren und die Versionsdaten aus den Dateien tauri.conf.json zu nutzen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes produzam changelogs abrangentes para versões de aplicativos em desenvolvimento, atualizando arquivos CHANGELOG.md de acordo, e utilizando dados de versão de arquivos tauri.conf.json.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать полные журналы изменений для версий приложений в разработке, обновляя файлы CHANGELOG.md соответственно, и использует данные версий из файлов tauri.conf.json.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بإنتاج سجلات تغيير شاملة لأ판 الإصدارات التطويرية، ويتحديث ملفات CHANGELOG.md وفقًا لذلك، ويتوفر على بيانات الإصدار من ملفات tauri.conf.json."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating changelogs for dev versions","Updating CHANGELOG.md files with latest changes","Parsing version data from tauri.conf.json"],"zh":["为开发版本生成变更日志","用最新的更改更新 CHANGELOG.md 文件","从 tauri.conf.json 文件解析版本数据"],"ja":["開発バージョンの変更ログを生成する","最新の変更で CHANGELOG.md ファイルを更新する","tauri.conf.json ファイルからバージョンデータを解析する"],"ko":["개발 버전에 대한 변경 로그 생성","CHANGELOG.md 파일을 최신 변경 사항으로 업데이트하는 것","tauri.conf.json 파일에서 버전 데이터를 파싱하는 것"],"es":["Generación de registros de cambios para versiones de desarrollo","Actualización de archivos CHANGELOG.md con los cambios más recientes","Análisis de datos de versión desde archivos tauri.conf.json"],"fr":["Génération de journaux des modifications pour les versions de développement","Mise à jour des fichiers CHANGELOG.md avec les dernières modifications","Analyse des données de version à partir des fichiers tauri.conf.json"],"de":["Erstellung von Änderungsprotokollen für Entwicklerversionen","Aktualisierung der Dateien CHANGELOG.md mit den neuesten Änderungen","Auswertung von Versionsdaten aus den Dateien tauri.conf.json"],"pt":["Geração de changelogs para versões de desenvolvimento","Atualização de arquivos CHANGELOG.md com as últimas alterações","Análise de dados de versão de arquivos tauri.conf.json"],"ru":["Создание журналов изменений для версий разработки","Обновление файлов CHANGELOG.md с последними изменениями","Разбор данных версий из файлов tauri.conf.json"],"ar":["توليد سجلات التغييرات للإصدارات التطويرية","تحديث ملفات CHANGELOG.md بالتغيرات الأخيرة","تحليل بيانات الإصدار من ملفات tauri.conf.json"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to tauri.conf.json files","Limited to app versions specified in tauri.conf.json"],"zh":["需要访问 tauri.conf.json 文件","仅限于 tauri.conf.json 文件中指定的应用版本"],"ja":["tauri.conf.json ファイルへのアクセスが必要","tauri.conf.json ファイルに指定されたアプリケーションバージョンに限定される"],"ko":["tauri.conf.json 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요함","tauri.conf.json 파일에 지정된 애플리케이션 버전에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los archivos tauri.conf.json","Limitado a las versiones de aplicaciones especificadas en los archivos tauri.conf.json"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès aux fichiers tauri.conf.json","Limité aux versions d''applications spécifiées dans les fichiers tauri.conf.json"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Dateien tauri.conf.json","Begrenzt auf die in den Dateien tauri.conf.json angegebenen App-Versionen"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos tauri.conf.json","Limitado a versões de aplicativos especificadas em arquivos tauri.conf.json"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам tauri.conf.json","Ограничен версиями приложений, указанными в файлах tauri.conf.json"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات tauri.conf.json","محدود بالإصدارات المحددة في ملفات tauri.conf.json"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"eb12e6d26eafd7f5855f9333ad51d3ce808d4850959cbbcaef9af6df72b315ec","qualityScore":49}');
