rmas de desarrollo","Documentación y soporte técnico"],"fr":["Registre d''outils d''agents d''IA","Adaptateurs pour ai-sdk et tanstack-ai","Intégration simplifiée de l''IA dans les projets","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes de développement","Documentation et support technique"],"de":["Register von AI-Agenten-Tools","Adaptoren für ai-sdk und tanstack-ai","Vereinfachte Integration von KI in Projekte","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Entwicklungsplattformen","Dokumentation und technischer Support"],"pt":["Registry de ferramentas de agente de IA","Adaptadores para ai-sdk e tanstack-ai","Integração fácil em projetos","Suporte a múltiplas plataformas","Documentação detalhada"],"ru":["Реестр инструментов ИИ агентов","Адаптеры для ai-sdk и tanstack-ai","Легкая интеграция в проекты","Поддержка нескольких платформ","Дetailed документация"],"ar":["سجل أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","محولات ل ai-sdk و tanstack-ai","دمج سهل في المشاريع","دعم منصات متعددة","توثيق مفصل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI代理工具","ai-sdk","tanstack-ai","AI应用开发","如何使用ai-elements","ai-elements安装","ai-elements教程","AI代理工具注册表","ai-elements vs ai-sdk"],"ja":["AIエージェントツール","ai-sdk","tanstack-ai","AIアプリケーション開発","ai-elementsの使い方","ai-elementsのインストール","ai-elementsのチュートリアル","AIエージェントツールレジストリ","ai-elements vs ai-sdk"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 도구","ai-sdk","tanstack-ai","AI 애플리케이션 개발","ai-elements 사용법","ai-elements 설치","ai-elements 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트 도구 등록소","ai-elements vs ai-sdk"],"es":["herramientas de agentes de IA","ai-sdk","tanstack-ai","integración de la IA","desarrollo de proyectos","agentes de IA","herramientas de desarrollo","guias de instalación de ai-elements","configuración de ai-elements"],"fr":["outils d''agents d''IA","ai-sdk","tanstack-ai","intégration de l''IA","développement de projets","agents d''IA","outils de développement","guides d''installation d''ai-elements","configuration d''ai-elements"],"de":["AI-Agenten-Tools","ai-sdk","tanstack-ai","Integration von KI","Entwicklung von Projekten","AI-Agenten","Entwicklungs-Tools","Installationsanleitungen für ai-elements","Konfiguration von ai-elements"],"pt":["como usar ai-elements","o que é ai-elements","ai-elements vs ai-sdk","instalar ai-elements","guia de configuração ai-elements","ferramentas de agente de IA","desenvolvimento de agente de IA","ai-elements alternative"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты","что такое ИИ Агенты","ИИ Агенты vs ai-sdk","установить ИИ Агенты","руководство по настройке ИИ Агентов","инструменты ИИ агентов","разработка ИИ агентов","ИИ Агенты альтернатива"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هي أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي vs ai-sdk","تثبيت أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل إعداد أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي بديل"]}},"owner":"endalk200","repo":"ai-registry","repoPath":"endalk200/ai-registry","stars":1,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T06:01:11Z","topics":["agent-tools","agents","ai-sdk","ai-sdk-agents","tanstack-ai","tanstack-ai-tools","tools"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai-elements","description":"Create new AI chat interface components for the ai-elements library following established composable patterns, shadcn/ui integration, and Vercel AI SDK conventions. Use when creating new components in packages/elements/src or when the user asks to add a new component to ai-elements.","bodyPreview":"# AI Elements\n\n[AI Elements](https://www.npmjs.com/package/ai-elements) is a component library and custom registry built on top of [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) to help you build AI-native applications faster. It provides pre-built components like conversations, messages and more.\n\nInstalling AI Elements is straightforward and can be done in a couple of ways. You can use the dedicated CLI command for the fastest setup, or integrate via the standard shadcn/ui CLI if you''ve already adopted s","body":"# AI Elements\n\n[AI Elements](https://www.npmjs.com/package/ai-elements) is a component library and custom registry built on top of [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) to help you build AI-native applications faster. It provides pre-built components like conversations, messages and more.\n\nInstalling AI Elements is straightforward and can be done in a couple of ways. You can use the dedicated CLI command for the fastest setup, or integrate via the standard shadcn/ui CLI if you''ve already adopted shadcn''s workflow.\n\n\n\n## Quick Start\n\nHere are some basic examples of what you can achieve using components from AI Elements.\n\n\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore installing AI Elements, make sure your environment meets the following requirements:\n\n- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/en/download/), version 18 or later\n- A [Next.js](https://nextjs.org/) project with the [AI SDK](https://ai-sdk.dev/) installed.\n- [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) installed in your project. If you don''t have it installed, running any install command will automatically install it for you.\n- We also highly recommend using the [AI Gateway](https://vercel.com/docs/ai-gateway) and adding `AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY` to your `env.local` so you don''t have to use an API key from every provider. AI Gateway also gives $5 in usage per month so you can experiment with models. You can obtain an API key [here](https://vercel.com/d?to=%2F%5Bteam%5D%2F%7E%2Fai%2Fapi-keys&title=Get%20your%20AI%20Gateway%20key).\n\n\n\n## Installing Components\n\nYou can install AI Elements components using either the AI Elements CLI or the shadcn/ui CLI. Both achieve the same result: adding the selected component’s code and any needed dependencies to your project.\n\nThe CLI will download the component’s code and integrate it into your project’s directory (usually under your components folder). By default, AI Elements components are added to the `@/components/ai-elements/` directory (or whatever folder you’ve configured in your shadcn components settings).\n\nAfter running the command, you should see a confirmation in your terminal that the files were added. You can then proceed to use the component in your code.\n\n## Usage\n\nOnce an AI Elements component is installed, you can import it and use it in your application like any other React component. The components are added as part of your codebase (not hidden in a library), so the usage feels very natural.\n\n## Example\n\nAfter installing AI Elements components, you can use them in your application like any other React component. For example:\n\n```tsx title=\"conversation.tsx\"\n\"use client\";\n\nimport {\n  Message,\n  MessageContent,\n  MessageResponse,\n} from \"@/components/ai-elements/message\";\nimport { useChat } from \"@ai-sdk/react\";\n\nconst Example = () => {\n  const { messages } = useChat();\n\n  return (\n    <>\n      {messages.map(({ role, parts }, index) => (\n        <Message from={role} key={index}>\n          <MessageContent>\n            {parts.map((part, i) => {\n              switch (part.type) {\n                case \"text\":\n                  return (\n                    <MessageResponse key={`${role}-${i}`}>\n                      {part.text}\n                    </MessageResponse>\n                  );\n              }\n            })}\n          </MessageContent>\n        </Message>\n      ))}\n    </>\n  );\n};\n\nexport default Example;\n```\n\nIn the example above, we import the `Message` component from our AI Elements directory and include it in our JSX. Then, we compose the component with the `MessageContent` and `MessageResponse` subcomponents. You can style or configure the component just as you would if you wrote it yourself – since the code lives in your project, you can even open the component file to see how it works or make custom modifications.\n\n## Extensibility\n\nAll AI Elements components take as many primitive attributes as possible. For example, the `Message` component extends `HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>`, so you can pass any props that a `div` supports. This makes it easy to extend the component with your own styles or functionality.\n\n## Customization\n\n\n\nAfter installation, no additional setup is needed. The component’s styles (Tailwind CSS classes) and scripts are already integrated. You can start interacting with the component in your app immediately.\n\nFor example, if you''d like to remove the rounding on `Message`, you can go to `components/ai-elements/message.tsx` and remove `rounded-lg` as follows:\n\n```tsx title=\"components/ai-elements/message.tsx\" highlight=\"8\"\nexport const MessageContent = ({\n  children,\n  className,\n  ...props\n}: MessageContentProps) => (\n  <div\n    className={cn(\n      \"flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm text-foreground\",\n      \"group-[.is-user]:bg-primary group-[.is-user]:text-primary-foreground group-[.is-user]:px-4 group-[.is-user]:py-3\",\n      className\n    )}\n    {...props}\n  >\n    <div className=\"is-user:dark\">{children}</div>\n  </div>\n);\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n## Why are my components not styled?\n\nMake sure your project is configured correctly for shadcn/ui in Tailwind 4 - this means having a `globals.css` file that imports Tailwind and includes the shadcn/ui base styles.\n\n## I ran the AI Elements CLI but nothing was added to my project\n\nDouble-check that:\n\n- Your current working directory is the root of your project (where `package.json` lives).\n- Your components.json file (if using shadcn-style config) is set up correctly.\n- You’re using the latest version of the AI Elements CLI:\n\n```bash title=\"Terminal\"\nnpx ai-elements@latest\n```\n\nIf all else fails, feel free to open an [issue on GitHub](https://github.com/vercel/ai-elements/issues).\n\n## Theme switching doesn’t work — my app stays in light mode\n\nEnsure your app is using the same data-theme system that shadcn/ui and AI Elements expect. The default implementation toggles a data-theme attribute on the `<html>` element. Make sure your tailwind.config.js is using class or data- selectors accordingly:\n\n## The component imports fail with “module not found”\n\nCheck the file exists. If it does, make sure your `tsconfig.json` has a proper paths alias for `@/` i.e.\n\n```json title=\"tsconfig.json\"\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"baseUrl\": \".\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/*\": [\"./*\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## My AI coding assistant can''t access AI Elements components\n\n1. Verify your config file syntax is valid JSON.\n2. Check that the file path is correct for your AI tool.\n3. Restart your coding assistant after making changes.\n4. Ensure you have a stable internet connection.\n\n## Still stuck?\n\nIf none of these answers help, open an [issue on GitHub](https://github.com/vercel/ai-elements/issues) and someone will be happy to assist.\n\n## Available Components\n\nSee the `references/` folder for detailed documentation on each component.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:06:18.451Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor and Claude Code needing pre-built UI components for AI-native applications","zh":"适用于像 Cursor 和 Claude Code 这样的 AI Agents，它们需要为 AI 本地应用程序提供预建 UI 组件","ja":"Cursor や Claude Code などの AI エージェントに最適で、AI ネイティブ アプリケーション用の事前構築された UI コンポーネントが必要","ko":"Cursor 및 Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합하며 AI 네이티브 애플리케이션을 위한 사전 구축 UI 구성 요소가 필요","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor y Claude Code que necesitan componentes de interfaz de usuario preconstruidos para aplicaciones nativas de IA","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor et Claude Code ayant besoin de composants d''interface utilisateur préconstruits pour des applications natives IA","de":"Ideal für KI-Agenten wie Cursor und Claude Code, die vorgefertigte Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten für KI-native Anwendungen benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Cursor e Claude Code que necessitam de componentes de UI pré-construídos para aplicações nativas de IA","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor и Claude Code, требующих предварительно построенных компонентов UI для приложений, родных для ИИ","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى مكونات واجهة المستخدم المسبقة البناء للتطبيقات الأصلية للذكاء الاصطناعي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build conversations, messages, and more using shadcn/ui and adapters for ai-sdk and tanstack-ai, streamlining the development of AI-driven interfaces with seamless integration of custom registries","zh":"赋予代理构建对话、消息等的能力，使用 shadcn/ui 和 ai-sdk 及 tanstack-ai 的适配器，简化 AI 驱动接口的开发，并实现自定义注册表的无缝集成","ja":"エージェントに会話、メッセージなどを構築する能力を与え、shadcn/ui と ai-sdk、tanstack-ai のアダプターを使用して、AI ドリブンのインターフェイスの開発を簡素化し、カスタム レジストリのシームレスな統合を実現","ko":"에이전트가 대화, 메시지 등을 구축할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고 shadcn/ui 및 ai-sdk, tanstack-ai 어댑터를 사용하여 AI 구동 인터페이스의 개발을 간소화하고 사용자 지정 레지스트리의 무결점 통합을 구현","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir conversaciones, mensajes y más utilizando shadcn/ui y adaptadores para ai-sdk y tanstack-ai, simplificando el desarrollo de interfaces impulsadas por IA con una integración sin problemas de registros personalizados","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des conversations, des messages et plus encore en utilisant shadcn/ui et des adaptateurs pour ai-sdk et tanstack-ai, simplifiant ainsi le développement d''interfaces propulsées par l''IA avec une intégration transparente de registres personnalisés","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Konversationen, Nachrichten und mehr mit shadcn/ui und Adapters für ai-sdk und tanstack-ai zu erstellen, wodurch die Entwicklung von KI-getriebenen Schnittstellen mit einer nahtlosen Integration von benutzerdefinierten Registern erleichtert wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir conversas, mensagens e mais usando shadcn/ui e adaptadores para ai-sdk e tanstack-ai, simplificando o desenvolvimento de interfaces impulsionadas por IA com integração sem problemas de registros personalizados","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать разговоры, сообщения и многое другое, используя shadcn/ui и адаптеры для ai-sdk и tanstack-ai, упрощая разработку интерфейсов, управляемых ИИ, с бесшовной интеграцией пользовательских реестров","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من بناء محادثات ورسائل وأكثر باستخدام shadcn/ui وملحقات ل ai-sdk و tanstack-ai، وبذلك يُبسّط تطوير واجهات مدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي مع دمج سلاسة لالسجلات المخصصة"},"useCases":{"en":["Building AI-powered chat interfaces","Creating custom AI-native application UI components","Integrating ai-sdk and tanstack-ai adapters for enhanced functionality"],"zh":["构建 AI 驱动的聊天接口","创建自定义 AI 本地应用程序 UI 组件","集成 ai-sdk 和 tanstack-ai 适配器以增强功能"],"ja":["AI ドリブンのチャット インターフェイスの構築","カスタム AI ネイティブ アプリケーション UI コンポーネントの作成","ai-sdk と tanstack-ai アダプターの統合による機能強化"],"ko":["AI 구동 채팅 인터페이스 구축","사용자 지정 AI 네이티브 애플리케이션 UI 구성 요소 생성","ai-sdk 및 tanstack-ai 어댑터 통합을 통한 기능 강화"],"es":["Creación de interfaces de chat con IA","Creación de componentes de interfaz de usuario personalizados para aplicaciones nativas de IA","Integración de adaptadores de ai-sdk y tanstack-ai para una funcionalidad mejorada"],"fr":["Création d''interfaces de chat avec IA","Création de composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisés pour des applications natives IA","Intégration d''adaptateurs pour ai-sdk et tanstack-ai pour une fonctionnalité améliorée"],"de":["Erstellung von KI-gesteuerten Chat-Schnittstellen","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten für KI-native Anwendungen","Integration von Adapters für ai-sdk und tanstack-ai für erweiterte Funktionalität"],"pt":["Construção de interfaces de chat impulsionadas por IA","Criação de componentes de UI personalizados para aplicações nativas de IA","Integração de adaptadores ai-sdk e tanstack-ai para funcionalidade aprimorada"],"ru":["Создание интерфейсов чата, управляемых ИИ","Создание пользовательских компонентов UI для приложений, родных для ИИ","Интеграция адаптеров ai-sdk и tanstack-ai для расширенной функциональности"],"ar":["بناء واجهات محادثة مدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي","إنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم المخصصة للتطبيقات الأصلية للذكاء الاصطناعي","دمج ملحقات ai-sdk و tanstack-ai للوظائف المحسّنة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires shadcn/ui adoption","Limited to AI-native application development"],"zh":["需要采用 shadcn/ui","仅限 AI 本地应用程序开发"],"ja":["shadcn/ui の採用が必要","AI ネイティブ アプリケーションの開発に限定"],"ko":["shadcn/ui의 채택이 필요","AI 네이티브 애플리케이션 개발에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere la adopción de shadcn/ui","Limitado al desarrollo de aplicaciones nativas de IA"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adoption de shadcn/ui","Limité au développement d''applications natives IA"],"de":["Erfordert die Übernahme von shadcn/ui","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von KI-nativen Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige adoção de shadcn/ui","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de aplicações nativas de IA"],"ru":["Требует принятия shadcn/ui","Ограничен разработкой приложений, родных для ИИ"],"ar":["يتطلب اعتماد shadcn/ui","محدود بالتطوير للتطبيقات الأصلية للذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7e36e211495cf1ecfa6791c1e91cc53e253375cc5ee939d98656cc5a44d41fda","qualityScore":49}');
