o de arquiteturas de design personalizadas","Integração com Ferramentas de IA","Desenvolvimento de projetos de design eficazes","Otimização de processos de design","Colaboração em equipe com tech-stack-skill"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных архитектур дизайна","Интеграция с ИИ Агентами","Разработка эффективных проектов дизайна","Оптимизация процессов дизайна","Совместная работа в команде с tech-stack-skill"],"ar":["إنشاء تصميمات هندسية معمارية مخصصة","التكامل مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تنمية مشاريع تصميم فعالة","تحسين عمليات التصميم","التعاون الفريق مع tech-stack-skill"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Tech-Stack-Skill","什么是Tech-Stack-Skill","Tech-Stack-Skill替代品","Tech-Stack-Skill vs 其他工具","Tech-Stack-Skill安装","Tech-Stack-Skill教程","AI智能代理","架构设计框架"],"ja":["Tech-Stack-Skillの使用方法","Tech-Stack-Skillとは","Tech-Stack-Skillの代替","Tech-Stack-Skill vs 他のツール","Tech-Stack-Skillのインストール","Tech-Stack-Skillのチュートリアル","AIエージェント","アーキテクチャ設計フレームワーク"],"ko":["Tech-Stack-Skill 사용법","Tech-Stack-Skill이란","Tech-Stack-Skill 대체","Tech-Stack-Skill vs 다른 도구","Tech-Stack-Skill 설치","Tech-Stack-Skill 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트","아키텍처 디자인 프레임워크"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","tech-stack-skill alternativa","cómo usar tech-stack-skill","instalación de tech-stack-skill","guía de configuración de tech-stack-skill","diseño de arquitectura con AI","desarrollo de software con AI","herramientas de desarrollo de AI"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les développeurs","alternative à tech-stack-skill","comment utiliser tech-stack-skill","installation de tech-stack-skill","guide de configuration de tech-stack-skill","conception d''architecture avec IA","développement de logiciels avec IA","outils de développement d''IA"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","Alternative zu tech-stack-skill","wie man tech-stack-skill verwendet","Installation von tech-stack-skill","Konfigurationsanleitung für tech-stack-skill","Architektur-Design mit KI","Software-Entwicklung mit KI","KI-Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["como usar tech-stack-skill","o que é tech-stack-skill","Ferramentas de IA para design","tech-stack-skill alternativa","tech-stack-skill vs outros frameworks","instalar tech-stack-skill","guia de configuração do tech-stack-skill"],"ru":["как использовать tech-stack-skill","что такое tech-stack-skill","ИИ Агенты для дизайна","tech-stack-skill альтернатива","tech-stack-skill vs другие фреймворки","установить tech-stack-skill","руководство по настройке tech-stack-skill"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام tech-stack-skill","ما هو tech-stack-skill","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتصميم","بديل tech-stack-skill","tech-stack-skill مقابل إطارات عمل أخرى","تثبيت tech-stack-skill","دليل إعداد tech-stack-skill"]}},"owner":"dacy","repo":"architect-skill","repoPath":"dacy/architect-skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T07:20:36Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tech-stack-skill","description":"Use this skill for technology selection decisions. Trigger on tech stack, technology selection, what language, what framework, approved technologies, tech exception, or any time a technology choice is being made. The company has an opinionated tech stack — always consult this skill before recommending a technology to ensure alignment with approved choices.","bodyPreview":"# Tech Stack Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill guides technology selection aligned to the company''s opinionated tech stack.\nThe stack defines approved technologies by layer — anything outside the approved list\nrequires a formal exception before it can be used.\n\nRead `references/tech-stack.md` for the full approved technology catalog, tier definitions,\nand exception process before making any technology recommendation.\n\n---\n\n## Output\n\n- **Markdown (.md)** — Tech Stack section for Solution Intent, or","body":"# Tech Stack Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill guides technology selection aligned to the company''s opinionated tech stack.\nThe stack defines approved technologies by layer — anything outside the approved list\nrequires a formal exception before it can be used.\n\nRead `references/tech-stack.md` for the full approved technology catalog, tier definitions,\nand exception process before making any technology recommendation.\n\n---\n\n## Output\n\n- **Markdown (.md)** — Tech Stack section for Solution Intent, or standalone analysis\n- Name file: `[initiative-name]-tech-stack.md`\n\n---\n\n## Approval Tiers\n\nTechnologies fall into one of three tiers (see `references/tech-stack.md` for the full list):\n\n| Tier | Meaning |\n|------|---------|\n| **Approved** | Standard choice — use without additional review |\n| **Conditionally Approved** | Approved for specific use cases only — confirm fit |\n| **Exception Required** | Not on the approved list — requires architecture board review |\n\n---\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Identify technology decisions needed\n\nFrom the requirement, list every technology choice that must be made:\n- Runtime language and version\n- Application framework\n- API style (REST, gRPC, GraphQL)\n- Messaging / eventing platform\n- Database(s)\n- Caching\n- UI framework (if applicable)\n- Infrastructure / compute\n- CI/CD tooling\n- Observability stack\n\n### Step 2: Match to approved stack\n\nFor each decision, look up the approved choice in `references/tech-stack.md` and document:\n\n| Layer | Decision | Approved Choice | Tier | Notes |\n|-------|----------|----------------|------|-------|\n| Runtime | Language | [approved] | Approved | |\n| Framework | API | [approved] | Approved | |\n| Messaging | Events | [approved] | Approved | |\n| ... | ... | ... | ... | |\n\n### Step 3: Flag exceptions\n\nFor any technology not in the approved catalog:\n1. Document the proposed technology and the reason the approved alternative doesn''t fit\n2. Identify the exception type (new technology, unsupported version, non-standard pattern)\n3. Outline the exception approval path (see `references/tech-stack.md` — Exception Process)\n4. Mark as ⚠️ in the tech stack table — no exceptions proceed without approval\n\n### Step 4: Version alignment\n\nEnsure proposed versions align with company-supported versions. Flag any end-of-life or\nunsupported versions as risks.\n\n---\n\n## Document Structure\n\n```\n# [Initiative Name] — Tech Stack\n\n## Technology Decisions\n\n| Layer | Choice | Tier | Justification |\n|-------|--------|------|---------------|\n| [Layer] | [Technology v.x] | Approved / Conditional / Exception | [Why] |\n\n## Exception Requests\n[Technology | Reason approved option doesn''t fit | Approval path]\n\n## Version Risk Register\n[Any EOL or unsupported version flags]\n\n## Open Questions\n```\n\n---\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- `references/tech-stack.md` — Company approved technology catalog by layer, tier\n  classifications, conditionally approved use cases, and exception process.\n  **TODO:** Populate with your organization''s opinionated tech stack.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-03T04:08:50.591Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Architecture Agents requiring standardized technology selection and opinionated tech stack guidance.","zh":"适用于需要标准化技术选择和意见化技术栈指导的架构代理","ja":"標準化された技術選択と意見化されたテクノロジー・スタックのガイダンスを必要とするアーキテクチャ・エージェントに最適","ko":"표준화된 기술 선택과 의견화된 기술 스택 가이드가 필요한 아키텍처 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Arquitectura que requieren una selección de tecnología estandarizada y orientación de pila de tecnología opinada.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Architecture nécessitant une sélection de technologie standardisée et une orientation de pile de technologie avisée.","de":"Ideal für Architekturagenten, die eine standardisierte Technologieauswahl und eine meinungsbasierte Technologiestapelberatung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Arquitetura que requerem seleção de tecnologia padronizada e orientação de pilha de tecnologia opinativa.","ru":"Идеально для Архитектурных Агентов, требующих стандартизированного выбора технологий и рекомендаций по технологической стеку.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الهيئة التي تتطلب اختيار تقنية معياري وتوجيه ركن تقني ذو رأي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to guide technology selection aligned with approved catalogs, leveraging Markdown (.md) for Solution Intent and adhering to tier definitions and exception processes for seamless integration with company standards, including formal exception handling for non-approved technologies.","zh":"赋予代理指导技术选择与批准目录对齐，利用 Markdown (.md) 实现解决方案意图，并遵循分级定义和异常处理流程以实现与公司标准的无缝集成，包括非批准技术的正式异常处理","ja":"エージェントに、承認されたカタログに沿った技術選択を導く力を与え、Markdown (.md) を使用してソリューションの意図を実現し、会社の規格とのシームレスな統合を実現するために、階層定義と例外処理プロセスに従い、非承認技術の正式な例外処理を含む","ko":"에이전트가 승인된 카탈로그에 맞춰 기술 선택을 가이드할 수 있도록 하며, Markdown (.md)를 사용하여 솔루션 의도를 구현하고, 회사 표준과의 원활한 통합을 위해 계층 정의와 예외 처리 프로세스를 준수하며, 승인되지 않은 기술에 대한 공식적인 예외 처리를 포함","es":"Permite a los agentes guiar la selección de tecnología alineada con catálogos aprobados, aprovechando Markdown (.md) para la Intención de Solución y ajustándose a definiciones de niveles y procesos de excepción para una integración sin problemas con los estándares de la empresa, incluyendo un manejo formal de excepciones para tecnologías no aprobadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de guider la sélection de technologie alignée sur les catalogues approuvés, en exploitant Markdown (.md) pour l''Intention de Solution et en respectant les définitions de niveaux et les processus d''exception pour une intégration sans heurts avec les normes de l''entreprise, y compris une gestion formelle des exceptions pour les technologies non approuvées.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Technologieauswahl im Einklang mit den genehmigten Katalogen zu leiten, indem Markdown (.md) für die Lösungsabsicht genutzt und die Definitionen der Ebenen und Ausnahmeprozesse für eine nahtlose Integration mit den Unternehmensstandards eingehalten werden, einschließlich einer formellen Ausnahmehandhabung für nicht genehmigte Technologien.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a orientar a seleção de tecnologia alinhada com catálogos aprovados, utilizando Markdown (.md) para Intenção de Solução e aderindo a definições de nível e processos de exceção para integração perfeita com os padrões da empresa, incluindo tratamento formal de exceções para tecnologias não aprovadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью руководить выбором технологий в соответствии с утвержденными каталогами, используя Markdown (.md) для Намерения Решения и соблюдая определения уровней и процессы исключений для бесперебойной интеграции с корпоративными стандартами, включая формальное xử lý исключений для неутвержденных технологий.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية توجيه اختيار التكنولوجيا المتوافقة مع الفهارس المعتمدة، باستخدام Markdown (.md) لنية الحل ومتوافق مع تعريفات المستويات والعمليات الاستثنائية من أجل التكامل السلس مع معايير الشركة، بما في ذلك معالجة استثنائية رسمية للتكنولوجيا غير المعتمدة"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating compliant tech stack sections for Solution Intent documents","Validating technology recommendations against approved catalogs","Streamlining exception processes for non-standard technology requests"],"zh":["为解决方案意图文档创建符合标准的技术栈部分","验证技术推荐是否与批准目录一致","简化非标准技术请求的异常处理流程"],"ja":["ソリューションの意図ドキュメントのためのコンプライアンスなテクノロジー・スタックのセクションを作成する","承認されたカタログに沿った技術の推奨を検証する","非標準的なテクノロジー要求のための例外処理プロセスをストリームライン化する"],"ko":["솔루션 의도 문서를 위한 규정 준수 기술 스택 섹션を作成","승인된 카탈로그에 맞춰 기술 추천을 검증","비표준 기술 요청에 대한 예외 처리 프로세스를 간소화"],"es":["Crear secciones de pila de tecnología compatibles para documentos de Intención de Solución","Validar recomendaciones de tecnología frente a catálogos aprobados","Optimizar los procesos de excepción para solicitudes de tecnología no estándar"],"fr":["Créer des sections de pile de technologie conformes pour les documents d''Intention de Solution","Valider les recommandations de technologie par rapport aux catalogues approuvés","Optimiser les processus d''exception pour les demandes de technologie non standard"],"de":["Erstellen von kompatiblen Technologiestapelabschnitten für Lösungsabsichtsdokumente","Validieren von Technologieempfehlungen gegenüber genehmigten Katalogen","Optimieren der Ausnahmeprozesse für nicht standardmäßige Technologierequests"],"pt":["Criando seções de pilha de tecnologia compatíveis para documentos de Intenção de Solução","Validando recomendações de tecnologia contra catálogos aprovados","Otimizando processos de exceção para solicitações de tecnologia não padrão"],"ru":["Создание секций технологической栈и для документов Намерения Решения","Проверка рекомендаций технологий против утвержденных каталогов","Оптимизация процессов исключений для запросов нестандартной технологии"],"ar":["إنشاء أقسام ركن تقني متوافقة لوثائق نية الحل","التحقق من توصيات التكنولوجيا مقابل الفهارس المعتمدة","تحسين عمليات الاستثناء للطلبات التكنولوجية غير الموحدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the company''s tech stack catalog (references/tech-stack.md)","Adherence to predefined tier definitions and exception processes"],"zh":["需要访问公司的技术栈目录 (references/tech-stack.md)","遵循预定义的分级定义和异常处理流程"],"ja":["会社のテクノロジー・スタック・カタログ (references/tech-stack.md) へのアクセスが必要","予め定義された階層定義と例外処理プロセスに従う必要がある"],"ko":["회사 기술 스택 카탈로그 (references/tech-stack.md) 에 대한 액세스가 필요","사전에 정의된 계층 정의와 예외 처리 프로세스를 따라야 함"],"es":["Requiere acceso al catálogo de pila de tecnología de la empresa (referencias/tech-stack.md)","Cumplimiento de las definiciones de niveles y procesos de excepción preestablecidos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au catalogue de pile de technologie de l''entreprise (références/tech-stack.md)","Respect des définitions de niveaux et des processus d''exception prédéfinis"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf den Technologiestapelkatalog des Unternehmens (Referenzen/tech-stack.md)","Einhalten der vordefinierten Ebenendefinitionen und Ausnahmeprozesse"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao catálogo de pilha de tecnologia da empresa (references/tech-stack.md)","Adesão a definições de nível e processos de exceção predefinidos"],"ru":["Требует доступа к каталогу технологической栈и компании (references/tech-stack.md)","Соблюдение предопределенных определений уровней и процессов исключений"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى فهرس ركن تقني الشركة (references/tech-stack.md)","الامتثال لتعريفات المستويات وعمليات الاستثناء المحددة مسبقا"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"26c105dfd134b6ba6e952cb83cb73c5368d66e8319d75724b46fc484f7018e30","qualityScore":49}');
