r Agents d''IA","de":"Testing mit API-Mocks für KI-Agents","pt":"Teste com Mocks de API para Ferramentas de IA","ru":"Тестирование с помощью имитации API для ИИ Агентов","ar":"التحقق مع محاكاة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للوكلاء الذكاء الا...","en":"testing-with-api-mocks"},"description":{"zh":"ToolHive是一个允许您安装、管理和运行MCP服务器，并连接到AI代理的应用程序，简化AI开发流程","ja":"ToolHiveは、MCPサーバーをインストール、管理、実行し、AIエージェントに接続することを可能にするアプリケーションです","ko":"ToolHive는 MCP 서버를 설치, 관리, 실행하고 AI 에이전트에 연결할 수 있는 애플리케이션으로, AI 개발을 간소화합니다","es":"ToolHive permite probar y conectar Agentes de IA con servidores MCP, utilizando API Mocks para un desarrollo más eficiente","fr":"ToolHive permet de tester et de connecter des Agents d''IA avec des serveurs MCP, en utilisant des API Mocks pour un développement plus efficace","de":"ToolHive ermöglicht das Testen und Verbinden von KI-Agents mit MCP-Servern, unter Verwendung von API-Mocks für eine effizientere Entwicklung","pt":"ToolHive é uma aplicação que permite instalar, gerenciar e executar servidores MCP e conectar a agentes de IA, facilitando o teste com mocks de API","ru":"ToolHive - это приложение, которое позволяет устанавливать, управлять и запускать серверы MCP и подключать к агентам ИИ, облегчая тестирование с помощью имит...","ar":"ToolHive هو تطبيق يسمح بتثبيت وإدارة وتنفيذ خوادم MCP وربطها بالوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي، مما يسهل عملية التحقق مع محاكاة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","en":"ToolHive is an application that allows you to install, manage and run MCP servers and connect them to AI agents"},"definition":{"en":"ToolHive is an application that allows you to install, manage and run MCP servers and connect them to AI agents"},"features":{"zh":["安装和管理MCP服务器","连接到AI代理","支持多种操作系统","使用API Mocks进行测试","简化AI开发流程","提高开发效率"],"ja":["MCPサーバーのインストールと管理","AIエージェントへの接続","複数のオペレーティングシステムのサポート","API Mocksを使用したテスト","AI開発の簡素化","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["MCP 서버 설치 및 관리","AI 에이전트에 연결","다양한 운영 체제 지원","API Mocks를 사용한 테스트","AI 개발의 간소화","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Pruebas de API con datos simulados","Conexión de Agentes de IA con servidores MCP","Desarrollo de aplicaciones con ToolHive","Seguridad y autenticación para Agentes de IA","Compatibilidad con Linux, macOS y Windows"],"fr":["Tests d''API avec des données simulées","Connexion d''Agents d''IA avec des serveurs MCP","Développement d''applications avec ToolHive","Sécurité et authentification pour Agents d''IA","Compatibilité avec Linux, macOS et Windows"],"de":["API-Tests mit simulierten Daten","Verbindung von KI-Agents mit MCP-Servern","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit ToolHive","Sicherheit und Authentifizierung für KI-Agents","Kompatibilität mit Linux, macOS und Windows"],"pt":["Instalação e gerenciamento de servidores MCP","Conexão a agentes de IA","Teste com mocks de API","Suporte a múltiplas plataformas","Desenvolvimento com TypeScript"],"ru":["Установка и управление серверами MCP","Подключение к агентам ИИ","Тестирование с помощью имитации API","Поддержка нескольких платформ","Разработка на TypeScript"],"ar":["تثبيت وإدارة خوادم MCP","ربط بالوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","التحقق مع محاكاة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","دعم منصات متعددة","التطوير باستخدام TypeScript"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI代理测试","API Mocks","ToolHive","MCP服务器管理","AI开发工具","如何使用ToolHive","ToolHive安装","AI代理连接","MCP服务器安装"],"ja":["AIエージェントのテスト","API Mocks","ToolHive","MCPサーバー管理","AI開発ツール","ToolHiveの使用方法","ToolHiveのインストール","AIエージェントの接続","MCPサーバーのインストール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 테스트","API Mocks","ToolHive","MCP 서버 관리","AI 개발 도구","ToolHive 사용 방법","ToolHive 설치","AI 에이전트 연결","MCP 서버 설치"],"es":["cómo usar API Mocks","qué es testing con API Mocks","Agentes de IA","ToolHive alternativa","instalación de ToolHive","guía de configuración de ToolHive","seguridad de Agentes de IA","desarrollo de aplicaciones con ToolHive"],"fr":["comment utiliser des API Mocks","qu''est-ce que le test avec des API Mocks","Agents d''IA","alternative à ToolHive","installation de ToolHive","guide de configuration de ToolHive","sécurité des Agents d''IA","développement d''applications avec ToolHive"],"de":["wie man API-Mocks verwendet","was ist Testing mit API-Mocks","KI-Agents","Alternative zu ToolHive","Installation von ToolHive","Konfigurationsanleitung für ToolHive","Sicherheit von KI-Agents","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit ToolHive"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","testes com mocks de API","ToolHive","servidores MCP","agentes de IA","desenvolvimento com TypeScript","como usar ToolHive","alternativas para ToolHive"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","тестирование с помощью имитации API","ToolHive","серверы MCP","агенты ИИ","разработка на TypeScript","как использовать ToolHive","альтернативы для ToolHive"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التحقق مع محاكاة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","ToolHive","خوادم MCP","الوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","التطوير باستخدام TypeScript","كيفية استخدام ToolHive","بديلات ل ToolHive"]}},"owner":"stacklok","repo":"toolhive-studio","repoPath":"stacklok/toolhive-studio","stars":116,"forks":13,"updatedAt":"2026-03-03T12:59:48Z","topics":["agents","ai","ai-security","claude","continue","copilot","cursor","developer-tools","linux","macos","mcp","mcp-client","mcp-server","mcp-tools","model-context-protocol","security","typescript","windows"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"testing-with-api-mocks","description":"Start here for all API mocking in tests. Covers auto-generation, fixtures, and when to use other skills. Required reading before creating, refactoring, or modifying any test involving API calls.","bodyPreview":"# Testing with API Mocks\n\n**This is the starting point for all API mocking in tests.** Read this skill first before working on any test that involves API calls.\n\nThis project uses MSW (Mock Service Worker) with auto-generated schema-based mocks. When writing tests for code that calls API endpoints, mocks are created automatically.\n\n## How It Works\n\n1. **Run a test** that triggers an API call (e.g., a component that fetches data)\n2. **Mock auto-generates** if no fixture exists for that endpoint\n3","body":"# Testing with API Mocks\n\n**This is the starting point for all API mocking in tests.** Read this skill first before working on any test that involves API calls.\n\nThis project uses MSW (Mock Service Worker) with auto-generated schema-based mocks. When writing tests for code that calls API endpoints, mocks are created automatically.\n\n## How It Works\n\n1. **Run a test** that triggers an API call (e.g., a component that fetches data)\n2. **Mock auto-generates** if no fixture exists for that endpoint\n3. **Fixture saved** to `renderer/src/common/mocks/fixtures/<endpoint>/<method>.ts`\n4. **Subsequent runs** use the saved fixture\n\nNo manual mock setup is required for basic tests.\n\n## Fixture Location\n\nFixtures are organized by endpoint path and HTTP method:\n\n```\nrenderer/src/common/mocks/fixtures/\n├── groups/\n│   ├── get.ts          # GET /api/v1beta/groups\n│   └── post.ts         # POST /api/v1beta/groups\n├── workloads/\n│   └── get.ts          # GET /api/v1beta/workloads\n├── workloads_name/\n│   └── get.ts          # GET /api/v1beta/workloads/:name\n└── ...\n```\n\nPath parameters like `:name` become `_name` in the directory name.\n\n## Fixture Structure\n\nGenerated fixtures use the `AutoAPIMock` wrapper with types from the OpenAPI schema:\n\n```typescript\n// renderer/src/common/mocks/fixtures/groups/get.ts\nimport type {\n  GetApiV1BetaGroupsResponse,\n  GetApiV1BetaGroupsData,\n} from ''@common/api/generated/types.gen''\nimport { AutoAPIMock } from ''@mocks''\n\nexport const mockedGetApiV1BetaGroups = AutoAPIMock<\n  GetApiV1BetaGroupsResponse,\n  GetApiV1BetaGroupsData\n>({\n  groups: [\n    { name: ''default'', registered_clients: [''client-a''] },\n    { name: ''research'', registered_clients: [''client-b''] },\n  ],\n})\n```\n\nThe second type parameter (`*Data`) provides typed access to request parameters (query, path, body) for conditional overrides.\n\n### Naming Convention\n\nExport names follow the pattern: `mocked` + HTTP method + endpoint path in PascalCase.\n\n- `GET /api/v1beta/groups` → `mockedGetApiV1BetaGroups`\n- `POST /api/v1beta/workloads` → `mockedPostApiV1BetaWorkloads`\n- `GET /api/v1beta/workloads/:name` → `mockedGetApiV1BetaWorkloadsByName`\n\n## Writing a Basic Test\n\nFor most tests, just render the component and the mock handles the rest:\n\n```typescript\nimport { render, screen, waitFor } from ''@testing-library/react''\n\nit(''displays groups from the API'', async () => {\n  render(<GroupsList />)\n\n  await waitFor(() => {\n    expect(screen.getByText(''default'')).toBeVisible()\n  })\n})\n```\n\nThe auto-generated mock provides realistic fake data based on the OpenAPI schema.\n\n## Customizing Fixture Data\n\nIf the auto-generated data doesn''t suit your test, edit the fixture file directly:\n\n```typescript\n// renderer/src/common/mocks/fixtures/groups/get.ts\nexport const mockedGetApiV1BetaGroups = AutoAPIMock<\n  GetApiV1BetaGroupsResponse,\n  GetApiV1BetaGroupsData\n>({\n  groups: [\n    { name: ''production'', registered_clients: [''claude-code''] }, // Custom data\n    { name: ''staging'', registered_clients: [] },\n  ],\n})\n```\n\nThis becomes the new default for all tests using this endpoint.\n\n## Regenerating a Fixture\n\nTo regenerate a fixture with fresh schema-based data:\n\n1. Delete the fixture file\n2. Run a test that calls that endpoint\n3. New fixture auto-generates\n\n```bash\nrm renderer/src/common/mocks/fixtures/groups/get.ts\npnpm test -- --run <test-file>\n```\n\n## Key Imports\n\n```typescript\n// Types for API responses and request parameters\nimport type {\n  GetApiV1BetaGroupsResponse,\n  GetApiV1BetaGroupsData,\n} from ''@common/api/generated/types.gen''\n\n// AutoAPIMock wrapper\nimport { AutoAPIMock } from ''@mocks''\n\n// Fixture mocks (for test-scoped overrides, see: testing-api-overrides skill)\nimport { mockedGetApiV1BetaGroups } from ''@mocks/fixtures/groups/get''\n```\n\n## 204 No Content Endpoints\n\nFor endpoints that return 204, create a minimal `AutoAPIMock` fixture and override the handler in each test:\n\n```typescript\n// renderer/src/common/mocks/fixtures/health/get.ts\nimport type {\n  GetHealthResponse,\n  GetHealthData,\n} from ''@common/api/generated/types.gen''\nimport { AutoAPIMock } from ''@mocks''\n\nexport const mockedGetHealth = AutoAPIMock<GetHealthResponse, GetHealthData>(\n  '''' as unknown as GetHealthResponse\n)\n```\n\nThen in tests, use `.overrideHandler()` to return the appropriate response:\n\n```typescript\nimport { mockedGetHealth } from ''@mocks/fixtures/health/get''\nimport { HttpResponse } from ''msw''\n\nit(''navigates on health check success'', async () => {\n  mockedGetHealth.overrideHandler(() => new HttpResponse(null, { status: 204 }))\n  // ...\n})\n\nit(''handles health check failure'', async () => {\n  mockedGetHealth.overrideHandler(() => HttpResponse.error())\n  // ...\n})\n```\n\n## Custom Mocks (Text/Plain Endpoints)\n\n**Custom mocks are only needed for text/plain endpoints.** The only current example is the logs endpoint:\n\n```typescript\n// renderer/src/common/mocks/customHandlers/index.ts\nexport const customHandlers = [\n  http.get(mswEndpoint(''/api/v1beta/workloads/:name/logs''), ({ params }) => {\n    const { name } = params\n    const logs = getMockLogs(name as string)\n    return new HttpResponse(logs, { status: 200 })\n  }),\n]\n```\n\nTo override the logs response in tests, use the exported `getMockLogs` mock:\n\n```typescript\nimport { getMockLogs } from ''@/common/mocks/customHandlers''\n\ngetMockLogs.mockReturnValueOnce(''Custom log content for this test'')\n```\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **testing-api-overrides** - Test-scoped overrides and conditional responses for testing filters/params\n- **testing-api-assertions** - Verifying API calls for mutations (create/update/delete)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-03T13:06:35.844Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for API-centric AI Agents like AutoGPT and LangChain needing robust API mocking capabilities for reliable testing.","zh":"适用于像 AutoGPT 和 LangChain 这样的 API 为中心的 AI 代理，需要强大的 API 模拟能力以实现可靠的测试。","ja":"AutoGPT や LangChain のような API 重視の AI エージェントに適しており、信頼性の高いテストを実現するための堅牢な API モッキング機能が必要です。","ko":"AutoGPT 및 LangChain과 같은 API 중심의 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 안정적인 테스트를 위해 강력한 API 모의 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial centrados en API como AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan capacidades robustas de simulación de API para pruebas confiables.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle centrés sur l''API comme AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant des capacités de simulation d''API robustes pour des tests fiables.","de":"Ideal für API-zentrierte KI-Agents wie AutoGPT und LangChain, die robuste API-Mock-Funktionen für zuverlässige Tests benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA centrados em API, como AutoGPT e LangChain, que necessitam de capacidades robustas de simulação de API para testes confiáveis.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на API, таких как AutoGPT и LangChain, требующих прочных возможностей模拟 API для надежного тестирования.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المتمركز على واجهة برمجة التطبيقات مثل AutoGPT و LangChain الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات محاكاة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات القوية لاختبارات موثوقة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to seamlessly integrate MSW (Mock Service Worker) with auto-generated schema-based mocks, streamlining API testing and validation using protocols like HTTP and HTTPS.","zh":"使代理能够无缝地将 MSW（模拟服务工作者）与自动生成的基于模式的模拟相结合，从而简化使用 HTTP 和 HTTPS 等协议的 API 测试和验证。","ja":"エージェントが MSW（Mock Service Worker）を自動生成されたスキーマベースのモックとシームレスに統合できるようにし、HTTP や HTTPS などのプロトコルを使用した API テストと検証を簡素化します。","ko":"에이전트가 MSW(Mock Service Worker)를 자동 생성된 스키마 기반 모의와无缝하게 통합할 수 있도록하여, HTTP 및 HTTPS와 같은 프로토콜을 사용한 API 테스트 및 검증을 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a integrar de forma transparente MSW (Mock Service Worker) con simulaciones de esquema generadas automáticamente, simplificando las pruebas y la validación de API utilizando protocolos como HTTP y HTTPS.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intégrer de manière transparente MSW (Mock Service Worker) avec des mocks basés sur des schémas générés automatiquement, simplifiant les tests et la validation d''API en utilisant des protocoles tels que HTTP et HTTPS.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, MSW (Mock Service Worker) nahtlos mit auto-generierten schema-basierten Mocks zu integrieren, wodurch API-Tests und -Validierungen mithilfe von Protokollen wie HTTP und HTTPS gestreamt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a integrar perfeitamente o MSW (Mock Service Worker) com mocks baseados em esquema auto-gerados, simplificando o teste e a validação de API usando protocolos como HTTP e HTTPS.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность бесшовно интегрировать MSW (Mock Service Worker) с автоматически сгенерированными mocks на основе схемы, упрощая тестирование и проверку API с использованием таких протоколов, как HTTP и HTTPS.","ar":"تمكين العميل من دمج MSW (Mock Service Worker) بشكل متكامل مع محاكاة قائم على схема تلقائيًا، وبذلك يُبسّط اختبار واجهة برمجة التطبيقات وتصديقها باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل HTTP و HTTPS."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating API call testing with auto-generated mocks","Debugging API endpoint issues using mock data","Validating API schema integrity with schema-based mocks"],"zh":["使用自动生成的模拟来自动化 API 调用测试","使用模拟数据调试 API 端点问题","使用基于模式的模拟来验证 API 模式完整性"],"ja":["自動生成されたモックを使用して API 呼び出しテストを自動化する","モックデータを使用して API エンドポイントの問題をデバッグする","スキーマベースのモックを使用して API スキーマの完全性を検証する"],"ko":["자동 생성된 모의를 사용하여 API 호출 테스트를 자동화하는 것","모의 데이터를 사용하여 API 엔드포인트 문제를 디버깅하는 것","스키마 기반 모의를 사용하여 API 스키마의 무결성을 검증하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar las pruebas de llamadas a API con simulaciones generadas automáticamente","Depurar problemas de puntos de conexión de API mediante datos de simulación","Validar la integridad del esquema de API con simulaciones basadas en esquemas"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests d''appels d''API avec des mocks générés automatiquement","Déboguer les problèmes de points de terminaison d''API à l''aide de données de simulation","Valider l''intégrité du schéma d''API avec des mocks basés sur des schémas"],"de":["Automatisieren von API-Aufruf-Tests mit auto-generierten Mocks","Debuggen von API-Endpunkt-Problemen mithilfe von Mock-Daten","Validieren der API-Schema-Integrität mit schema-basierten Mocks"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de chamadas de API com mocks auto-gerados","Depurar problemas de pontos de extremidade de API usando dados de simulação","Validar a integridade do esquema de API com mocks baseados em esquema"],"ru":["Автоматизация тестирования вызовов API с помощью автоматически сгенерированных mocks","Отладка проблем с конечными точками API с использованием данных симуляции","Проверка целостности схемы API с помощью mocks на основе схемы"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبار呼بة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات باستخدام محاكاة تلقائيًا","تصحيح أخطاء نقاط النهاية لواجهة برمجة التطبيقات باستخدام بيانات محاكاة","التحقق من سلامة مخطط واجهة برمجة التطبيقات باستخدام محاكاة قائم على مخطط"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires MSW (Mock Service Worker) setup","Limited to API endpoints with existing schema definitions"],"zh":["需要 MSW（模拟服务工作者）设置","仅限于具有现有模式定义的 API 端点"],"ja":["MSW（Mock Service Worker）の設定が必要","既存のスキーマ定義を持つ API エンドポイントのみに限定される"],"ko":["MSW(Mock Service Worker) 설정이 필요합니다.","既存의 스키마 정의를 갖는 API 엔드포인트에만 제한됩니다."],"es":["Requiere configuración de MSW (Mock Service Worker)","Limitado a puntos de conexión de API con definiciones de esquema existentes"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de MSW (Mock Service Worker)","Limité aux points de terminaison d''API avec des définitions de schéma existantes"],"de":["Benötigt MSW (Mock Service Worker)-Einrichtung","Begrenzt auf API-Endpunkte mit vorhandenen Schemadefinitionen"],"pt":["Requer configuração do MSW (Mock Service Worker)","Limitado a pontos de extremidade de API com definições de esquema existentes"],"ru":["Требуется настройка MSW (Mock Service Worker)","Ограничен до конечных точек API с существующими определениями схемы"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد MSW (Mock Service Worker)","محدود بنقاط النهاية لواجهة برمجة التطبيقات مع تعريفات مخطط موجودة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4d26b466a92a5b4c85451d67f7e3286bdbfd3a73cbd4b54ec72e9b2dba3fe3a8","qualityScore":49}');
