urce"],"de":["Entwickelt mit ASP.NET Core Web API","Integration mit Blazor","Dezentrale Event-Plattform","Event-Management-System","Kompatibilität mit Fediverse","Open-Source-Code"],"pt":["Desenvolvida com ASP.NET Core Web API","Integração com Blazor para interfaces de usuário","Suporte a aplicativos web progressivos","Código aberto e auto-hospedado","Integração com a federação de redes sociais"],"ru":["Разработана на основе ASP.NET Core Web API","Интеграция с Blazor для пользовательских интерфейсов","Поддержка прогрессивных веб-приложений","Открытый код и само-хостинг","Интеграция с федерацией социальных сетей"],"ar":["تم تطويرها باستخدام ASP.NET Core Web API","التكامل مع Blazor لواجهات المستخدم","دعم تطبيقات الويب التقدمية","مفتوح المصدر و自وست","التكامل مع فيديرالية شبكات التواصل الاجتماعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["事件管理系统","去中心化平台","asp-net-core-web-api","blazor","pwa","开源","自托管","atproto","prd安装","prd设置指南"],"ja":["イベント管理システム","分散型プラットフォーム","asp-net-core-web-api","blazor","pwa","オープンソース","セルフホスト","atproto","prdインストール","prd設定ガイド"],"ko":["이벤트 관리 시스템","분산 플랫폼","asp-net-core-web-api","blazor","pwa","오픈소스","셀프호스팅","atproto","prd 설치","prd 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de inteligencia artificial para eventos","cómo usar prd","qué es prd","prd vs otras plataformas de eventos","instalación de prd","guía de configuración de prd","desarrollo de plataformas de eventos","gestión de eventos con prd"],"fr":["outils d''intelligence artificielle pour événements","comment utiliser prd","qu''est-ce que prd","prd vs autres plateformes d''événements","installation de prd","guide de configuration de prd","développement de plateformes d''événements","gestion d''événements avec prd"],"de":["künstliche intelligenz tools für events","wie man prd verwendet","was ist prd","prd vs andere event-plattformen","installation von prd","einrichtungsanleitung für prd","entwicklung von event-plattformen","event-management mit prd"],"pt":["como usar prd","o que é prd","prd vs outros gerenciadores de eventos","instalar prd","guia de configuração do prd","desenvolvimento de aplicativos web progressivos","integração com a federação de redes sociais","código aberto para gerenciamento de eventos"],"ru":["как использовать prd","что такое prd","prd vs другие менеджеры событий","установить prd","руководство по настройке prd","разработка прогрессивных веб-приложений","интеграция с федерацией социальных сетей","открытый код для управления событиями"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام prd","ما هي prd","prd مقابل autres مديري الأحداث","تثبيت prd","دليل إعداد prd","تطوير تطبيقات الويب التقدمية","التكامل مع فيديرالية شبكات التواصل الاجتماعي","مفتوح المصدر لإدارة الأحداث"]}},"owner":"islamu-ngo","repo":"Event","repoPath":"islamu-ngo/Event","stars":5,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-02-22T16:34:32Z","topics":["asp-net-core-web-api","atproto","blazor","decentralized","event-management","event-management-app","event-management-platform","event-management-system","event-platform","events","fediverse","floss","foss","open-source","pwa","self-host","w3c","webapp"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prd","description":"Generate a Product Requirements Document (PRD) for a new feature. Use when planning a feature, starting a new project, or when asked to create a PRD. Triggers on: create a prd, write prd for, plan this feature, requirements for, spec out.","bodyPreview":"# PRD Generator\n\nCreate detailed Product Requirements Documents that are clear, actionable, and suitable for implementation.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Receive a feature description from the user\n2. Ask 3-5 essential clarifying questions (with lettered options)\n3. Generate a structured PRD based on answers\n4. Save to `dev/active/prd.md`\n\n**Important:** Do NOT start implementing. Just create the PRD.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Clarifying Questions\n\nAsk only critical questions where the initial prompt is ambiguou","body":"# PRD Generator\n\nCreate detailed Product Requirements Documents that are clear, actionable, and suitable for implementation.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Receive a feature description from the user\n2. Ask 3-5 essential clarifying questions (with lettered options)\n3. Generate a structured PRD based on answers\n4. Save to `dev/active/prd.md`\n\n**Important:** Do NOT start implementing. Just create the PRD.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Clarifying Questions\n\nAsk only critical questions where the initial prompt is ambiguous. Focus on:\n\n- **Problem/Goal:** What problem does this solve?\n- **Core Functionality:** What are the key actions?\n- **Scope/Boundaries:** What should it NOT do?\n- **Success Criteria:** How do we know it''s done?\n\n### Format Questions Like This:\n\n```\n1. What is the primary goal of this feature?\n   A. Improve user onboarding experience\n   B. Increase user retention\n   C. Reduce support burden\n   D. Other: [please specify]\n\n2. Who is the target user?\n   A. New users only\n   B. Existing users only\n   C. All users\n   D. Admin users only\n\n3. What is the scope?\n   A. Minimal viable version\n   B. Full-featured implementation\n   C. Just the backend/API\n   D. Just the UI\n```\n\nThis lets users respond with \"1A, 2C, 3B\" for quick iteration.\n\n---\n\n## Step 2: PRD Structure\n\nGenerate the PRD with these sections:\n\n### 1. Introduction/Overview\n\nBrief description of the feature and the problem it solves.\n\n### 2. Goals\n\nSpecific, measurable objectives (bullet list).\n\n### 3. User Stories\n\nEach story needs:\n\n- **Title:** Short descriptive name\n- **Description:** \"As a [user], I want [feature] so that [benefit]\"\n- **Acceptance Criteria:** Verifiable checklist of what \"done\" means\n\nEach story should be small enough to implement in one focused session.\n\n**Format:**\n\n```markdown\n### US-001: [Title]\n\n**Description:** As a [user], I want [feature] so that [benefit].\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n\n- [ ] Specific verifiable criterion\n- [ ] Another criterion\n- [ ] Typecheck/lint passes\n- [ ] **[UI stories only]** Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n```\n\n**Important:**\n\n- Acceptance criteria must be verifiable, not vague. \"Works correctly\" is bad. \"Button shows confirmation dialog before deleting\" is good.\n- **For any story with UI changes:** Always include \"Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\" as acceptance criteria. This ensures visual verification of frontend work.\n\n### 4. Functional Requirements\n\nNumbered list of specific functionalities:\n\n- \"FR-1: The system must allow users to...\"\n- \"FR-2: When a user clicks X, the system must...\"\n\nBe explicit and unambiguous.\n\n### 5. Non-Goals (Out of Scope)\n\nWhat this feature will NOT include. Critical for managing scope.\n\n### 6. Design Considerations (Optional)\n\n- UI/UX requirements\n- Link to mockups if available\n- Relevant existing components to reuse\n\n### 7. Technical Considerations (Optional)\n\n- Known constraints or dependencies\n- Integration points with existing systems\n- Performance requirements\n\n### 8. Success Metrics\n\nHow will success be measured?\n\n- \"Reduce time to complete X by 50%\"\n- \"Increase conversion rate by 10%\"\n\n### 9. Open Questions\n\nRemaining questions or areas needing clarification.\n\n---\n\n## Writing for Junior Developers\n\nThe PRD reader may be a junior developer or AI agent. Therefore:\n\n- Be explicit and unambiguous\n- Avoid jargon or explain it\n- Provide enough detail to understand purpose and core logic\n- Number requirements for easy reference\n- Use concrete examples where helpful\n\n---\n\n## Archiving Previous PRDs\n\n**Before writing a new `dev/active/prd.md`, check if there is an existing one from a different feature:**\n\n1. Read the current `dev/active/prd.md` if it exists\n2. Check if it''s for a different feature than what you''re about to create\n3. If different:\n   - Extract feature name from PRD title/intro\n   - Check if archive folder already exists: look for `dev/archive/*-feature-name/`\n   - If found, use existing folder; if not, create `dev/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-feature-name/`\n   - Copy current `dev/active/prd.md` to archive folder\n   - Write the new PRD to `dev/active/prd.md`\n\n**Shared archive folders:** Multiple runs of same feature (across dates) share one archive folder. Prevents duplicate archives when PRD skill and task skill run on different days.\n\n---\n\n## Output\n\n- **Format:** Markdown (`.md`)\n- **Location:** `dev/active/`\n- **Filename:** `dev/active/prd.md`\n\n---\n\n## Example PRD\n\n```markdown\n# PRD: Task Priority System\n\n## Introduction\n\nAdd priority levels to tasks so users can focus on what matters most. Tasks can be marked as high, medium, or low priority, with visual indicators and filtering to help users manage their workload effectively.\n\n## Goals\n\n- Allow assigning priority (high/medium/low) to any task\n- Provide clear visual differentiation between priority levels\n- Enable filtering and sorting by priority\n- Default new tasks to medium priority\n\n## User Stories\n\n### US-001: Add priority field to database\n\n**Description:** As a developer, I need to store task priority so it persists across sessions.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n\n- [ ] Add priority column to tasks table: ''high'' | ''medium'' | ''low'' (default ''medium'')\n- [ ] Generate and run migration successfully\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n\n### US-002: Display priority indicator on task cards\n\n**Description:** As a user, I want to see task priority at a glance so I know what needs attention first.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n\n- [ ] Each task card shows colored priority badge (red=high, yellow=medium, gray=low)\n- [ ] Priority visible without hovering or clicking\n\n### US-003: Add priority selector to task edit\n\n**Description:** As a user, I want to change a task''s priority when editing it.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n\n- [ ] Priority dropdown in task edit modal\n- [ ] Shows current priority as selected\n- [ ] Saves immediately on selection change\n\n### US-004: Filter tasks by priority\n\n**Description:** As a user, I want to filter the task list to see only high-priority items when I''m focused.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n\n- [ ] Filter dropdown with options: All | High | Medium | Low\n- [ ] Filter persists in URL params\n- [ ] Empty state message when no tasks match filter\n\n## Functional Requirements\n\n- FR-1: Add `priority` field to tasks table (''high'' | ''medium'' | ''low'', default ''medium'')\n- FR-2: Display colored priority badge on each task card\n- FR-3: Include priority selector in task edit modal\n- FR-4: Add priority filter dropdown to task list header\n- FR-5: Sort by priority within each status column (high to medium to low)\n\n## Non-Goals\n\n- No priority-based notifications or reminders\n- No automatic priority assignment based on due date\n- No priority inheritance for subtasks\n\n## Technical Considerations\n\n- Reuse existing badge component with color variants\n- Filter state managed via URL search params\n- Priority stored in database, not computed\n\n## Success Metrics\n\n- Users can change priority in under 2 clicks\n- High-priority tasks immediately visible at top of lists\n- No regression in task list performance\n\n## Open Questions\n\n- Should priority affect task ordering within a column?\n- Should we add keyboard shortcuts for priority changes?\n```\n\n---\n\n## Checklist\n\nBefore saving the PRD:\n\n- [ ] **Archived previous PRD** (if `dev/active/prd.md` exists for a different feature, archive it first)\n- [ ] Asked clarifying questions with lettered options\n- [ ] Incorporated user''s answers\n- [ ] User stories are small and specific\n- [ ] Functional requirements are numbered and unambiguous\n- [ ] Non-goals section defines clear boundaries\n- [ ] Saved to `dev/active/prd.md`"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T01:57:24.363Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured Product Requirements Document generation.","zh":"适合需要结构化产品需求文档生成的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが構造化された製品要件文書を生成する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"구조화된 제품 요구 사항 문서 생성이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan generar documentos de Requisitos de Producto estructurados.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développement ayant besoin de générer des documents de Spécifications de Produit structurés.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel benötigende strukturierte Produktanforderungsdokumente.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de geração de Documentos de Requisitos de Produto estruturados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходима генерация структурированных документов требований к продукту.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد وثائق متطلبات المنتج المنظمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create detailed PRDs based on user input, utilizing markdown formatting for clear and actionable documentation, and saving to specific file paths like `dev/active/prd.md`.","zh":"使代理能够基于用户输入创建详细的PRD，利用markdown格式化生成清晰且可执行的文档，并保存到特定的文件路径，如`dev/active/prd.md`。","ja":"エージェントがユーザーの入力に基づいて詳細なPRDを作成できるようにし、markdown形式を使用して明確で実行可能なドキュメントを生成し、`dev/active/prd.md`などの特定のファイルパスに保存します。","ko":"에이전트가 사용자 입력에 기반하여 자세한 PRD를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, markdown 형식을 사용하여 명확하고 실행 가능한 문서를 생성하며, `dev/active/prd.md`와 같은 특정 파일 경로에 저장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear PRD detallados basados en la entrada del usuario, utilizando formato markdown para una documentación clara y accionable, y guardando en rutas de archivo específicas como `dev/active/prd.md`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des PRD détaillés basés sur les entrées de l''utilisateur, en utilisant le formatage markdown pour une documentation claire et actionnable, et en les sauvegardant dans des chemins de fichiers spécifiques comme `dev/active/prd.md`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, detaillierte PRD basierend auf Benutzereingaben zu erstellen, unter Verwendung von markdown-Formatierung für klare und handhabbare Dokumentation und unter Speicherung in bestimmten Dateipfaden wie `dev/active/prd.md`.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar PRDs detalhados com base na entrada do usuário, utilizando formatação markdown para documentação clara e ação, e salvando em caminhos de arquivo específicos como `dev/active/prd.md`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать подробные PRD на основе ввода пользователя, используя форматирование markdown для ясной и действенной документации, и сохраняя в определенные пути файлов, такие как `dev/active/prd.md`.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء وثائق متطلبات المنتج التفصيلية بناءً على مدخلات المستخدم، باستخدام تنسيق markdown لتوثيق واضح وقابل للتنفيذ، وحفظه في مسارات الملفات المحددة مثل `dev/active/prd.md`."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating PRDs from feature descriptions","Clarifying requirements through essential questioning","Automating documentation for development projects"],"zh":["从功能描述生成PRD","通过基本问题明确需求","为开发项目自动化文档"],"ja":["機能説明からPRDを生成する","基本的な質問を通じて要件を明確にする","開発プロジェクトの文書化を自動化する"],"ko":["기능 설명에서 PRD 생성","기본 질문을 통해 요구 사항 명확화","개발 프로젝트 문서 자동화"],"es":["Generación de PRD a partir de descripciones de características","Aclarar requisitos a través de preguntas esenciales","Automatización de la documentación para proyectos de desarrollo"],"fr":["Génération de PRD à partir de descriptions de fonctionnalités","Clarifier les exigences par le biais de questions essentielles","Automatisation de la documentation pour les projets de développement"],"de":["Generierung von PRD aus Funktionsbeschreibungen","Klärung von Anforderungen durch wesentliche Fragen","Automatisierung der Dokumentation für Entwicklungsprojekte"],"pt":["Geração de PRDs a partir de descrições de recursos","Eclarificação de requisitos por meio de questionamento essencial","Automatização da documentação para projetos de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Генерация PRD на основе описаний функций","Уточнение требований посредством основных вопросов","Автоматизация документации для проектов разработки"],"ar":["توليد وثائق متطلبات المنتج من وصفات الميزات","توضيح المتطلبات من خلال الأسئلة الأساسية","تحويل توثيق مشاريع التطوير إلى أتمتيك"]},"limitations":{"en":["Does not implement features, only generates PRD","Requires user input for feature description and clarifying questions"],"zh":["不实施功能，只生成PRD","需要用户输入功能描述和明确问题"],"ja":["機能を実装せず、PRDのみを生成する","機能説明と明確化の質問のためのユーザー入力を必要とする"],"ko":["기능을 구현하지 않고, PRD만 생성한다","기능 설명 및 명확화 질문에 대한 사용자 입력이 필요하다"],"es":["No implementa características, solo genera PRD","Requiere entrada del usuario para la descripción de características y aclaración de preguntas"],"fr":["N''implémente pas les fonctionnalités, ne génère que le PRD","Nécessite une entrée de l''utilisateur pour la description de fonctionnalités et les questions de clarification"],"de":["Implementiert keine Funktionen, generiert nur PRD","Benötigt Benutzereingaben für Funktionsbeschreibungen und Klärungsfragen"],"pt":["Não implementa recursos, gera apenas PRD","Requer entrada do usuário para descrição de recurso e perguntas de esclarecimento"],"ru":["Не реализует функции, только генерирует PRD","Требует ввода пользователя для описания функций и уточняющих вопросов"],"ar":["لا يطبق الميزات، فقط يولد وثائق متطلبات المنتج","يتطلب مدخلات المستخدم لوصف الميزة والأسئلة التوضيحية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"829c13908ab1360f7c18c029da2e3149bc778a0816ff5f0ccc9265ea959a01ed","qualityScore":49}');
