uxt","Hardware-beschleunigte Animationen"],"pt":["Animações declarativas","Interações baseadas em gestos","Tamanho de bundle mínimo","Aceleração por hardware","Compatibilidade com Vue 3 e Nuxt"],"ru":["Декларативные анимации","Жестовые взаимодействия","Минимальный размер бандла","Аппаратное ускорение","Совместимость с Vue 3 и Nuxt"],"ar":["التحريكات الإعلانية","التفاعلات القائمة على الإيماءات","الحجم الأدنى للباندل","التسريع بالعتاد","التوافق مع فيو 3 ونكست"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Motion Vue","Vue 3 动画","Nuxt 动画","声明式动画","手势交互","硬件加速","生产就绪","最小包大小"],"ja":["Motion Vue","Vue 3 アニメーション","Nuxt アニメーション","宣言的アニメーション","ジェスチャーインタラクション","ハードウェアアクセラレーション","プロダクションレディ","最小バンドルサイズ"],"ko":["모션 뷰","Vue 3 애니메이션","Nuxt 애니메이션","선언적 애니메이션","제스처 상호 작용","하드웨어 가속","생산 준비","최소 번들 크기"],"es":["Motion Vue","Animación en Vue 3","Nuxt animación","Biblioteca de animación","Animaciones declarativas","Interacciones gestuales","Desarrollo web"],"fr":["Motion Vue","Animation dans Vue 3","Nuxt animation","Bibliothèque d''animation","Animations déclaratives","Interactions gestuelles","Développement web"],"de":["Motion Vue","Animation in Vue 3","Nuxt Animation","Animationsbibliothek","Deklarative Animationen","Gestische Interaktionen","Webentwicklung"],"pt":["Motion Vue","animação Vue 3","animação Nuxt","biblioteca de animação","animações declarativas","interações baseadas em gestos"],"ru":["Motion Vue","анимация Vue 3","анимация Nuxt","библиотека анимации","декларативные анимации","жестовые взаимодействия"],"ar":["موشن فيو","تحريك فيو 3","تحريك نكست","مكتبة تحريك","التحريكات الإعلانية","التفاعلات القائمة على الإيماءات"]}},"owner":"onmax","repo":"nuxt-skills","repoPath":"onmax/nuxt-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.667Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"motion","description":"Use when adding animations with Motion Vue (motion-v) - provides motion component API, gesture animations, scroll-linked effects, layout transitions, and composables for Vue 3/Nuxt","bodyPreview":"# Motion Vue (motion-v)\n\nAnimation library for Vue 3 and Nuxt. Production-ready, hardware-accelerated animations with minimal bundle size.\n\n**Current stable:** motion-v 1.x - Vue port of Motion (formerly Framer Motion)\n\n## Overview\n\nProgressive reference for Motion Vue animations. Load only files relevant to current task (~200 tokens base, 500-1500 per sub-file).\n\n## When to Use\n\n**Use Motion Vue for:**\n\n- Simple declarative animations (fade, slide, scale)\n- Gesture-based interactions (hover, ta","body":"# Motion Vue (motion-v)\n\nAnimation library for Vue 3 and Nuxt. Production-ready, hardware-accelerated animations with minimal bundle size.\n\n**Current stable:** motion-v 1.x - Vue port of Motion (formerly Framer Motion)\n\n## Overview\n\nProgressive reference for Motion Vue animations. Load only files relevant to current task (~200 tokens base, 500-1500 per sub-file).\n\n## When to Use\n\n**Use Motion Vue for:**\n\n- Simple declarative animations (fade, slide, scale)\n- Gesture-based interactions (hover, tap, drag)\n- Scroll-linked animations\n- Layout animations and shared element transitions\n- Spring physics animations\n\n**Consider alternatives:**\n\n- **GSAP** - Complex timelines, SVG morphing, scroll-triggered sequences\n- **@vueuse/motion** - Simpler API, less features, smaller bundle\n- **CSS animations** - Simple transitions without JS\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\n# Vue 3\npnpm add motion-v\n\n# Nuxt 3\npnpm add motion-v @vueuse/nuxt\n```\n\n```ts\n// nuxt.config.ts - Nuxt 3 setup\nexport default defineNuxtConfig({\n  modules: [''motion-v/nuxt''],\n})\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Working on...                | Load file                 |\n| ---------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| Motion component, gestures   | references/components.md  |\n| useMotionValue, useScroll    | references/composables.md |\n| Animation examples, patterns | references/examples.md    |\n\n## Loading Files\n\n**Consider loading these reference files based on your task:**\n\n- [ ] [references/components.md](references/components.md) - if using Motion component, gestures, or layout animations\n- [ ] [references/composables.md](references/composables.md) - if using useMotionValue, useScroll, useSpring, or animate()\n- [ ] [references/examples.md](references/examples.md) - if looking for animation patterns or inspiration\n\n**DO NOT load all files at once.** Load only what''s relevant to your current task.\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### Motion Component\n\nRender any HTML/SVG element with animation capabilities:\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { motion } from ''motion-v''\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <motion.div\n    :initial=\"{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }\"\n    :animate=\"{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }\"\n    :exit=\"{ opacity: 0, y: -20 }\"\n    :transition=\"{ duration: 0.3 }\"\n  >\n    Animated content\n  </motion.div>\n</template>\n```\n\n### Gesture Animations\n\n```vue\n<motion.button\n  :whileHover=\"{ scale: 1.05 }\"\n  :whilePress=\"{ scale: 0.95 }\"\n  :transition=\"{ type: ''spring'', stiffness: 400 }\"\n>\n  Click me\n</motion.button>\n```\n\n### Scroll Animations\n\n```vue\n<motion.div\n  :initial=\"{ opacity: 0 }\"\n  :whileInView=\"{ opacity: 1 }\"\n  :viewport=\"{ once: true, margin: ''-100px'' }\"\n>\n  Appears on scroll\n</motion.div>\n```\n\n## Available Guidance\n\n**[references/components.md](references/components.md)** - Motion component variants, animation props, gesture props, layout animations, transition configuration\n\n**[references/composables.md](references/composables.md)** - useMotionValue, useSpring, useTransform, useScroll, useInView, animate()\n\n**[references/examples.md](references/examples.md)** - External resources, component libraries, animation patterns and inspiration\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:22:08.659Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring production-ready, hardware-accelerated animations in Vue 3 and Nuxt applications.","zh":"适用于需要生产就绪、硬件加速动画的Vue 3和Nuxt应用程序的前端代理。","ja":"Vue 3およびNuxtアプリケーションで生産就緒のハードウェアアクセラレーションアニメーションを必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに適しています。","ko":"프로덕션 준비 및 하드웨어 가속 애니메이션을 필요한 Vue 3 및 Nuxt 애플리케이션을 위한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes frontend que requieren animaciones con aceleración por hardware listas para producción en aplicaciones Vue 3 y Nuxt.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend nécessitant des animations prêtes pour la production avec accélération matérielle dans les applications Vue 3 et Nuxt.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agenten, die produktionsreife, hardwarebeschleunigte Animationen in Vue 3- und Nuxt-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que exigem animações prontas para produção, aceleradas por hardware, em aplicações Vue 3 e Nuxt.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, требующих анимаций, готовых к производству, ускоренных аппаратно, в приложениях Vue 3 и Nuxt.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين yêuاجون الرسوم المتحركة الجاهزة للإنتاج، والمسرعة بالأجهزة، في تطبيقات Vue 3 و Nuxt."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create simple declarative animations, such as fade, slide, and scale, and gesture-based interactions like hover and tap using Motion Vue''s minimal bundle size and hardware-accelerated capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理创建简单的声明式动画，例如渐入、滑动和缩放，并使用Motion Vue的最小包大小和硬件加速功能实现基于手势的交互，如悬停和点击。","ja":"エージェントに、Motion Vueの最小バンドルサイズとハードウェアアクセラレーション機能を使用して、フェード、スライド、スケールなどのシンプルな宣言型アニメーションを作成し、ホーバーとタップなどのジェスチャーベースのインタラクションを実現することを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 Motion Vue의 최소 번들 크기와 하드웨어 가속 기능을 사용하여 페이드, 슬라이드, 스케일 등의 간단한 선언적 애니메이션을 생성하고, 호버와 탭 등의 제스처 기반 상호 작용을 구현할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear animaciones declarativas simples, como desvanecimiento, deslizamiento y escala, y interacciones basadas en gestos como hover y tap utilizando el tamaño mínimo del paquete de Motion Vue y sus capacidades con aceleración por hardware.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des animations déclaratives simples, telles que le fondu, le défilement et la mise à l''échelle, et des interactions basées sur les gestes comme le survol et le tap en utilisant la taille minimale du paquet de Motion Vue et ses capacités d''accélération matérielle.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, einfache deklarative Animationen wie Fade, Slide und Scale sowie gestenbasierte Interaktionen wie Hover und Tap unter Verwendung der minimalen Bundle-Größe von Motion Vue und seiner hardwarebeschleunigten Fähigkeiten zu erstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar animações declarativas simples, como fade, slide e scale, e interações baseadas em gestos, como hover e toque, usando o tamanho mínimo do pacote do Motion Vue e as capacidades aceleradas por hardware.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать простые декларативные анимации, такие как затухание, скольжение и масштабирование, и жестовые взаимодействия, такие как наведение и касание, используя минимальный размер пакета Motion Vue и аппаратно ускоренные возможности.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء رسوم متحركة إعلانية بسيطة، مثل التلاشي والانزلاق والتكبير، وتفاعلات تعتمد على الإشارات مثل الحوفر والنقر، باستخدام الحزمة المصغرة من Motion Vue والقدرات المسرعة بالأجهزة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating progressive reference for Motion Vue animations","Implementing gesture-based interactions for hover and tap events","Creating simple declarative animations for fade, slide, and scale effects"],"zh":["为Motion Vue动画生成进度参考","实现基于手势的交互，例如悬停和点击事件","创建简单的声明式动画，例如渐入、滑动和缩放效果"],"ja":["Motion Vueアニメーションの進度参照を生成する","ホーバーとタップイベントなどのジェスチャーベースのインタラクションを実装する","フェード、スライド、スケールなどのシンプルな宣言型アニメーションを作成する"],"ko":["Motion Vue 애니메이션을 위한 진행 참조를 생성하는 것","호버 및 탭 이벤트를 위한 제스처 기반 상호 작용을 구현하는 것","페이드, 슬라이드, 스케일 등의 간단한 선언적 애니메이션을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Generar referencia progresiva para animaciones de Motion Vue","Implementar interacciones basadas en gestos para eventos de hover y tap","Crear animaciones declarativas simples para efectos de desvanecimiento, deslizamiento y escala"],"fr":["Générer une référence progressive pour les animations Motion Vue","Mettre en œuvre des interactions basées sur les gestes pour les événements de survol et de tap","Créer des animations déclaratives simples pour les effets de fondu, de défilement et de mise à l''échelle"],"de":["Erzeugen einer progressiven Referenz für Motion-Vue-Animationen","Implementieren von gestenbasierten Interaktionen für Hover- und Tap-Ereignisse","Erstellen einfacher deklarative Animationen für Fade-, Slide- und Scale-Effekte"],"pt":["Gerar referência progressiva para animações do Motion Vue","Implementar interações baseadas em gestos para eventos de hover e toque","Criar animações declarativas simples para efeitos de fade, slide e scale"],"ru":["Генерировать прогрессивную ссылку для анимаций Motion Vue","Реализовывать жестовые взаимодействия для событий наведения и касания","Создавать простые декларативные анимации для эффектов затухания, скольжения и масштабирования"],"ar":["إيجاد مرجع تقدمي لرسوم متحركة Motion Vue","تنفيذ التفاعلات المعتمدة على الإشارات للأحداث الحوفر والنقر","إنشاء رسوم متحركة إعلانية بسيطة لأffects التلاشي والانزلاق والتكبير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vue 3 or Nuxt","Limited to Motion Vue''s features and capabilities"],"zh":["需要Vue 3或Nuxt","仅限于Motion Vue的功能和能力"],"ja":["Vue 3またはNuxtが必要","Motion Vueの機能と能力に制限される"],"ko":["Vue 3 또는 Nuxt가 필요함","Motion Vue의 기능 및 능력에 한정됨"],"es":["Requiere Vue 3 o Nuxt","Limitado a las características y capacidades de Motion Vue"],"fr":["Nécessite Vue 3 ou Nuxt","Limité aux fonctionnalités et capacités de Motion Vue"],"de":["Benötigt Vue 3 oder Nuxt","Begrenzt auf die Funktionen und Fähigkeiten von Motion Vue"],"pt":["Exige Vue 3 ou Nuxt","Limitado às funcionalidades e capacidades do Motion Vue"],"ru":["Требует Vue 3 или Nuxt","Ограничен функциональностью и возможностями Motion Vue"],"ar":["يتطلب Vue 3 أو Nuxt","محدود بالوظائف والقدرات المتوفرة في Motion Vue"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f0e7a7749a2eed534f115c551b6ff27c17c9f38c25689302b7032fe583e41a60","qualityScore":49}');
