ompatibilität mit der Befehlszeile von Claude Code","Entwicklung benutzerdefinierter Plugins mit Python"],"pt":["Plugins personalizados para Claude Code CLI","Melhoria da produtividade de desenvolvimento","Integração com React, Python e Node.js","Suporte à linha de comando","Desenvolvimento de plugins personalizados"],"ru":["Пользовательские плагины для Claude Code CLI","Повышение производительности разработки","Интеграция с React, Python и Node.js","Поддержка командной строки","Разработка пользовательских плагинов"],"ar":["ملحقات مخصصة لكلود كود CLI","تحسين إنتاجية التطوير","التكامل مع React و Python و Node.js","دعم سطر الأوامر","تطوير ملحقات مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Excalidraw是什么","如何使用Excalidraw","Claude Code自定义插件","Excalidraw替代品","Excalidraw安装","Excalidraw设置指南","AI智能工具","开发效率提高"],"ja":["Excalidrawとは","Excalidrawの使い方","Claude Codeカスタムプラグイン","Excalidrawの代替","Excalidrawのインストール","Excalidrawの設定ガイド","AIエージェント","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["Excalidraw이란","Excalidraw 사용법","Claude Code 커스텀 플러그인","Excalidraw 대체","Excalidraw 설치","Excalidraw 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["cómo usar Excalidraw","qué es Excalidraw","alternativas a Claude Code","Excalidraw vs Claude Code","instalación de Excalidraw","guía de configuración de Excalidraw","desarrollo de plugins con Python","integración con React y Node.js"],"fr":["comment utiliser Excalidraw","qu''est-ce qu''Excalidraw","alternatives à Claude Code","Excalidraw vs Claude Code","installation d''Excalidraw","guide de configuration d''Excalidraw","développement de plugins avec Python","intégration avec React et Node.js"],"de":["wie man Excalidraw verwendet","was ist Excalidraw","Alternativen zu Claude Code","Excalidraw vs Claude Code","Installation von Excalidraw","Konfigurationsanleitung für Excalidraw","Entwicklung von Plugins mit Python","Integration mit React und Node.js"],"pt":["como usar Excalidraw","o que é Excalidraw","Excalidraw vs Claude Code","instalar Excalidraw","guia de configuração do Excalidraw","desenvolvimento de plugins personalizados","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvimento","produtividade de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["как использовать Excalidraw","что такое Excalidraw","Excalidraw vs Claude Code","установить Excalidraw","руководство по настройке Excalidraw","разработка пользовательских плагинов","инструменты ИИ для разработки","производительность разработки"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Excalidraw","ما هي Excalidraw","Excalidraw مقابل كلود كود","تثبيت Excalidraw","دليل إعداد Excalidraw","تطوير ملحقات مخصصة","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتنمية","إنتاجية التطوير"]}},"owner":"ooiyeefei","repo":"ccc","repoPath":"ooiyeefei/ccc","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.674Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"excalidraw","description":"Generate architecture diagrams as .excalidraw files from codebase analysis, with optional PNG/SVG export. Use when the user asks to create architecture diagrams, system diagrams, visualize codebase structure, generate excalidraw files, export excalidraw diagrams to PNG or SVG, or convert .excalidraw files to image formats.","bodyPreview":"# Excalidraw Diagram Generator\n\nGenerate architecture diagrams as `.excalidraw` files directly from codebase analysis, with optional export to PNG and SVG.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**User just asks:**\n```\n\"Generate an architecture diagram for this project\"\n\"Create an excalidraw diagram of the system\"\n\"Visualize this codebase as an excalidraw file\"\n```\n\n**Claude Code will:**\n1. Analyze the codebase (any language/framework)\n2. Identify components, services, databases, APIs\n3. Map relationships and da","body":"# Excalidraw Diagram Generator\n\nGenerate architecture diagrams as `.excalidraw` files directly from codebase analysis, with optional export to PNG and SVG.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**User just asks:**\n```\n\"Generate an architecture diagram for this project\"\n\"Create an excalidraw diagram of the system\"\n\"Visualize this codebase as an excalidraw file\"\n```\n\n**Claude Code will:**\n1. Analyze the codebase (any language/framework)\n2. Identify components, services, databases, APIs\n3. Map relationships and data flows\n4. Generate valid `.excalidraw` JSON with dynamic IDs and labels\n5. Optionally export to PNG and/or SVG using Playwright\n\n**No prerequisites:** Works without existing diagrams, Terraform, or specific file types.\n\n---\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### 1. NEVER Use Diamond Shapes\n\nDiamond arrow connections are broken in raw Excalidraw JSON. Use styled rectangles instead:\n\n| Semantic Meaning | Rectangle Style |\n|------------------|-----------------|\n| Orchestrator/Hub | Coral (`#ffa8a8`/`#c92a2a`) + strokeWidth: 3 |\n| Decision Point | Orange (`#ffd8a8`/`#e8590c`) + dashed stroke |\n\n### 2. Labels Require TWO Elements\n\nThe `label` property does NOT work in raw JSON. Every labeled shape needs:\n\n```json\n// 1. Shape with boundElements reference\n{\n  \"id\": \"my-box\",\n  \"type\": \"rectangle\",\n  \"boundElements\": [{ \"type\": \"text\", \"id\": \"my-box-text\" }]\n}\n\n// 2. Separate text element with containerId\n{\n  \"id\": \"my-box-text\",\n  \"type\": \"text\",\n  \"containerId\": \"my-box\",\n  \"text\": \"My Label\"\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Elbow Arrows Need Three Properties\n\nFor 90-degree corners (not curved):\n\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"arrow\",\n  \"roughness\": 0,        // Clean lines\n  \"roundness\": null,     // Sharp corners\n  \"elbowed\": true        // 90-degree mode\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Arrow Edge Calculations\n\nArrows must start/end at shape edges, not centers:\n\n| Edge | Formula |\n|------|---------|\n| Top | `(x + width/2, y)` |\n| Bottom | `(x + width/2, y + height)` |\n| Left | `(x, y + height/2)` |\n| Right | `(x + width, y + height/2)` |\n\n**Detailed arrow routing:** See `references/arrows.md`\n\n---\n\n## Element Types\n\n| Type | Use For |\n|------|---------|\n| `rectangle` | Services, databases, containers, orchestrators |\n| `ellipse` | Users, external systems, start/end points |\n| `text` | Labels inside shapes, titles, annotations |\n| `arrow` | Data flow, connections, dependencies |\n| `line` | Grouping boundaries, separators |\n\n**Full JSON format:** See `references/json-format.md`\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Analyze Codebase\n\nDiscover components by looking for:\n\n| Codebase Type | What to Look For |\n|---------------|------------------|\n| Monorepo | `packages/*/package.json`, workspace configs |\n| Microservices | `docker-compose.yml`, k8s manifests |\n| IaC | Terraform/Pulumi resource definitions |\n| Backend API | Route definitions, controllers, DB models |\n| Frontend | Component hierarchy, API calls |\n\n**Use tools:**\n- `Glob` → `**/package.json`, `**/Dockerfile`, `**/*.tf`\n- `Grep` → `app.get`, `@Controller`, `CREATE TABLE`\n- `Read` → README, config files, entry points\n\n### Step 2: Plan Layout\n\n**Vertical flow (most common):**\n```\nRow 1: Users/Entry points (y: 100)\nRow 2: Frontend/Gateway (y: 230)\nRow 3: Orchestration (y: 380)\nRow 4: Services (y: 530)\nRow 5: Data layer (y: 680)\n\nColumns: x = 100, 300, 500, 700, 900\nElement size: 160-200px x 80-90px\n```\n\n**Other patterns:** See `references/examples.md`\n\n### Step 3: Generate Elements\n\nFor each component:\n1. Create shape with unique `id`\n2. Add `boundElements` referencing text\n3. Create text with `containerId`\n4. Choose color based on type\n\n**Color palettes:** See `references/colors.md`\n\n### Step 4: Add Connections\n\nFor each relationship:\n1. Calculate source edge point\n2. Plan elbow route (avoid overlaps)\n3. Create arrow with `points` array\n4. Match stroke color to destination type\n\n**Arrow patterns:** See `references/arrows.md`\n\n### Step 5: Add Grouping (Optional)\n\nFor logical groupings:\n- Large transparent rectangle with `strokeStyle: \"dashed\"`\n- Standalone text label at top-left\n\n### Step 6: Validate and Write\n\nRun validation before writing. Save to `docs/` or user-specified path.\n\n**Validation checklist:** See `references/validation.md`\n\n### Step 7: Export to PNG/SVG (Optional)\n\nAfter writing the `.excalidraw` file, ask the user if they want PNG, SVG, or both exports.\n\nUses Playwright MCP tools and `@excalidraw/utils` to programmatically render the diagram — no manual upload to excalidraw.com needed.\n\n**Requires:** Playwright MCP tools (`browser_navigate`, `browser_run_code`, `browser_close`).\n\n**Full export procedure:** See `references/export.md`\n\n---\n\n## Quick Arrow Reference\n\n**Straight down:**\n```json\n{ \"points\": [[0, 0], [0, 110]], \"x\": 590, \"y\": 290 }\n```\n\n**L-shape (left then down):**\n```json\n{ \"points\": [[0, 0], [-325, 0], [-325, 125]], \"x\": 525, \"y\": 420 }\n```\n\n**U-turn (callback):**\n```json\n{ \"points\": [[0, 0], [50, 0], [50, -125], [20, -125]], \"x\": 710, \"y\": 440 }\n```\n\n**Arrow width/height** = bounding box of points:\n```\npoints [[0,0], [-440,0], [-440,70]] → width=440, height=70\n```\n\n**Multiple arrows from same edge** - stagger positions:\n```\n5 arrows: 20%, 35%, 50%, 65%, 80% across edge width\n```\n\n---\n\n## Default Color Palette\n\n| Component | Background | Stroke |\n|-----------|------------|--------|\n| Frontend | `#a5d8ff` | `#1971c2` |\n| Backend/API | `#d0bfff` | `#7048e8` |\n| Database | `#b2f2bb` | `#2f9e44` |\n| Storage | `#ffec99` | `#f08c00` |\n| AI/ML | `#e599f7` | `#9c36b5` |\n| External APIs | `#ffc9c9` | `#e03131` |\n| Orchestration | `#ffa8a8` | `#c92a2a` |\n| Message Queue | `#fff3bf` | `#fab005` |\n| Cache | `#ffe8cc` | `#fd7e14` |\n| Users | `#e7f5ff` | `#1971c2` |\n\n**Cloud-specific palettes:** See `references/colors.md`\n\n---\n\n## Quick Validation Checklist\n\nBefore writing file:\n- [ ] Every shape with label has boundElements + text element\n- [ ] Text elements have containerId matching shape\n- [ ] Multi-point arrows have `elbowed: true`, `roundness: null`\n- [ ] Arrow x,y = source shape edge point\n- [ ] Arrow final point offset reaches target edge\n- [ ] No diamond shapes\n- [ ] No duplicate IDs\n\n**Full validation algorithm:** See `references/validation.md`\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues\n\n| Issue | Fix |\n|-------|-----|\n| Labels don''t appear | Use TWO elements (shape + text), not `label` property |\n| Arrows curved | Add `elbowed: true`, `roundness: null`, `roughness: 0` |\n| Arrows floating | Calculate x,y from shape edge, not center |\n| Arrows overlapping | Stagger start positions across edge |\n\n**Detailed bug fixes:** See `references/validation.md`\n\n---\n\n## Reference Files\n\n| File | Contents |\n|------|----------|\n| `references/json-format.md` | Element types, required properties, text bindings |\n| `references/arrows.md` | Routing algorithm, patterns, bindings, staggering |\n| `references/colors.md` | Default, AWS, Azure, GCP, K8s palettes |\n| `references/examples.md` | Complete JSON examples, layout patterns |\n| `references/validation.md` | Checklists, validation algorithm, bug fixes |\n| `references/export.md` | PNG/SVG export procedure via Playwright |\n\n---\n\n## Output\n\n- **Location:** `docs/architecture/` or user-specified\n- **Filename:** Descriptive, e.g., `system-architecture.excalidraw`\n- **Exports (optional):** `system-architecture.svg` and/or `system-architecture.png` in same directory\n- **Testing:** Open `.excalidraw` in https://excalidraw.com or VS Code extension; `.svg` and `.png` can be viewed directly or embedded in documentation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:23:24.285Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing advanced architecture diagram generation capabilities via excalidraw files.","zh":"非常适合需要通过excalidraw文件高级架构图生成能力的代码分析代理。","ja":"コード分析エージェントがexcalidrawファイルを介して高度なアーキテクチャ図生成機能を必要とする場合に最適。","ko":"코드 분석 에이전트가 excalidraw 파일을 통해 고급 아키텍처 다이어그램 생성 기능을 필요로 할 때 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Código que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de generación de diagramas de arquitectura a través de archivos excalidraw.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Code nécessitant des capacités avancées de génération de diagrammes d''architecture via des fichiers excalidraw.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agents, die erweiterte Architekturdiagramm-Generierungsfunktionen über excalidraw-Dateien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de geração de diagramas de arquitetura via arquivos excalidraw.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Анализа Кодов, требующих продвинутых возможностей генерации диаграмм архитектуры через файлы excalidraw.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تحليل الشفرة الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإنشاء رسومات هيكلية عبر ملفات excalidraw."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate architecture diagrams as .excalidraw files directly from codebase analysis, with optional export to PNG and SVG, utilizing codebase mapping and relationship identification.","zh":"赋予代理直接从代码库分析生成架构图作为.excalidraw文件的能力，具有可选的PNG和SVG导出功能，利用代码库映射和关系识别。","ja":"コードベース分析から直接.excalidrawファイルとしてアーキテクチャ図を生成するエージェントの能力を提供します。コードベースマッピングと関係性の識別を利用し、PNGおよびSVGへのオプションのエクスポートも可能です。","ko":"에이전트가 코드베이스 분석에서 직접 .excalidraw 파일로 아키텍처 다이어그램을 생성하는 기능을 제공하며, 코드베이스 매핑 및 관계 식별을 사용하여 PNG 및 SVG로의 옵션导出도 가능합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar diagramas de arquitectura como archivos .excalidraw directamente desde el análisis de la base de código, con exportación opcional a PNG y SVG, utilizando el mapeo de la base de código y la identificación de relaciones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des diagrammes d''architecture sous forme de fichiers .excalidraw directement à partir de l''analyse de la base de code, avec une exportation facultative vers PNG et SVG, en utilisant le mappage de la base de code et l''identification des relations.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Architekturdiagramme als .excalidraw-Dateien direkt aus der Codebase-Analyse zu generieren, mit optionaler Exportmöglichkeit zu PNG und SVG, unter Verwendung der Codebase-Zuordnung und Beziehungsidentifizierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar diagramas de arquitetura como arquivos .excalidraw diretamente da análise da base de código, com exportação opcional para PNG e SVG, utilizando mapeamento da base de código e identificação de relacionamentos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать диаграммы архитектуры в виде файлов .excalidraw直接 из анализа кодовой базы, с возможностью экспорта в PNG и SVG, используя сопоставление кодовой базы и идентификацию отношений.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء رسومات هيكلية كملفات .excalidraw مباشرة من تحليل قاعدة الشفرة، مع إمكانية تصدير اختياري إلى PNG وSVG، باستخدام تعيين قاعدة الشفرة وتحديد العلاقات."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating architecture diagrams for codebase visualization","Creating excalidraw diagrams for system documentation","Automating codebase analysis and visualization for development projects"],"zh":["为代码库可视化生成架构图","为系统文档创建excalidraw图表","自动化代码库分析和可视化以用于开发项目"],"ja":["コードベースの可視化のためのアーキテクチャ図の生成","システムドキュメント用のexcalidraw図の作成","開発プロジェクトに使用するコードベース分析および可視化の自動化"],"ko":["코드베이스 시각화를 위한 아키텍처 다이어그램 생성","시스템 문서를 위한 excalidraw 다이어그램 생성","개발 프로젝트에 사용되는 코드베이스 분석 및 시각화 자동화"],"es":["Generación de diagramas de arquitectura para la visualización de la base de código","Creación de diagramas excalidraw para la documentación del sistema","Automatización del análisis y la visualización de la base de código para proyectos de desarrollo"],"fr":["Génération de diagrammes d''architecture pour la visualisation de la base de code","Création de diagrammes excalidraw pour la documentation du système","Automation de l''analyse et de la visualisation de la base de code pour les projets de développement"],"de":["Generierung von Architekturdiagrammen für die Visualisierung der Codebase","Erstellung von excalidraw-Diagrammen für die Systemdokumentation","Automatisierung der Analyse und Visualisierung der Codebase für Entwicklungsprojekte"],"pt":["Geração de diagramas de arquitetura para visualização da base de código","Criação de diagramas excalidraw para documentação do sistema","Automatização da análise e visualização da base de código para projetos de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Генерация диаграмм архитектуры для визуализации кодовой базы","Создание диаграмм excalidraw для системной документации","Автоматизация анализа и визуализации кодовой базы для проектов разработки"],"ar":["إنشاء رسومات هيكلية لتصور قاعدة الشفرة","إنشاء رسومات excalidraw لتوثيق النظام","أتمتة تحليل وتصور قاعدة الشفرة لمشاريع التطوير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires codebase access for analysis","Limited to generating diagrams in excalidraw, PNG, and SVG formats"],"zh":["需要代码库访问权限进行分析","仅限于生成excalidraw、PNG和SVG格式的图表"],"ja":["分析のためにコードベースへのアクセスが必要","excalidraw、PNG、SVG形式の図のみを生成可能"],"ko":["분석을 위해 코드베이스 접근 권한이 필요합니다","excalidraw, PNG, SVG 형식의 다이어그램만 생성 가능"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código para el análisis","Limitado a la generación de diagramas en formatos excalidraw, PNG y SVG"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code pour l''analyse","Limité à la génération de diagrammes aux formats excalidraw, PNG et SVG"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Codebase für die Analyse","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von Diagrammen in excalidraw-, PNG- und SVG-Formaten"],"pt":["Requer acesso à base de código para análise","Limitado a gerar diagramas nos formatos excalidraw, PNG e SVG"],"ru":["Требует доступа к кодовой базе для анализа","Ограничен генерацией диаграмм в форматах excalidraw, PNG и SVG"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة الشفرة للتحليل","محدود بإنشاء الرسومات في تنسيقات excalidraw وPNG وSVG"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a5e257e280fd877c31ce33c69c739ce40f11861c6008aa0a79f48652fbd622f5","qualityScore":49}');
