e Implementierung mit CLI"],"pt":["Análise de dados de mercado","Identificação de tendências de consumo","Otimização da experiência do usuário","Desenvolvimento de produtos personalizados","Integração com plataformas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Анализ рыночных данных","Определение тенденций потребления","Оптимизация пользовательского опыта","Разработка персонализированных продуктов","Интеграция с платформами разработки"],"ar":["تحليل بيانات السوق","تحديد اتجاهات الاستهلاك","تحسين تجربة المستخدم","تطوير منتجات مخصصة","التكامل مع منصات التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用AI工具分析产品市场","什么是产品吸引力分析","产品吸引力分析器安装","产品设计优化技巧","竞争对手分析工具","市场趋势预测方法","AI智能工具","产品市场分析软件"],"ja":["AIエージェントを使用して製品の市場を分析する方法","製品アピール分析とは","製品アピール分析ツールのインストール","製品設計最適化のテクニック","競合他社分析ツール","市場動向予測方法","AIエージェント","製品市場分析ソフトウェア"],"ko":["AI 에이전트를 사용하여 제품의 시장 분석하는 방법","제품 매력 분석이란","제품 매력 분석기 설치","제품 설계 최적화 기술","경쟁사 분석 도구","시장 동향 예측 방법","AI 에이전트","제품 시장 분석 소프트웨어"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de IA","qué es el análisis de atractivo de producto","alternativas a Claude","Claude vs otros agentes de IA","instalación de herramientas de IA","guía de configuración de Claude"],"fr":["comment utiliser des outils d''IA","qu''est-ce que l''analyse d''attrait de produit","alternatives à Claude","Claude vs autres outils d''IA","installation d''outils d''IA","guide de configuration de Claude"],"de":["wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist die Produkt-Anziehungskraft-Analyse","Alternativen zu Claude","Claude vs andere KI-Tools","Installation von KI-Tools","Konfigurationsanleitung für Claude"],"pt":["como usar analisador de apelo de produto","o que é analisador de apelo de produto","analisador de apelo de produto vs concorrentes","instalar analisador de apelo de produto","guia de configuração do analisador de apelo de produto","desenvolvimento de produtos com ferramentas de IA","analisador de apelo de produto para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать анализатор привлекательности продукта","что такое анализатор привлекательности продукта","анализатор привлекательности продукта vs конкуренты","установить анализатор привлекательности продукта","руководство по настройке анализатора привлекательности продукта","разработка продуктов с помощью ИИ Агентов","анализатор привлекательности продукта для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام محلل جاذبية المنتج","ما هو محلل جاذبية المنتج","محلل جاذبية المنتج مقابل المنافسين","تثبيت محلل جاذبية المنتج","دليل إعداد محلل جاذبية المنتج","تطوير المنتجات باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","محلل جاذبية المنتج للمطورين"]}},"owner":"erichowens","repo":"some_claude_skills","repoPath":"erichowens/some_claude_skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.682Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"product-appeal-analyzer","description":"Evaluate product desirability, market positioning, and emotional resonance—the complement to friction analysis. Assess whether users will WANT a product (not just use it), identity fit, trust signals, and value proposition clarity. Activate on will they like it, market positioning, appeal analysis, product desirability, value proposition, why would someone choose this, landing page review, conversion optimization, messaging strategy. NOT for UX friction analysis (use ux-friction-analyzer), visual design implementation (use web-design-expert), or A/B test setup (use frontend-developer).","tags":"","bodyPreview":"# Product Appeal Analyzer\n\nEvaluate whether users will *want* a product—not just use it. The complement to friction analysis.\n\n**Core insight**: Users don''t choose the best product—they choose the product that feels most like it was made for them.\n\n## When to Use\n\n✅ **Use for:**\n- Evaluating landing pages, product pages, app store listings\n- Positioning a product against alternatives\n- Crafting messaging, tone, visual identity direction\n- Assessing emotional resonance with target personas\n- Pre-","body":"# Product Appeal Analyzer\n\nEvaluate whether users will *want* a product—not just use it. The complement to friction analysis.\n\n**Core insight**: Users don''t choose the best product—they choose the product that feels most like it was made for them.\n\n## When to Use\n\n✅ **Use for:**\n- Evaluating landing pages, product pages, app store listings\n- Positioning a product against alternatives\n- Crafting messaging, tone, visual identity direction\n- Assessing emotional resonance with target personas\n- Pre-launch \"will this convert?\" analysis\n\n❌ **NOT for:**\n- UX friction audits (→ use ux-friction-analyzer)\n- Visual design execution (→ use web-design-expert)\n- A/B test implementation (→ use frontend-developer)\n- Market size estimation or financial forecasting\n- Feature comparison matrices\n\n---\n\n## The Desirability Triangle\n\n**All three must be present.** Missing any one kills conversion:\n\n```\n                    IDENTITY FIT\n                    \"This is for people like me\"\n                         /\\\n                        /  \\\n                       /    \\\n                      /  ★   \\\n                     / DESIRE \\\n                    /          \\\n                   /______________\\\n        PROBLEM               TRUST\n        URGENCY               SIGNALS\n   \"I need this now\"     \"This will actually work\"\n```\n\n| Missing Element | User Reaction |\n|-----------------|---------------|\n| Identity Fit | \"Seems useful, but not for me\" |\n| Problem Urgency | \"Cool, maybe someday\" |\n| Trust Signals | \"Looks sketchy / too good to be true\" |\n\n**Decision tree**: When analyzing, score each vertex 1-10. If any is &lt;5, that''s your priority fix.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Analysis: The 5-Second Test\n\nWithin 5 seconds of landing, a visitor should know:\n\n1. **What is this?** (Category recognition)\n2. **Who is it for?** (Identity signal)\n3. **What''s the core promise?** (Value proposition)\n4. **What do I do next?** (Clear CTA)\n\n**How to run it:**\n- Show landing page to someone unfamiliar for exactly 5 seconds\n- Hide it, then ask: \"What was that? Who''s it for? What would you do there?\"\n- Record verbatim—don''t coach or clarify\n\n**Scoring:**\n\n| Result | Score | Action |\n|--------|-------|--------|\n| All 4 clear in &lt;3 sec | 9-10 | Ship it |\n| All 4 clear in 3-5 sec | 7-8 | Minor polish |\n| 3 of 4 clear | 5-6 | Fix the gap |\n| 2 or fewer clear | 2-4 | Significant rework |\n| Confusing/unclear | 0-1 | Start over |\n\n---\n\n## Analysis Process\n\n### Step 1: Identify Target Personas\n\nFor each persona, document:\n- **Who**: One-sentence description\n- **Problem**: What''s broken + how it feels\n- **Current workaround**: What they do today (and why it sucks)\n- **Identity**: How they see themselves, who they want to become\n\n### Step 2: Score the Desirability Triangle\n\nFor each persona:\n\n```\nPERSONA: [Name]\n\nIDENTITY FIT                    [/10]\n  Visual identity match         [/10]  \"Does this look like my kind of tool?\"\n  Language resonance            [/10]  \"Do they speak my language?\"\n  Implied user match            [/10]  \"Are people like me shown?\"\n\nPROBLEM URGENCY                 [/10]\n  Pain point acknowledged       [/10]  \"They understand my problem\"\n  Emotional resonance           [/10]  \"They get how frustrating it is\"\n  Solution clarity              [/10]  \"I see how this fixes it\"\n\nTRUST SIGNALS                   [/10]\n  Professional execution        [/10]  \"This looks legitimate\"\n  Social proof                  [/10]  \"Others like me use it\"\n  Risk reduction                [/10]  \"What if it doesn''t work?\"\n\nOVERALL APPEAL SCORE:           [/90]\n```\n\n### Step 3: Map Objections\n\n| Objection | Type | How Addressed? |\n|-----------|------|----------------|\n| \"Is this legit?\" | Trust | [Answer] |\n| \"I''ve tried things before\" | Skepticism | [Answer] |\n| \"Too expensive\" | Value | [Answer] |\n| \"Too complicated\" | Effort | [Answer] |\n| \"Not for people like me\" | Identity | [Answer] |\n| \"What if it doesn''t work?\" | Risk | [Answer] |\n| \"I''ll do it later\" | Urgency | [Answer] |\n\n### Step 4: Generate Recommendations\n\nUse priority formula: `Impact = (Users Affected × Severity) / Fix Difficulty`\n\nCategorize into:\n- **Immediate** (ship this week)\n- **Medium-term** (this sprint)\n- **Long-term** (roadmap)\n\n---\n\n## Common Anti-Patterns\n\n### Feature Soup Headline\n\n**Novice thinking**: \"List all capabilities to show value\"\n\n**Reality**: Visitors scan for 2-3 seconds. Feature lists feel generic.\n\n**What to use instead**:\n| Bad | Good |\n|-----|------|\n| \"AI-Powered Recovery Planning Tool with Analytics\" | \"Know exactly what to do next in your recovery\" |\n| \"Comprehensive Legal Document Platform\" | \"Find out in 2 minutes if your record can be expunged\" |\n\n**Detection**: Headline contains 3+ nouns or buzzwords like \"AI-powered\", \"comprehensive\", \"platform\"\n\n### Screenshot Hero\n\n**Novice thinking**: \"Show the product interface so people know what they''re getting\"\n\n**Reality**: Strangers don''t understand your UI. They care about outcomes.\n\n**What to use instead**:\n- Person experiencing the benefit\n- The outcome/result they''ll get\n- Abstract visualization of the transformation\n\n**Detection**: Hero image is a product screenshot with no context\n\n### Trust Ladder Violation\n\n**Novice thinking**: \"Get their email immediately, then convert them\"\n\n**Reality**: Trust builds in stages. Asking for too much too early kills conversion.\n\n**The Trust Ladder** (each rung requires more trust):\n1. Land on page → Professional design, no broken elements\n2. Click/explore → Clear navigation, fast load\n3. Spend &gt;2 min → Demonstrated value, clear progress\n4. Enter info → Why you need it explained, no dark patterns\n5. Create account → Privacy visible, minimal fields, clear benefit\n6. Pay money → Guarantee, testimonials, recognizable processor\n\n**Detection**: Asking for account creation before demonstrating value\n\n### Identity Mismatch\n\n**Novice thinking**: \"Broad appeal = more users\"\n\n**Reality**: When everyone is the target, no one feels targeted.\n\n**What to use instead**:\n| Signal Type | How It Works |\n|-------------|--------------|\n| Visual identity | Dark mode = \"power user\"; Soft pastels = \"wellness\" |\n| Language/tone | \"Crush your goals\" vs \"Find your balance\" |\n| Social proof | Company logos vs individual testimonials |\n| Complexity | Minimal = simplicity-seeker; Feature-rich = power user |\n\n**Detection**: Homepage tries to appeal to 3+ different personas\n\n---\n\n## Self-Contained Tools\n\n### Analysis Workflow\n\n1. **Read** the landing page content and structure\n2. **WebFetch** the target URL to analyze live content\n3. **Write** analysis results to a markdown file\n4. **Edit** recommendations into actionable copy changes\n\n### Appeal Scorer Script\n\nRun: `python scripts/appeal_scorer.py <url>`\n\nProduces structured JSON output with scores and recommendations.\n\n### Reference Files (See for deep dives)\n\n| File | When to Use |\n|------|-------------|\n| `references/scoring-templates.md` | Full scoring matrices and templates |\n| `references/trust-ladder.md` | Deep dive on trust building stages |\n| `references/identity-signals.md` | Visual/verbal identity signal catalog |\n| `references/objection-catalog.md` | Common objections by product type |\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nWhen running this skill, produce:\n\n1. **Executive Summary** - 3 bullet key findings\n2. **Desirability Triangle Scores** - Per persona\n3. **5-Second Test Assessment** - What''s clear, what''s not\n4. **Top 3 Objections** - And how to address them\n5. **Priority Recommendations** - Immediate / Medium / Long-term\n\n---\n\n## Integration with ux-friction-analyzer\n\n**Appeal + Friction = Complete picture**\n\n| This Skill Answers | ux-friction-analyzer Answers |\n|--------------------|------------------------------|\n| \"Do they want it?\" | \"Can they use it?\" |\n| Will they choose this over alternatives? | Can they complete the task? |\n| Does it feel made for them? | Does the flow make sense? |\n| Is the promise compelling? | Is the experience smooth? |\n\n**Run both**: High appeal + high friction = frustrated users. Low friction + low appeal = abandoned product.\n\n---\n\n**Philosophy**: A product with low friction but low appeal gets abandoned. A product with high appeal but high friction gets frustrated users. You need both.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:24:40.639Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing advanced product appeal analysis and user resonance evaluation.","zh":"非常适合需要高级产品吸引力分析和用户共鸣评估的营销代理","ja":"マーケティングエージェントが高度な製品アピール分析とユーザー共鳴評価を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"고급 제품 매력 분석 및 사용자 공鳴 평가가 필요한 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing que necesitan un análisis avanzado de atractivo de producto y evaluación de resonancia del usuario.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing ayant besoin d''une analyse avancée de l''attrait du produit et d''une évaluation de la résonance de l''utilisateur.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die eine fortschrittliche Produktattraktivitätsanalyse und Benutzerresonanzbewertung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing que necessitam de análise avançada de apelo de produto e avaliação de ressonância do usuário.","ru":"Идеально подходит для маркетинговых агентов, которым требуется продвинутый анализ привлекательности продукта и оценка резонанса пользователя.","ar":"مثالي لعمال التسويق الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل متقدم لجاذبية المنتج وتقييم共鸣 المستخدم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to evaluate product appeal through landing page analysis, competitor positioning, and emotional resonance assessment using natural language processing and machine learning protocols, generating actionable insights for product optimization and targeted messaging.","zh":"赋予代理评估产品吸引力通过着陆页分析、竞争对手定位和情感共鸣评估，使用自然语言处理和机器学习协议，生成可行的洞察力以优化产品和有针对性的信息传递","ja":"エージェントがランディングページ分析、競合他社の位置付け、感情の共鳴評価を使用して製品の魅力を評価できるようにし、自然言語処理と機械学習プロトコルを使用して、製品の最適化とターゲットメッセージングのための実行可能な洞察を生成する","ko":"에이전트가 랜딩 페이지 분석, 경쟁사 위치 지정 및 감정의 공鳴 평가를 사용하여 제품의 매력을 평가할 수 있도록 하며, 자연어 처리 및 기계 학습 프로토콜을 사용하여 제품 최적화 및 타겟 메시지 전달을 위한 실질적인 통찰력을 생성","es":"Habilita a los agentes a evaluar el atractivo del producto a través del análisis de la página de destino, la posición de los competidores y la evaluación de la resonancia emocional utilizando protocolos de procesamiento de lenguaje natural y aprendizaje automático, generando conocimientos aprovechables para la optimización de productos y la mensajería dirigida.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''évaluer l''attrait du produit grâce à l''analyse de la page de destination, au positionnement des concurrents et à l''évaluation de la résonance émotionnelle en utilisant des protocoles de traitement du langage naturel et des protocoles d''apprentissage automatique, générant des connaissances exploitables pour l''optimisation des produits et la messagerie ciblée.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, den Produktattraktivität durch die Analyse der Landingpage, die Wettbewerberpositionierung und die emotionale Resonanzbewertung unter Verwendung von Natural Language Processing- und Machine Learning-Protokollen zu bewerten, wodurch handhabbare Erkenntnisse für die Produktoptimierung und die gezielte Messaging generiert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a avaliar o apelo do produto por meio da análise de página de destino, posicionamento de concorrentes e avaliação de ressonância emocional usando protocolos de processamento de linguagem natural e aprendizado de máquina, gerando insights ação para otimização de produto e mensagens direcionadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оценить привлекательность продукта путем анализа страницы назначения, позиционирования конкурентов и оценки эмоциональной резонанса с использованием протоколов обработки естественного языка и машинного обучения, генерируя действенные идеи для оптимизации продукта и целевого сообщения.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تقييم جاذبية المنتج من خلال تحليل صفحة الوجهة وتركيب المنافسين وتقييم التأثير العاطفي باستخدام بروتوكولات معالجة اللغة الطبيعية وبروتوكولات التعلم الآلي، مما يولد رؤى مفعمة بالفعل لتحسين المنتج والرسائل المستهدفة."},"useCases":{"en":["Evaluating product pages for user engagement","Crafting personalized messaging for target personas","Assessing emotional resonance with target audiences"],"zh":["评估产品页面的用户参与度","为目标人群量身定制信息传递","评估与目标受众的情感共鸣"],"ja":["ユーザー関与度のための製品ページの評価","ターゲットペルソナのためのパーソナライズドメッセージングの作成","ターゲットオーディエンスとの感情の共鳴の評価"],"ko":["사용자 참여도를 위한 제품 페이지 평가","타겟 페르소나를 위한 개인화된 메시지 생성","타겟 오디언스와의 감정의 공鳴 평가"],"es":["Evaluación de páginas de producto para la participación del usuario","Creación de mensajes personalizados para las personas objetivo","Evaluación de la resonancia emocional con las audiencias objetivo"],"fr":["Évaluation des pages de produit pour l''engagement de l''utilisateur","Création de messages personnalisés pour les personas cibles","Évaluation de la résonance émotionnelle avec les audiences cibles"],"de":["Bewertung von Produktseiten für die Benutzerbeteiligung","Erstellung personalisierter Nachrichten für Zielpersonen","Bewertung der emotionalen Resonanz mit den Zielgruppen"],"pt":["Avaliar páginas de produto para engajamento do usuário","Criar mensagens personalizadas para personas-alvo","Avaliar ressonância emocional com audiências-alvo"],"ru":["Оценка страниц продукта для вовлеченности пользователя","Создание персонализированных сообщений для целевых персон","Оценка эмоциональной резонанса с целевой аудиторией"],"ar":["تقييم صفحات المنتج لاستخدام المستخدم","إنشاء رسائل مخصصة لأشخاص المستهدفين","تقييم التأثير العاطفي على الجماهير المستهدفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires comprehensive product and user data","Limited to digital products and services","Dependent on high-quality training data for accurate analysis"],"zh":["需要全面性的产品和用户数据","仅限于数字产品和服务","依赖于高质量的训练数据以进行准确的分析"],"ja":["包括的な製品とユーザーデータが必要","デジタル製品とサービスに限定","正確な分析のための高品質のトレーニングデータに依存"],"ko":["포괄적인 제품 및 사용자 데이터가 필요","디지털 제품 및 서비스에 한정","정확한 분석을 위한 고품질의 교육 데이터에 의존"],"es":["Requiere datos completos de productos y usuarios","Limitado a productos y servicios digitales","Dependiente de datos de entrenamiento de alta calidad para un análisis preciso"],"fr":["Nécessite des données complètes sur les produits et les utilisateurs","Limité aux produits et services numériques","Dépendant de données de formation de haute qualité pour une analyse précise"],"de":["Benötigt umfassende Produkt- und Benutzerdaten","Begrenzt auf digitale Produkte und Dienstleistungen","Abhängig von hochwertigen Trainingsdaten für eine genaue Analyse"],"pt":["Exige dados abrangentes de produto e usuário","Limitado a produtos e serviços digitais","Dependente de dados de treinamento de alta qualidade para análise precisa"],"ru":["Требует полных данных о продукте и пользователе","Ограничен цифровыми продуктами и услугами","Зависит от качественных данных для обучения для точного анализа"],"ar":["يتطلب بيانات شاملة للمنتج والمستخدم","محدود بالمنتجات والخدمات الرقمية","يعتمد على بيانات تدريب عالية الجودة لتحليل دقيق"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"08eff215c38aac2277b569cadf5a704124d88a814cadba4e4d6a16b4548b91b3","qualityScore":49}');
