s de vent et de houle","Cartes de spots de kite","Prévision des conditions de kite"],"de":["Kite-Spot-Datenbank","Wettervorhersage für Kitesurfer","Integration mit KI-Tools","Informationen zu Wind und Wellen","Kite-Spot-Karten","Vorhersage von Kite-Bedingungen"],"pt":["Banco de dados de spots de kitesurf","Previsão do tempo em tempo real","Filtros personalizados para encontrar os melhores spots","Integração com ferramentas de navegação","Atualizações regulares de dados e previsão"],"ru":["База данных спотов для кайтсёрфинга","Прогноз погоды в режиме реального времени","Пользовательские фильтры для поиска лучших спотов","Интеграция с навигационными инструментами","Регулярные обновления данных и прогноза"],"ar":["قاعدة بيانات للمواقع الرائدة","تنبؤات الطقس في الوقت الفعلي","مرشحات مخصصة للعثور على أفضل المواقع","التكامل مع أدوات الملاحة","تحديثات منتظمة للبيانات والتنبؤ"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 profile-blocking","什么是 profile-blocking","profile-blocking 替代品","profile-blocking 安装","profile-blocking 教程","AI 智能工具","风筝运动爱好者数据库","天气预报"],"ja":["profile-blocking の使用方法","profile-blocking とは","profile-blocking の代替","profile-blocking のインストール","profile-blocking のチュートリアル","AI エージェント","カイトスポットデータベース","天気予報"],"ko":["profile-blocking 사용법","profile-blocking 이란","profile-blocking 대안","profile-blocking 설치","profile-blocking 가이드","AI 에이전트","카이트서핑 데이터베이스","날씨 예보"],"es":["herramientas de inteligencia artificial para kitesurf","spots de kite","pronóstico del tiempo para kitesurfers","cómo usar herramientas de perfil de bloqueo","alternativas a herramientas de perfil de bloqueo","instalación de herramientas de perfil de bloqueo","guias de configuración de herramientas de perfil de bloqueo","qué es el perfil de bloqueo"," cómo funciona el perfil de bloqueo"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour kitesurfers","spots de kite","prévision météo pour kitesurfers","comment utiliser des outils de blocage de profil","alternatives aux outils de blocage de profil","installation d''outils de blocage de profil","guides de configuration d''outils de blocage de profil","qu''est-ce que le blocage de profil","comment fonctionne le blocage de profil"],"de":["KI-Tools für Kitesurfer","Kite-Spots","Wettervorhersage für Kitesurfer","wie man Kitesurf-Profil-Blockierungstools verwendet","Alternativen zu Kitesurf-Profil-Blockierungstools","Installation von Kitesurf-Profil-Blockierungstools","Konfigurationsanleitungen für Kitesurf-Profil-Blockierungstools","was ist Kitesurf-Profil-Blockierung","wie funktioniert Kitesurf-Profil-Blockierung"],"pt":["como usar profile-blocking","o que é profile-blocking","profile-blocking alternativa","profile-blocking vs ferramentas de kitesurf","instalar profile-blocking","guia de configuração do profile-blocking","ferramentas de IA para kitesurf","previsão do tempo para kitesurf"],"ru":["как использовать profile-blocking","что такое profile-blocking","альтернатива profile-blocking","profile-blocking vs инструменты для кайтсёрфинга","установка profile-blocking","руководство по настройке profile-blocking","инструменты ИИ для кайтсёрфинга","прогноз погоды для кайтсёрфинга"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أداة profile-blocking","ما هي أداة profile-blocking","بديل أداة profile-blocking","أداة profile-blocking مقابل أدوات الرائدة","تثبيت أداة profile-blocking","دليل إعداد أداة profile-blocking","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للرائدة","تنبؤات الطقس للرائدة"]}},"owner":"pwittchen","repo":"varun.surf","repoPath":"pwittchen/varun.surf","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.695Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"profile-blocking","description":"Find blocking calls in reactive WebFlux code that can cause performance issues and thread starvation","bodyPreview":"# Profile Blocking Skill\n\nIdentify blocking calls in the reactive codebase that can cause thread starvation, deadlocks, and performance degradation in Spring WebFlux applications.\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. Search for Blocking Patterns\n\nUse `Grep` to search for these blocking call patterns:\n\n#### Direct Blocking Calls\n```java\n.block()           // Mono/Flux blocking subscription\n.blockFirst()      // Flux blocking first element\n.blockLast()       // Flux blocking last element\n.blockOptional()   //","body":"# Profile Blocking Skill\n\nIdentify blocking calls in the reactive codebase that can cause thread starvation, deadlocks, and performance degradation in Spring WebFlux applications.\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. Search for Blocking Patterns\n\nUse `Grep` to search for these blocking call patterns:\n\n#### Direct Blocking Calls\n```java\n.block()           // Mono/Flux blocking subscription\n.blockFirst()      // Flux blocking first element\n.blockLast()       // Flux blocking last element\n.blockOptional()   // Mono blocking to Optional\n.toFuture().get()  // CompletableFuture blocking\n.get()             // Future.get() blocking\n.join()            // CompletableFuture.join()\n```\n\n#### Thread Blocking\n```java\nThread.sleep(      // Thread sleep\nObject.wait(       // Object monitor wait\n.await(            // CountDownLatch, CyclicBarrier await\n.acquire(          // Semaphore blocking acquire\nsynchronized       // Synchronized blocks (potential)\nReentrantLock.lock // Explicit locking\n```\n\n#### Blocking I/O\n```java\nInputStream        // Blocking input streams\nOutputStream       // Blocking output streams\nFileInputStream    // File I/O\nFileOutputStream   // File I/O\nBufferedReader     // Blocking readers\nScanner            // Blocking scanner\nnew URL(           // URL.openStream() is blocking\nHttpURLConnection  // Blocking HTTP\n```\n\n#### JDBC/Database (if present)\n```java\nJdbcTemplate       // Blocking JDBC\nEntityManager      // Blocking JPA\n.save(             // Repository blocking save\n.findBy            // Repository blocking find\nDataSource         // Direct datasource access\n```\n\n### 2. Context-Aware Analysis\n\nFor each finding, determine if it''s:\n\n**Acceptable blocking**:\n- Inside `StructuredTaskScope` (this project uses Java 24 virtual threads)\n- In `@Scheduled` methods running on separate thread pool\n- In test code\n- Wrapped in `Mono.fromCallable()` with `.subscribeOn(Schedulers.boundedElastic())`\n- In startup/initialization code (non-request path)\n\n**Problematic blocking**:\n- In `@RestController` methods returning `Mono`/`Flux`\n- In reactive chain operators (map, flatMap, filter)\n- On Netty event loop threads\n- In `WebFilter` implementations\n- Inside `Mono.create()` or `Flux.create()` without scheduler\n\n### 3. Analyze Reactive Chains\n\nCheck for anti-patterns in reactive code:\n\n```java\n// BAD: Blocking in map\nmono.map(data -> {\n    blockingCall();  // Blocks event loop!\n    return result;\n})\n\n// BAD: Blocking in flatMap\nflux.flatMap(item -> {\n    var result = blockingService.call();  // Blocks!\n    return Mono.just(result);\n})\n\n// GOOD: Proper offloading\nmono.flatMap(data ->\n    Mono.fromCallable(() -> blockingCall())\n        .subscribeOn(Schedulers.boundedElastic())\n)\n```\n\n### 4. Check This Project''s Specific Patterns\n\n**Files to examine**:\n- `src/main/java/**/controller/*.java` - REST endpoints\n- `src/main/java/**/service/*.java` - Service layer\n- `src/main/java/**/strategy/*.java` - Strategy implementations\n- `src/main/java/**/config/*.java` - Configuration classes\n\n**Known acceptable patterns in this project**:\n- `StructuredTaskScope` usage in `AggregatorService` (virtual threads)\n- `.block()` inside virtual thread contexts\n- OkHttp calls (executed in separate thread pool)\n\n**Patterns to flag**:\n- `.block()` in controller methods\n- Blocking in `WebFilter` or `HandlerFilterFunction`\n- Synchronous HTTP calls without proper scheduling\n\n### 5. Virtual Thread Considerations\n\nThis project uses Java 24 with virtual threads. Check:\n\n```java\n// Virtual thread factory usage\nThread.ofVirtual().factory()\n\n// StructuredTaskScope usage (blocking is OK inside)\ntry (var scope = new StructuredTaskScope.ShutdownOnFailure()) {\n    scope.fork(() -> blockingCall());  // OK - virtual thread\n    scope.join();  // OK - virtual thread blocks, not platform thread\n}\n```\n\n### 6. HTTP Client Analysis\n\nCheck OkHttp usage patterns:\n\n```java\n// Synchronous call - check if on reactive thread\nResponse response = client.newCall(request).execute();\n\n// Better: Use async\nclient.newCall(request).enqueue(callback);\n\n// Or wrap properly\nMono.fromCallable(() -> client.newCall(request).execute())\n    .subscribeOn(Schedulers.boundedElastic())\n```\n\n## Output Format\n\n```markdown\n## Blocking Call Analysis Report\n\n### Summary\n| Category | Count | Severity |\n|----------|-------|----------|\n| Direct .block() calls | X | High/Medium |\n| Thread.sleep() | X | High |\n| Blocking I/O | X | Medium |\n| Synchronized blocks | X | Low |\n| **Total potential issues** | **Y** | |\n\n### Critical Issues (Event Loop Blocking)\n\n#### [Issue Title]\n**File**: `path/to/file.java:line`\n**Pattern**: `.block()` in reactive chain\n**Context**: Inside @RestController endpoint\n**Risk**: Thread starvation, request timeouts\n```java\n// Current code\n@GetMapping(\"/data\")\npublic Mono<Data> getData() {\n    return service.fetchData()\n        .map(d -> blockingTransform(d));  // BLOCKS!\n}\n```\n**Fix**:\n```java\n@GetMapping(\"/data\")\npublic Mono<Data> getData() {\n    return service.fetchData()\n        .flatMap(d -> Mono.fromCallable(() -> blockingTransform(d))\n            .subscribeOn(Schedulers.boundedElastic()));\n}\n```\n\n### Medium Priority (Potential Issues)\n\n| File | Line | Pattern | Context | Verdict |\n|------|------|---------|---------|---------|\n| Service.java | 42 | .block() | Inside StructuredTaskScope | OK |\n| Handler.java | 78 | Thread.sleep | Test code | OK |\n\n### Acceptable Blocking (Verified Safe)\n\nThese blocking calls are in appropriate contexts:\n\n| File | Line | Pattern | Why It''s OK |\n|------|------|---------|-------------|\n| AggregatorService.java | 120 | .block() | Inside virtual thread scope |\n| ForecastService.java | 85 | OkHttp.execute() | Wrapped in fromCallable |\n\n### Patterns Found\n\n#### .block() Calls\n```\nsrc/main/java/.../Service.java:42  - response.block()\nsrc/main/java/.../Service.java:87  - result.blockFirst()\n```\n\n#### Thread Blocking\n```\nsrc/main/java/.../Worker.java:23   - Thread.sleep(1000)\n```\n\n#### Blocking I/O\n```\nsrc/main/java/.../Reader.java:15   - new FileInputStream()\n```\n\n### Recommendations\n\n1. **Immediate**: Move blocking call at `File.java:42` to bounded elastic scheduler\n2. **Review**: Verify StructuredTaskScope usage covers all blocking in AggregatorService\n3. **Consider**: Replace synchronous OkHttp with async calls or WebClient\n\n### Reactive Best Practices Checklist\n\n- [ ] No .block() in @RestController methods\n- [ ] No .block() in WebFilter implementations\n- [ ] Blocking I/O wrapped with boundedElastic scheduler\n- [ ] Thread.sleep() only in tests or scheduled tasks\n- [ ] Synchronized blocks minimized and not in hot paths\n- [ ] HTTP clients properly configured for async or offloaded\n```\n\n## Execution Steps\n\n1. Use `Grep` to find all `.block()` calls\n2. Use `Grep` to find `Thread.sleep`, `.await(`, `synchronized`\n3. Use `Grep` to find blocking I/O patterns\n4. Read each file to determine context (controller vs service vs test)\n5. Check if blocking is inside StructuredTaskScope or virtual thread\n6. Categorize findings by severity\n7. Generate report with fix recommendations\n\n## Notes\n\n- Virtual threads (Java 21+) change the blocking calculus - blocking is OK on virtual threads\n- This project uses StructuredTaskScope, so verify scope boundaries\n- OkHttp is blocking by default but may be acceptable if not on event loop\n- Focus on request-handling paths; scheduled tasks are lower priority\n- Some `.block()` in tests is normal and acceptable\n- Spring WebFlux Netty uses limited event loop threads - blocking them is critical\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:36:11.916Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Reactive Java Agents needing to identify performance degradation in Spring WebFlux applications.","zh":"非常适合需要识别性能下降的Reactive Java Agents在Spring WebFlux应用程序中。","ja":"Spring WebFluxアプリケーションでパフォーマンスの低下を識別する必要があるReactive Javaエージェントに最適です。","ko":"성능 저하를 식별해야 하는 Reactice Java 에이전트에게 Spring WebFlux 응용 프로그램에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Java Reactivos que necesitan identificar la degradación del rendimiento en aplicaciones Spring WebFlux.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Java réactifs qui ont besoin d''identifier la dégradation des performances dans les applications Spring WebFlux.","de":"Perfekt für reaktive Java-Agents, die Leistungsabnahmen in Spring WebFlux-Anwendungen identifizieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Java Reativos que precisam identificar degradação de desempenho em aplicações Spring WebFlux.","ru":"Идеально подходит для реактивных агентов Java, которым необходимо выявлять ухудшение производительности в приложениях Spring WebFlux.","ar":"مثالي لعميل جافا التفاعلي الذي يحتاج إلى تحديد انخفاض الأداء في تطبيقات Spring WebFlux."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to detect blocking calls in reactive codebases using Grep, preventing thread starvation, deadlocks, and performance degradation by analyzing Mono/Flux blocking subscription patterns such as .block(), .blockFirst(), and .blockLast().","zh":"赋予代理检测反应式代码库中的阻塞调用，使用Grep，通过分析Mono/Flux阻塞订阅模式（例如.block()、.blockFirst()和.blockLast()）来防止线程饥饿、死锁和性能下降。","ja":"Grepを使用して、.block()、.blockFirst()、.blockLast()などのMono/Fluxブロッキングサブスクリプションパターンを分析することで、スレッド枯渇、デッドロック、パフォーマンスの低下を防ぐために、リアクティブコードベース内のブロッキングコールを検出できるようにエージェントに権限を付与します。","ko":"Grep를 사용하여 Mono/Flux 블로킹 구독 패턴(.block(), .blockFirst(), .blockLast() 등)을 분석하여 스레드 기근, 교착 상태 및 성능 저하를 방지하기 위해 반응형 코드베이스에서 블로킹 호출을 검색할 수 있는 에이전트를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a detectar llamadas bloqueantes en bases de código reactivas utilizando Grep, evitando la escasez de hilos, bloqueos y degradación del rendimiento al analizar patrones de suscripción bloqueante de Mono/Flux como .block(), .blockFirst() y .blockLast().","fr":"Permet aux agents de détecter les appels bloquants dans les bases de code réactives en utilisant Grep, prévenant ainsi la pénurie de threads, les blocages et la dégradation des performances en analysant les modèles d''abonnement bloquant de Mono/Flux tels que .block(), .blockFirst() et .blockLast().","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, blockierende Aufrufe in reaktivem Code zu erkennen, indem Grep verwendet wird, und verhindert so Thread-Verknappung, Deadlocks und Leistungsabnahmen durch die Analyse von Mono/Flux-Blockabonnementmustern wie .block(), .blockFirst() und .blockLast().","pt":"Habilita os agentes a detectar chamadas de bloqueio em código reativo usando Grep, prevenindo a fome de threads, deadlocks e degradação de desempenho, analisando padrões de assinatura de bloqueio Mono/Flux, como .block(), .blockFirst() e .blockLast().","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обнаруживать блокирующие вызовы в реактивном коде с помощью Grep, предотвращая голодание потоков, тупики и ухудшение производительности путем анализа закономерностей блокировки подписки Mono/Flux, таких как .block(), .blockFirst() и .blockLast().","ar":"تمكين العملاء من اكتشاف المكالمات المحظورة في قاعدة الكود التفاعلي باستخدام Grep، ومنع مجاعة الخيوط والقفل المتعطل وتدهور الأداء عن طريق تحليل أنماط الاشتراك المحظورة Mono/Flux مثل .block() و .blockFirst() و .blockLast()."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging thread starvation issues","Identifying deadlocks in reactive code","Optimizing Spring WebFlux application performance"],"zh":["调试线程饥饿问题","识别反应式代码中的死锁","优化Spring WebFlux应用程序性能"],"ja":["スレッド枯渇の問題をデバッグする","リアクティブコードのデッドロックを識別する","Spring WebFluxアプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化する"],"ko":["스레드 기근 문제 디버깅","반응형 코드의 교착 상태 식별","Spring WebFlux 응용 프로그램 성능 최적화"],"es":["Depuración de problemas de escasez de hilos","Identificación de bloqueos en código reactivo","Optimización del rendimiento de la aplicación Spring WebFlux"],"fr":["Débogage des problèmes de pénurie de threads","Identification des blocages dans le code réactif","Optimisation des performances de l''application Spring WebFlux"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei Thread-Verknappungsproblemen","Identifizierung von Deadlocks in reaktivem Code","Optimierung der Leistung von Spring WebFlux-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Depuração de problemas de fome de threads","Identificação de deadlocks em código reativo","Otimização do desempenho de aplicações Spring WebFlux"],"ru":["Отладка проблем с голоданием потоков","Обнаружение тупиков в реактивном коде","Оптимизация производительности приложений Spring WebFlux"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء نقص الخيوط","تحديد القفل المتعطل في الكود التفاعلي","تحسين أداء تطبيقات Spring WebFlux"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to reactive codebase","Limited to Spring WebFlux applications","Dependent on Grep functionality"],"zh":["需要访问反应式代码库","仅限Spring WebFlux应用程序","依赖于Grep功能"],"ja":["リアクティブコードベースへのアクセスが必要","Spring WebFluxアプリケーションに限定される","Grepの機能に依存する"],"ko":["반응형 코드베이스에 대한 액세스가 필요함","Spring WebFlux 응용 프로그램에만 적용됨","Grep 기능에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código reactivo","Limitado a aplicaciones Spring WebFlux","Dependiente de la funcionalidad de Grep"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code réactive","Limité aux applications Spring WebFlux","Dépend de la fonctionnalité de Grep"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die reaktive Codebasis","Begrenzt auf Spring WebFlux-Anwendungen","Abhängig von der Funktionalität von Grep"],"pt":["Exige acesso à base de código reativo","Limitado a aplicações Spring WebFlux","Dependente da funcionalidade Grep"],"ru":["Требует доступа к реактивной базе кода","Ограничен приложениями Spring WebFlux","Зависит от функциональности Grep"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة الكود التفاعلي","محدود بتطبيقات Spring WebFlux","يعتمد على وظيفة Grep"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"fd7d8e18083bbf90058d1a469a74b86d2e8079196080861c0e1bfa6e17a84e8b","qualityScore":49}');
