,"Agents d''IA personnalisés"],"de":["Personalisierte Konfiguration von KI-Tools","Steigerung der Produktivität für Entwickler","Integration mit Technologien wie React und Node.js","Kompatibilität mit CLI","Personalisierte KI-Agents"],"pt":["Integração com React","Suporte a Python e Node.js","Interface de linha de comando (CLI)","Personalização de configurações","Melhoria da produtividade de desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Интеграция с React","Поддержка Python и Node.js","Интерфейс командной строки (CLI)","Настройка конфигураций","Повышение производительности разработчиков"],"ar":["التكامل مع React","دعم Python و Node.js","واجهة سطر أوامر (CLI)","تخصيص الإعدادات","تحسين إنتاجية المطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具","Claude Code配置","AIエージェント集成","代码开发指南","AI工具安装","AI工具设置","如何使用AI工具","什么是AIエージェント","AIエージェント的优点"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Claude Code設定","AIエージェント統合","コード開発ガイド","AIツールのインストール","AIツールの設定","AIツールの使い方","AIエージェントとは","AIエージェントの利点"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Claude Code 구성","AI 에이전트 통합","코드 개발 가이드","AI 도구 설치","AI 도구 설정","AI 도구 사용법","AI 에이전트란","AI 에이전트의 장점"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","cómo utilizar Claude Code","configuración de herramientas de AI","alternativas a Claude Code","Claude Code vs otros herramientas de AI","instalación de Claude Code","guía de configuración de Claude Code"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les développeurs","comment utiliser Claude Code","configuration d''outils d''IA","alternatives à Claude Code","Claude Code vs autres outils d''IA","installation de Claude Code","guide de configuration de Claude Code"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","wie man Claude Code verwendet","Konfiguration von KI-Tools","Alternativen zu Claude Code","Claude Code vs andere KI-Tools","Installation von Claude Code","Konfigurationsanleitung für Claude Code"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","configuração Claude Code","desenvolvimento de software","produtividade de desenvolvedores","React","Python","Node.js","CLI","como usar configuração Claude Code"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","личная конфигурация Claude Code","разработка программного обеспечения","производительность разработчиков","React","Python","Node.js","CLI","как использовать личную конфигурацию Claude Code"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","إعدادات Claude Code الشخصية","تطوير البرمجيات","إنتاجية المطورين","React","Python","Node.js","CLI","كيفية استخدام إعدادات Claude Code الشخصية"]}},"owner":"utkudarilmaz","repo":"claude-code-setup","repoPath":"utkudarilmaz/claude-code-setup","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.696Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"docs","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to update documentation, document this change, sync docs with code, audit documentation, restructure docs, update README, update CLAUDE.md, update docs folder, document API, update postman collection, or /docs. Supports scoped, comprehensive (all), and restructuring (simplifier) modes.","bodyPreview":"# Docs Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nDispatch the docs agent to synchronize documentation with code changes. The agent updates README.md, CLAUDE.md, docs/* directory files, API docs, postman collections, and other documentation files to keep them accurate and current.\n\n## When to Invoke\n\nInvoke this skill after:\n\n- Implementing new features or modifying existing ones\n- Modifying APIs, endpoints, or response schemas\n- Changing configuration options or environment variables\n- Restructuring files or directori","body":"# Docs Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nDispatch the docs agent to synchronize documentation with code changes. The agent updates README.md, CLAUDE.md, docs/* directory files, API docs, postman collections, and other documentation files to keep them accurate and current.\n\n## When to Invoke\n\nInvoke this skill after:\n\n- Implementing new features or modifying existing ones\n- Modifying APIs, endpoints, or response schemas\n- Changing configuration options or environment variables\n- Restructuring files or directories\n- Updating dependencies\n- Any significant code modification\n- Explicit request to audit or restructure documentation\n\n## Invocation Modes\n\n### Default: `/docs`\n\nDocument current or recent changes. The agent identifies recently modified files and updates related documentation.\n\n```\nTask tool with subagent_type=\"docs\"\nprompt: \"Review recent code changes and update all affected documentation.\nIdentify modified files, scan the docs/ directory for existing files, and update README.md, CLAUDE.md, docs/* files, and any other relevant documentation.\"\n```\n\n### Scoped: `/docs <scope>`\n\nDocument only the specified scope (file, module, feature).\n\n```\nTask tool with subagent_type=\"docs\"\nprompt: \"Review and update documentation for: [scope]\nFocus only on this area. Update all relevant documentation files including any matching files in the docs/ directory.\"\n```\n\n**Scope examples:**\n- `/docs src/auth` - authentication module\n- `/docs API` - all API endpoints\n- `/docs README` - only README.md\n- `/docs config` - configuration options\n- `/docs UserService` - specific class or service\n\n### Comprehensive: `/docs all`\n\nPerform a planned, modular documentation update covering every repository aspect.\n\n```\nTask tool with subagent_type=\"docs\"\nprompt: \"Perform comprehensive documentation audit of all repository areas.\nCreate a TodoWrite plan with one item per documentation aspect, then process sequentially.\nConsult references/comprehensive-mode.md for the full aspect checklist and execution flow.\"\n```\n\nFor detailed aspect checklist and example plan, consult **`references/comprehensive-mode.md`**.\n\n### Simplifier: `/docs simplifier`\n\nPerform documentation restructuring to transform monolithic files into a modular structure with proper cross-linking.\n\n```\nTask tool with subagent_type=\"docs\"\nprompt: \"Perform documentation restructuring analysis and execution.\nAnalyze file sizes, identify files exceeding thresholds, propose modular split plan, and execute.\nConsult references/simplifier-mode.md for analysis checklist and target structure.\"\n```\n\nFor detailed restructuring criteria and target structure, consult **`references/simplifier-mode.md`**.\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n```\n/docs                          # Document recent changes\n/docs src/services/payment     # Document payment service only\n/docs API                      # Update API documentation only\n/docs all                      # Full project documentation audit\n/docs simplifier               # Restructure large docs into modular files\n/docs architecture             # Update architecture docs and .drawio diagrams\n/docs postman                  # Validate and update postman_collection.json\n```\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n### Reference Files\n\nFor detailed mode execution flows, consult:\n- **`references/comprehensive-mode.md`** - Full audit execution flow, aspect checklist, example TodoWrite plan\n- **`references/simplifier-mode.md`** - Restructuring analysis, thresholds, cross-linking templates, target structure\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:36:32.666Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Maintenance Agents requiring automated documentation synchronization with code changes","zh":"适合需要自动同步代码变更的文档维护代理","ja":"コードの変更に伴うドキュメントの自動同期を必要とするコードメンテナンスエージェントに最適","ko":"코드 변경에 따른 문서 자동 동기화를 요구하는 코드 유지 보수 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Mantenimiento de Código que requieren una sincronización de documentación automatizada con los cambios de código","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Maintenance de Code nécessitant une synchronisation de documentation automatique avec les modifications de code","de":"Ideal für Code-Wartungsagenten, die eine automatisierte Dokumentationssynchronisierung mit Codeänderungen erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Manutenção de Código que exigem sincronização de documentação automatizada com alterações de código","ru":"Идеально для агентов по обслуживанию кода, требующих автоматизированной синхронизации документации с изменениями кода","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يتطلبونautomated تناسق الوثائق مع التغييرات في الكود"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to update README.md, CLAUDE.md, and docs/* directory files in real-time, ensuring accurate and current documentation through API docs and postman collections synchronization, utilizing file formats like Markdown and JSON","zh":"赋予代理更新README.md、CLAUDE.md和docs/*目录文件的实时功能，通过API文档和Postman集合的同步，确保准确和最新的文档，使用像Markdown和JSON这样的文件格式","ja":"README.md、CLAUDE.md、docs/*ディレクトリのファイルをリアルタイムで更新する機能をエージェントに与え、APIドキュメントやPostmanコレクションの同期を通じて、最新かつ正確なドキュメントを保証する、マークダウンやJSONのようなファイル形式を利用","ko":"README.md, CLAUDE.md, docs/* 디렉토리 파일을 실시간으로 업데이트하는 기능을 에이전트에 부여하여, API 문서 및 Postman 컬렉션의 동기화를 통해 정확하고 최신의 문서를 보장하며, 마크다운이나 JSON 같은 파일 형식을 사용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a actualizar README.md, CLAUDE.md y archivos del directorio docs/* en tiempo real, garantizando una documentación precisa y actualizada a través de la sincronización de documentación de API y colecciones de Postman, utilizando formatos de archivo como Markdown y JSON","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre à jour README.md, CLAUDE.md et les fichiers du répertoire docs/* en temps réel, garantissant une documentation précise et à jour grâce à la synchronisation de la documentation de l''API et des collections Postman, en utilisant des formats de fichiers tels que Markdown et JSON","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, README.md, CLAUDE.md und Dateien im docs/*-Verzeichnis in Echtzeit zu aktualisieren, wodurch eine genaue und aktuelle Dokumentation durch die Synchronisierung von API-Dokumenten und Postman-Sammlungen sichergestellt wird, unter Verwendung von Dateiformaten wie Markdown und JSON","pt":"Habilita os agentes a atualizar arquivos README.md, CLAUDE.md e diretórios docs/* em tempo real, garantindo documentação precisa e atualizada por meio da sincronização de docs de API e coleções postman, utilizando formatos de arquivo como Markdown e JSON","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обновлять файлы README.md, CLAUDE.md и директории docs/* в режиме реального времени, обеспечивая точную и актуальную документацию посредством синхронизации документации API и коллекций postman, используя форматы файлов, такие как Markdown и JSON","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية تحديث ملفات README.md و CLAUDE.md و مكاتب docs/* في الوقت الفعلي، وضمان توثيق دقيق ومحديث من خلال تنسيق وثائق API ومجموعات postman، باستخدام تنسيقات الملفات مثل Markdown و JSON"},"useCases":{"en":["Synchronizing documentation after implementing new features","Updating API documentation following endpoint modifications","Maintaining accurate README.md files after configuration changes"],"zh":["在实现新功能后同步文档","在端点修改后更新API文档","在配置更改后维护准确的README.md文件"],"ja":["新機能の実装後にドキュメントを同期する","エンドポイントの変更後にAPIドキュメントを更新する","設定の変更後に正確なREADME.mdファイルを維持する"],"ko":["새 기능을 구현한 후 문서를 동기화","엔드포인트를 수정한 후 API 문서를 업데이트","설정 변경 후 정확한 README.md 파일을 유지"],"es":["Sincronizar la documentación después de implementar nuevas características","Actualizar la documentación de la API después de la modificación de puntos de conexión","Mantener archivos README.md precisos después de cambios de configuración"],"fr":["Synchroniser la documentation après la mise en œuvre de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Mettre à jour la documentation de l''API après la modification des points de terminaison","Maintenir des fichiers README.md précis après des modifications de configuration"],"de":["Dokumentation nach der Implementierung neuer Funktionen synchronisieren","API-Dokumentation nach Änderungen an Endpunkten aktualisieren","Genauigkeit von README.md-Dateien nach Konfigurationsänderungen aufrechterhalten"],"pt":["Sincronizar documentação após implementar novos recursos","Atualizar documentação de API após modificações de endpoint","Manter arquivos README.md precisos após alterações de configuração"],"ru":["Синхронизировать документацию после реализации новых функций","Обновлять документацию API после изменения конечных точек","Поддерживать точные файлы README.md после изменений конфигурации"],"ar":["تناسق الوثائق بعد تنفيذ ميزات جديدة","تحديث توثيق API بعد تعديلات النقاط النهائية","الحفاظ على ملفات README.md دقيقة بعد التغييرات في الإعدادات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to documentation files and directories","Needs synchronization triggers after code changes","Limited to documentation files like README.md, CLAUDE.md, and docs/* directory files"],"zh":["需要访问文档文件和目录","需要代码更改后的同步触发器","仅限于README.md、CLAUDE.md和docs/*目录文件"],"ja":["ドキュメントファイルとディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","コードの変更後の同期トリガーが必要","README.md、CLAUDE.md、docs/*ディレクトリのファイルのみ"],"ko":["문서 파일 및 디렉토리에 대한 액세스가 필요","코드 변경 후 동기화 트리거가 필요","README.md, CLAUDE.md, docs/* 디렉토리 파일만"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos y directorios de documentación","Necesita desencadenantes de sincronización después de los cambios de código","Limitado a archivos de documentación como README.md, CLAUDE.md y archivos del directorio docs/*"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers et répertoires de documentation","A besoin de déclencheurs de synchronisation après les modifications de code","Limité aux fichiers de documentation tels que README.md, CLAUDE.md et les fichiers du répertoire docs/*"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Dokumentationsdateien und -verzeichnisse","Benötigt Synchronisierungsauslöser nach Codeänderungen","Begrenzt auf Dokumentationsdateien wie README.md, CLAUDE.md und Dateien im docs/*-Verzeichnis"],"pt":["Exige acesso a arquivos e diretórios de documentação","Necessita de gatilhos de sincronização após alterações de código","Limitado a arquivos de documentação como README.md, CLAUDE.md e diretórios docs/*"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам и директориям документации","Требует триггеров синхронизации после изменений кода","Ограничен файлами документации, такими как README.md, CLAUDE.md и директории docs/*"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات ومكاتب توثيق","يحتاج إلى مسكات تناسق بعد التغييرات في الكود","محدود بالملفات مثل README.md و CLAUDE.md و مكاتب docs/*"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d65e076ec3e88c93366ede7180d8ccb17da1c03e26d40413673e96cf9cdff0c9","qualityScore":49}');
