"توحيد الترميز","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","دعم لغات البرمجة مثل Python و Node.js"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用setup-dev","什么是AI工具","setup-dev替代品","setup-dev vs 其他工具","setup-dev安装教程","setup-dev配置指南","AI工具开发","setup-dev入门教程"],"ja":["setup-devの使い方","AIエージェントとは","setup-devの代替","setup-dev vs 他のツール","setup-devのインストール方法","setup-devの設定ガイド","AIエージェントの開発","setup-dev入門"],"ko":["setup-dev 사용법","AI 에이전트란","setup-dev 대안","setup-dev vs 다른 도구","setup-dev 설치 가이드","setup-dev 설정 방법","AI 에이전트 개발","setup-dev 입문 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de AI Agents","qué es la codificación agente","setup-dev alternativa","setup-dev vs otros entornos de prueba","instalación de setup-dev","guía de configuración de setup-dev","desarrollo de aplicaciones con AI Agents"],"fr":["comment utiliser les outils d''Agents IA","qu''est-ce que la codification agent","setup-dev alternative","setup-dev vs autres environnements de test","installation de setup-dev","guide de configuration de setup-dev","développement d''applications avec des Agents IA"],"de":["wie man AI-Tools verwendet","was ist die Agenten-Codierung","setup-dev Alternative","setup-dev vs andere Testumgebungen","Installation von setup-dev","Konfigurationsanleitung für setup-dev","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit AI-Tools"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","configuração de desenvolvimento","setup-dev","agentic coding","desenvolvimento de software","como usar setup-dev","o que é setup-dev","alternativas ao setup-dev","setup-dev vs outras ferramentas"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","настройка среды разработки","setup-dev","агентное кодирование","разработка программного обеспечения","как использовать setup-dev","что такое setup-dev","альтернативы setup-dev","setup-dev vs другие инструменты"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","إعداد التطوير","setup-dev","الترميز الوكيل","تطوير البرمجيات","كيفية استخدام setup-dev","ما هو setup-dev","بديلات setup-dev","setup-dev مقابل أدوات أخرى"]}},"owner":"eleva-labs","repo":"agentic-coding-templates","repoPath":"eleva-labs/agentic-coding-templates","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.698Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"setup-dev","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# Development Environment Setup SOP\n\n> **Note**: This is a template. Replace placeholders like `{PROJECT_NAME}`, `{REPO_DIRECTORY}`, and `{BUNDLE_ID}` with your actual project values.\n\n**Version**: 1.0.0\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-11\n**Status**: Active\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\n### Purpose\nThis SOP guides developers through setting up the complete development environment for the mobile app. It ensures consistent environments across the team and enables productive development from day one.\n\n### When to U","body":"# Development Environment Setup SOP\n\n> **Note**: This is a template. Replace placeholders like `{PROJECT_NAME}`, `{REPO_DIRECTORY}`, and `{BUNDLE_ID}` with your actual project values.\n\n**Version**: 1.0.0\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-11\n**Status**: Active\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\n### Purpose\nThis SOP guides developers through setting up the complete development environment for the mobile app. It ensures consistent environments across the team and enables productive development from day one.\n\n### When to Use\n**ALWAYS**: New developer onboarding, setting up a new machine, clean reinstall, troubleshooting environment issues\n**SKIP**: Already have working environment, only need platform-specific setup (use `setup-ios` or `setup-android`)\n\n---\n\n## Process Workflow\n\n### Flow Diagram\n```\n[Prerequisites] --> [Automated Setup] --> [Verification] --> [First Run]\n```\n\n### Phase Summary\n| Phase | Objective | Deliverable |\n|-------|-----------|-------------|\n| 1. Prerequisites | Ensure required tools installed | macOS, Xcode, Command Line Tools |\n| 2. Setup | Install development tools | Volta, Node.js 20, pnpm, dependencies |\n| 3. Verification | Confirm environment works | `task check-prereqs` passes |\n| 4. First Run | Run the app | App running in simulator |\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Option 1: Fully Automated Setup (5 minutes)\n\n```bash\n# Clone the repository\ngit clone <repository-url>\ncd {REPO_DIRECTORY}\n\n# Run automated setup (installs everything)\n./scripts/setup-development.sh\n```\n\nThe script handles:\n- Volta installation\n- Node.js 20 setup\n- Project dependency installation\n- Development environment configuration\n\n### Option 2: Manual Setup (10 minutes)\n\n```bash\n# 1. Install Volta\ncurl https://get.volta.sh | bash\n\n# 2. Restart terminal, then setup Node\nvolta install node@20\nvolta pin node@20\n\n# 3. Install dependencies\npnpm install\n\n# 4. Setup development environment\ntask setup-dev\n\n# 5. Verify setup\ntask check-prereqs\n```\n\n### Option 3: One-Command Full Setup (Fastest)\n\nIf you already have the repository cloned and just need to complete setup:\n\n```bash\ntask setup-full\n```\n\nThis does everything in one command:\n1. Install all dependencies (`pnpm install`)\n2. Create local environment config (`.env.local`)\n3. Pull development settings from EAS\n4. Verify all patches applied correctly\n\n---\n\n## Detailed Guide\n\nFor comprehensive setup instructions including prerequisites and troubleshooting, see:\n- [SETUP_GUIDE.md](./SETUP_GUIDE.md) - Detailed setup steps\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Common Commands\n```bash\n# Verify environment\ntask check-prereqs\n\n# Start iOS development\ntask run-ios\n\n# Start Android development\ntask run-android\n\n# Run tests\ntask test\n\n# Clean and regenerate\ntask clean && task generate\n```\n\n### Local Environment Setup\n\n```bash\ntask setup-local-env    # Creates .env.local\ntask verify-patches     # Check patches are applied\ntask setup-full         # Complete setup in one command\n```\n\n### Key Environment Variables\n```bash\n# Check Node version (should be v20.x.x)\nnode --version\n\n# Check Volta version\nvolta --version\n\n# Check pnpm version\npnpm --version\n```\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n| Issue | Solution |\n|-------|----------|\n| Volta not found after install | Restart terminal or source shell config |\n| Wrong Node version | Run `volta pin node@20` in project directory |\n| pnpm not found | Install via `volta install pnpm` |\n| Metro bundler errors | Run `task clean-cache` |\n| iOS build fails | See `setup-ios` skill or [SETUP_GUIDE.md](./SETUP_GUIDE.md) |\n| Android build fails | See `setup-android` skill or [SETUP_GUIDE.md](./SETUP_GUIDE.md) |\n| `.env.local` missing | Run `task setup-local-env` |\n| SIMULATOR variable undefined | Run `task setup-local-env` to recreate `.env.local` |\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n| Skill | Purpose | When to Use |\n|-------|---------|-------------|\n| `/setup-env` | Configure environment variables | After initial setup |\n| `/setup-ios` | iOS-specific setup | For iOS development |\n| `/setup-android` | Android-specific setup | For Android development |\n| `/help` | Troubleshooting guide | When encountering issues |\n\n> **Note**: Skill paths (`/skill-name`) work after deployment. In the template repo, skills are in domain folders.\n\n---\n\n**End of SOP**\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:38:20.063Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined environment setup and testing for mobile apps.","zh":"非常适合需要简化环境设置和移动应用测试的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントがモバイルアプリの環境設定とテストを簡素化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"개발 에이전트가 모바일 앱 환경 설정 및 테스트를 간소화해야 하는 경우에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una configuración de entorno y pruebas simplificadas para aplicaciones móviles.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement qui ont besoin d''un environnement de configuration et de tests simplifié pour les applications mobiles.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine vereinfachte Umgebungskonfiguration und -testung für Mobile Apps benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de configuração de ambiente e teste de aplicativos móveis simplificados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходима упрощенная настройка среды и тестирование мобильных приложений.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التسليم التي تحتاج إلى إعداد وتشغيل تطبيقات الجوال بسهولة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to consistently configure development environments using standards and best practices, ensuring seamless collaboration and productivity across teams with technologies like Git and mobile app development frameworks.","zh":"赋予代理以一致的配置开发环境的能力，使用标准和最佳实践，确保团队间的无缝协作和生产力，使用Git和移动应用开发框架等技术。","ja":"開発エージェントが標準とベストプラクティスを使用して開発環境を一貫して構成できるようにし、Gitやモバイルアプリ開発フレームワークなどのテクノロジーを使用してチーム間のシームレスなコラボレーションと生産性を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 표준 및 모범 사례를 사용하여 개발 환경을 일관되게 구성할 수 있도록 하여 Git 및 모바일 앱 개발 프레임워크와 같은 기술을 사용하여 팀 간의 무장애 협업 및 생산성을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes configurar de forma consistente entornos de desarrollo utilizando estándares y mejores prácticas, garantizando una colaboración y productividad sin problemas en equipos con tecnologías como Git y frameworks de desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles.","fr":"Permet aux agents de configurer de manière cohérente les environnements de développement en utilisant des normes et des meilleures pratiques, garantissant une collaboration et une productivité sans problème au sein d''équipes utilisant des technologies comme Git et des frameworks de développement d''applications mobiles.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Entwicklungsumgebungen konsistent mit Standards und Best Practices zu konfigurieren, um eine nahtlose Zusammenarbeit und Produktivität über Teams hinweg mit Technologien wie Git und Mobile-App-Entwicklungsframeworks zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a configurar consistentemente ambientes de desenvolvimento usando padrões e melhores práticas, garantindo colaboração e produtividade sem interrupções em equipes com tecnologias como Git e frameworks de desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью последовательно настраивать среды разработки с использованием стандартов и лучших практик, обеспечивая бесперебойное сотрудничество и производительность команд с использованием технологий, таких как Git и фреймворки для разработки мобильных приложений.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من ضبط بيئات التطوير باستمرار باستخدام المعايير وأفضل الممارسات، مما يضمن التعاون والإنتاجية دون انقطاع عبر الفرق باستخدام تقنيات مثل Git وأطر عمل تطوير التطبيقات النقالة."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring mobile app development environments","Testing agentic coding standards","Setting up repository directories"],"zh":["配置移动应用开发环境","测试代理编码标准","设置仓库目录"],"ja":["モバイルアプリ開発環境の構成","エージェントコーディング規範のテスト","リポジトリディレクトリの設定"],"ko":["모바일 앱 개발 환경 구성","에이전트 코딩 표준 테스트","저장소 디렉토리 설정"],"es":["Configuración de entornos de desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","Pruebas de estándares de codificación de agentes","Configuración de directorios de repositorio"],"fr":["Configuration d''environnements de développement d''applications mobiles","Tests de normes de codage d''agents","Configuration de répertoires de référentiel"],"de":["Konfiguration von Entwicklungsumgebungen für Mobile Apps","Tests von Agenten-Coding-Standards","Einrichtung von Repository-Verzeichnissen"],"pt":["Configuração de ambientes de desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis","Teste de padrões de codificação de agentes","Configuração de diretórios de repositório"],"ru":["Настройка среды разработки мобильных приложений","Тестирование стандартов кодирования агентов","Настройка директорий репозитория"],"ar":["إعداد بيئة تطوير تطبيقات الجوال","اختبار معايير برمجة الوكلاء","إعداد دليل المستودع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires project-specific values like {PROJECT_NAME} and {REPO_DIRECTORY}","Limited to mobile app development environments"],"zh":["需要项目特定值，如{PROJECT_NAME}和{REPO_DIRECTORY}","仅限移动应用开发环境"],"ja":["{PROJECT_NAME}や{REPO_DIRECTORY}などのプロジェクト固有の値が必要","モバイルアプリ開発環境のみに制限"],"ko":["{PROJECT_NAME} 및 {REPO_DIRECTORY}와 같은 프로젝트 특정 값이 필요합니다.","모바일 앱 개발 환경에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere valores específicos del proyecto como {PROJECT_NAME} y {REPO_DIRECTORY}","Limitado a entornos de desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["Nécessite des valeurs spécifiques au projet comme {PROJECT_NAME} et {REPO_DIRECTORY}","Limité aux environnements de développement d''applications mobiles"],"de":["Benötigt projektspezifische Werte wie {PROJECT_NAME} und {REPO_DIRECTORY}","Begrenzt auf Entwicklungsumgebungen für Mobile Apps"],"pt":["Exige valores específicos do projeto, como {PROJECT_NAME} e {REPO_DIRECTORY}","Limitado a ambientes de desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis"],"ru":["Требует проектных значений, таких как {PROJECT_NAME} и {REPO_DIRECTORY}","Ограничен средами разработки мобильных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب قيم محددة للمشروع مثل {PROJECT_NAME} و {REPO_DIRECTORY}","محدود بيئات تطوير تطبيقات الجوال"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8e7444931190e74be44db378cfae8f0e1cf430dd6a081fb1655fb423875fdd46","qualityScore":49}');
