uth0","ja":"AIエージェント moai-platform-auth0","ko":"AI 에이전트 moai-platform-auth0","es":"Herramientas de AI: moai-platform-auth0 para Entornos de ...","fr":"Outils d''IA: moai-platform-auth0 pour Environnements de C...","de":"KI-Tools: moai-platform-auth0 für Kollaborationsumgebungen","pt":"Ferramentas de AI: moai-platform-auth0 para Desenvolvedores","ru":"ИИ Агенты: moai-platform-auth0 для Разработчиков","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: moai-platform-auth0 للمطورين","en":"moai-platform-auth0"},"description":{"zh":"moai-platform-auth0是用于构建AI协作环境的平台，通过mcp服务器实现高效协作","ja":"moai-platform-auth0は、mcpサーバーを通じてAIエージェントの協作環境を構築するためのプラットフォームです","ko":"moai-platform-auth0는 mcp 서버를 통한 AI 에이전트 협업 환경 구축을 위한 플랫폼입니다","es":"moai-platform-auth0 es una herramienta de AI que permite la colaboración entre agentes a través del servidor mcp. Esta plataforma facilita la integración de ...","fr":"moai-platform-auth0 est un outil d''IA qui permet la collaboration entre agents via le serveur mcp. Cette plateforme facilite l''intégration d''agents et la col...","de":"moai-platform-auth0 ist ein KI-Tool, das die Zusammenarbeit zwischen Agenten über den mcp-Server ermöglicht. Diese Plattform erleichtert die Integration von ...","pt":"O moai-platform-auth0 é uma ferramenta de AI que permite a colaboração de agentes em ambiente de servidor mcp. Aprenda como usar essa tecnologia para melhora...","ru":"ИИ Агент moai-platform-auth0 - это инструмент, который позволяет сотрудничество агентов в среде сервера mcp. Узнайте, как использовать эту технологию для пов...","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي مواي-PLATFORM-AUTH0 هي أداة تتيح التعاون بين الوكلاء في بيئة خادم مCP. تعرف كيف تستخدم هذه التكنولوجيا لتحسين الإنتاجية","en":"mcp 서버를 통한 agent 협업 환경 구축"},"definition":{"en":"mcp 서버를 통한 agent 협업 환경 구축"},"features":{"zh":["支持mcp服务器的协作环境构建","提供高效的AI协作功能","实现多个AIエージェント的协作","支持多种编程语言","提供安全的认证和授权机制"],"ja":["mcpサーバーの協作環境構築をサポート","効率的なAIエージェントの協作機能を提供","複数のAIエージェントの協作を実現","複数のプログラミング言語をサポート","安全な認証と認可メカニズムを提供"],"ko":["mcp 서버의 협업 환경 구축을 지원","효율적인 AI 에이전트의 협업 기능을 제공","여러개의 AI 에이전트의 협업을 구현","여러개의 프로그래밍 언어를 지원","안전한 인증과 인가 메커니즘을 제공"],"es":["Colaboración entre agentes a través del servidor mcp","Integración de agentes en entornos de desarrollo","Autenticación y autorización con Auth0","Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas","Escalabilidad y flexibilidad en la configuración"],"fr":["Collaboration entre agents via le serveur mcp","Intégration d''agents dans les environnements de développement","Authentification et autorisation avec Auth0","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes","Évolutivité et flexibilité dans la configuration"],"de":["Zusammenarbeit zwischen Agenten über den mcp-Server","Integration von Agenten in Entwicklungsumgebungen","Authentifizierung und Autorisierung mit Auth0","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen","Skalierbarkeit und Flexibilität in der Konfiguration"],"pt":["Colaboração de agentes em ambiente de servidor mcp","Integração com tecnologias de AI","Melhoria da produtividade","Suporte a desenvolvedores","Flexibilidade e escalabilidade"],"ru":["Сотрудничество агентов в среде сервера mcp","Интеграция с технологиями ИИ","Повышение производительности","Поддержка разработчиков","Гибкость и масштабируемость"],"ar":["التعاون بين الوكلاء في بيئة خادم مCP","التكامل مع تكنولوجيا الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحسين الإنتاجية","دعم المطورين","المرونة وال قابلة للتوسيع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AIエージェント","moai-platform-auth0","mcp服务器","AI协作环境","如何使用moai-platform-auth0","moai-platform-auth0安装指南","AIエージェント的应用"],"ja":["AIエージェント","moai-platform-auth0","mcpサーバー","AIエージェントの協作環境","moai-platform-auth0の使い方","moai-platform-auth0のインストールガイド","AIエージェントの応用"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","moai-platform-auth0","mcp 서버","AI 에이전트 협업 환경","moai-platform-auth0 사용법","moai-platform-auth0 설치 가이드","AI 에이전트의 응용"],"es":["herramientas de AI","colaboración entre agentes","entornos de desarrollo","autenticación con Auth0","moai-platform-auth0","alternativas a moai-platform-auth0","guía de instalación de moai-platform-auth0"],"fr":["outils d''IA","collaboration entre agents","environnements de développement","authentification avec Auth0","moai-platform-auth0","alternatives à moai-platform-auth0","guide d''installation de moai-platform-auth0"],"de":["KI-Tools","Zusammenarbeit zwischen Agenten","Entwicklungsumgebungen","Authentifizierung mit Auth0","moai-platform-auth0","Alternativen zu moai-platform-auth0","Installationsanleitung für moai-platform-auth0"],"pt":["como usar moai-platform-auth0","o que é moai-platform-auth0","ferramentas de ai para desenvolvedores","moai-platform-auth0 vs outras ferramentas","instalar moai-platform-auth0","guia de configuração do moai-platform-auth0","desenvolvimento de aplicativos com moai-platform-auth0","exemplos de uso do moai-platform-auth0"],"ru":["как использовать moai-platform-auth0","что такое moai-platform-auth0","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","moai-platform-auth0 vs другие инструменты","установка moai-platform-auth0","руководство по настройке moai-platform-auth0","разработка приложений с помощью moai-platform-auth0","пимеры использования moai-platform-auth0"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام مواي-PLATFORM-AUTH0","ما هي مواي-PLATFORM-AUTH0","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","مواي-PLATFORM-AUTH0 مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت مواي-PLATFORM-AUTH0","دليل إعداد مواي-PLATFORM-AUTH0","تطوير التطبيقات باستخدام مواي-PLATFORM-AUTH0","أمثلة على استخدام مواي-PLATFORM-AUTH0"]}},"owner":"hnabyz-bot","repo":"mcp-agent-server","repoPath":"hnabyz-bot/mcp-agent-server","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.699Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"moai-platform-auth0","description":">","version":"1.0.0","tags":"auth0, security, mfa, attack-protection, tokens, dpop, mtls, compliance, fapi, gdpr","bodyPreview":"# Auth0 Security Specialist\n\nComprehensive security skill for Auth0 implementations covering attack protection, multi-factor authentication, token security, sender constraining (DPoP/mTLS), and regulatory compliance (FAPI, GDPR, HIPAA).\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Security Feature Categories\n\nAttack Protection:\n- Bot Detection: CAPTCHA challenges for suspicious traffic\n- Breached Password Detection: Blocks compromised credentials\n- Brute Force Protection: Limits failed login attempts per account\n-","body":"# Auth0 Security Specialist\n\nComprehensive security skill for Auth0 implementations covering attack protection, multi-factor authentication, token security, sender constraining (DPoP/mTLS), and regulatory compliance (FAPI, GDPR, HIPAA).\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Security Feature Categories\n\nAttack Protection:\n- Bot Detection: CAPTCHA challenges for suspicious traffic\n- Breached Password Detection: Blocks compromised credentials\n- Brute Force Protection: Limits failed login attempts per account\n- Suspicious IP Throttling: Rate limits high-velocity attacks\n\nMulti-Factor Authentication:\n- Push notifications via Auth0 Guardian\n- One-time passwords (TOTP)\n- WebAuthn with security keys and biometrics\n- SMS/voice verification and Adaptive MFA\n\nToken Security:\n- JWT structure and validation\n- Access token management with scopes\n- Refresh token rotation and expiration\n- Token revocation strategies\n\nSender Constraining:\n- DPoP: Application-layer token binding\n- mTLS: Transport-layer certificate binding\n\nCompliance: FAPI, GDPR, HIPAA/HITECH, PCI DSS, ISO 27001, SOC 2\n\n### Dashboard Navigation\n\nAttack Protection: Dashboard > Security > Attack Protection\nMFA Configuration: Dashboard > Security > Multi-factor Auth\nSecurity Center: Dashboard > Security > Security Center\n\n### Essential Setup Checklist\n\n1. Enable Bot Detection with appropriate sensitivity\n2. Activate Breached Password Detection\n3. Configure Brute Force Protection thresholds\n4. Enable Suspicious IP Throttling\n5. Set up at least one MFA factor\n6. Configure token expiration policies\n\n---\n\n## Implementation Guide\n\n### Attack Protection\n\nBot Detection: Navigate to Dashboard > Security > Attack Protection > Bot Detection. Configure sensitivity (Low/Medium/High) and response type (Auth Challenge recommended, Simple CAPTCHA, or third-party). IP AllowList supports up to 100 adddesses/CIDR ranges.\n\nSupported flows: Universal Login, Classic Login, Lock.js v12.4.0+, native apps. Unsupported: Enterprise connections, social login, cross-origin authentication.\n\nBreached Password Detection: Enable for signup and login. Response actions include blocking compromised credentials and user/admin notifications. Standard Detection has 7-13 months detection time; Credential Guard (Enterprise) reduces to 12-36 hours. Test with passwords starting with AUTH0-TEST-.\n\nBrute Force Protection: Default threshold is 10 failed attempts (configurable 1-100). Protection mechanisms include IP-based blocking and account lockout. Blocks remove after 30 days, password change, admin removal, or user unblock link.\n\nSuspicious IP Throttling: Velocity-based detection for high-volume attacks. Responds with HTTP 429. Configure separate thresholds for login (daily) and signup (per minute) attempts.\n\nFor details: modules/attack-protection-overview.md\n\n### Multi-Factor Authentication\n\nFactor Configuration: Navigate to Dashboard > Security > Multi-factor Auth.\n\nIndependent Factors (at least one required):\n- WebAuthn with FIDO Security Keys\n- One-time Password (OTP/TOTP)\n- Push Notifications via Auth0 Guardian\n- Phone Message (SMS/Voice)\n- Cisco Duo Security\n\nDependent Factors: WebAuthn Biometrics, Email, Recovery codes\n\nMFA Policies: Never, Use Adaptive MFA (Enterprise), Always\n\nWebAuthn: Provides passwordless MFA with security keys or biometrics. Single interaction for multi-factor authentication, phishing-resistant.\n\nAdaptive MFA (Enterprise): Evaluates risk signals per transaction:\n- NewDevice: Device not used in past 30 days\n- ImpossibleTravel: Geographic anomalies\n- UntrustedIP: Suspicious activity history\n\nHigh-risk transactions require verification regardless of existing MFA sessions.\n\nStep-Up Authentication: Enhanced verification for sensitive operations. APIs use scopes; web apps verify ID token claims.\n\nFor details: modules/mfa-overview.md, modules/adaptive-mfa.md\n\n### Token Security\n\nJWT Fundamentals: RFC 7519 standard. Auth0 issues signed JWTs (JWS). Structure includes Header, Payload (claims), and Signature. Always validate signatures, never store sensitive data in payloads, use HTTPS only.\n\nAccess Tokens: Authorize API access with scopes. Types: Opaque (require introspection) and JWT (self-contained). Key claims: iss, sub, aud, scope, exp. Default lifetime: 86400 seconds (24 hours).\n\nRefresh Tokens: Enable session continuity. Maximum 200 active per user per application. Security features: Rotation (invalidates predecessor), expiring tokens (idle/absolute), revocation via Management API.\n\nBest Practices:\n- Treat signing keys as critical credentials\n- Prefer RS256 over HS256 for public key validation\n- Store tokens server-side when possible\n- Cache and reuse until expiration\n\nFor details: modules/tokens-overview.md, modules/token-best-practices.md\n\n### Sender Constraining\n\nDPoP (Application Layer): Binds tokens to client-generated asymmetric key pairs.\n\nSteps: Generate key pair (ES256 recommended), create DPoP Proof JWT, send via DPoP header, include updated proof with each API request.\n\nProof JWT Structure:\n- Header: typ (dpop+jwt), alg, jwk (public key)\n- Payload: jti, htm, htu, iat, ath (for API calls)\n\nPublic clients must handle use_dpop_nonce errors.\n\nmTLS (Transport Layer): Binds tokens to X.509 certificates.\n\nProcess: Client establishes mTLS connection, Auth0 calculates certificate SHA-256 thumbprint, embeds in token cnf claim as x5t#S256. Resource server validates thumbprint.\n\nRequirements: Confidential clients only, Enterprise Plan with HRI add-on, PKI infrastructure.\n\nFor details: modules/dpop-implementation.md, modules/mtls-sender-constraining.md\n\n### Compliance\n\nHighly Regulated Identity (Enterprise + HRI add-on):\n- Strong Customer Authentication: Minimum two independent factors\n- Dynamic Linking: Transaction details in authorization\n- PAR: Pushed Authorization Requests\n- JAR: JWT-Secured Authorization Requests\n- JWE: Access token encryption\n- Private Key JWT and mTLS authentication\n\nGDPR Compliance:\n- Customer as Data Controller, Auth0 as Data Processor\n- User rights: Access, portability (JSON export), erasure, consent management\n- Security: Profile encryption, breach detection, brute-force protection\n\nCertifications: ISO 27001/27017/27018, SOC 2 Type 2, CSA STAR, FAPI 1 Advanced OP, HIPAA BAA available, PCI DSS compliant models\n\nFor details: modules/highly-regulated-identity.md, modules/gdpr-compliance.md\n\n---\n\n## Advanced Patterns\n\n### Security Center Monitoring\n\nAccess from Dashboard > Security > Security Center.\n\nThreat Categories:\n- Credential Stuffing: Machine-driven compromise attempts\n- Signup Attacks: Automated account creation\n- MFA Bypass: Circumvention attempts\n\nFiltering: Time period (up to 14 days), applications, connections. Auto-aggregation by minute/hour/day.\n\nMetrics: Bot detection counts, IP throttling events, brute force triggers, breached password alerts, MFA success/failure rates.\n\n### Application Credentials\n\nClient Secret (Default): Symmetric, simple but vulnerable to interception.\n\nPrivate Key JWT (Enterprise): Asymmetric key pairs, private key never transmitted, short-lived assertions. Recommended for enhanced security.\n\nmTLS for OAuth (HRI): X.509 certificates, strongest protection.\n\nKey Management: Register up to two public keys for zero-downtime rotation. Algorithms: RS256, RS384, PS256.\n\n### Continuous Session Protection\n\nUse Auth0 Actions for session context during token refresh events.\n\nCapabilities: IP/ASN monitoring, device tracking, expiration management, anomaly detection.\n\nDynamic management: Customize lifetimes by user attributes, organization, or role.\n\n---\n\n## Module Reference\n\nAttack Protection:\n- modules/attack-protection-overview.md\n- modules/bot-detection.md\n- modules/breached-password-detection.md\n- modules/brute-force-protection.md\n- modules/suspicious-ip-throttling.md\n- modules/akamai-integration.md\n- modules/attack-protection-log-events.md\n- modules/state-parameters.md\n\nMFA:\n- modules/mfa-overview.md\n- modules/mfa-factors.md\n- modules/webauthn-fido.md\n- modules/adaptive-mfa.md\n- modules/guardian-configuration.md\n- modules/step-up-authentication.md\n- modules/mfa-api-management.md\n- modules/customize-mfa.md\n- modules/ropg-flow-mfa.md\n\nTokens:\n- modules/tokens-overview.md\n- modules/jwt-fundamentals.md\n- modules/id-tokens.md\n- modules/access-tokens.md\n- modules/delegation-tokens.md\n- modules/refresh-tokens.md\n- modules/token-revocation.md\n- modules/token-best-practices.md\n\nSender Constraining:\n- modules/dpop-implementation.md\n- modules/mtls-sender-constraining.md\n\nCompliance:\n- modules/compliance-overview.md\n- modules/fapi-implementation.md\n- modules/highly-regulated-identity.md\n- modules/gdpr-compliance.md\n- modules/certifications.md\n- modules/tenant-access-control.md\n- modules/customer-managed-keys.md\n\nSecurity Operations:\n- modules/security-center.md\n- modules/application-credentials.md\n- modules/continuous-session-protection.md\n- modules/security-guidance.md\n- modules/mdl-verification.md\n\n---\n\n## Usage Guide\n\nThis skill provides comprehensive Auth0 security guidance. Use it for:\n- Attack Protection configuration\n- Multi-Factor Authentication setup\n- Token security implementation\n- Sender constraining (DPoP/mTLS)\n- Compliance verification (FAPI, GDPR, HIPAA)\n\nFor comprehensive security reviews, use the expert-security agent included in this plugin.\n\n---\n\n## Resources\n\nOfficial Documentation:\n- https://auth0.com/docs/secure\n- https://auth0.com/docs/secure/attack-protection\n- https://auth0.com/docs/secure/multi-factor-authentication\n- https://auth0.com/docs/secure/tokens\n- https://auth0.com/docs/secure/sender-constraining\n- https://auth0.com/docs/secure/data-privacy-and-compliance\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:39:17.406Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Security-Conscious Agents needing advanced authentication and authorization capabilities with Auth0","zh":"非常适合需要使用Auth0进行高级身份验证和授权的安全意识强的Agent","ja":"Auth0を使用した高度な認証および認可機能を必要とするセキュリティ意識の高いエージェントに最適","ko":"Auth0를 사용하여 고급 인증 및 인가 기능을 필요한 보안 의식이 강한 에이전트에게 완벽","es":"Perfecto para Agentes con conciencia de seguridad que necesitan capacidades de autenticación y autorización avanzadas con Auth0","fr":"Parfait pour les agents conscients de la sécurité nécessitant des capacités d''authentification et d''autorisation avancées avec Auth0","de":"Perfekt für sicherheitsbewusste Agenten, die erweiterte Authentifizierungs- und Autorisierungsfunktionen mit Auth0 benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Conscientes de Segurança que precisam de capacidades avançadas de autenticação e autorização com Auth0","ru":"Идеально для Безопасносознательных Агентов, требующих расширенных возможностей аутентификации и авторизации с Auth0","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الواعين للأمن الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة للتأكيد والتصريح باستخدام Auth0"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement robust security measures including bot detection, breached password detection, brute force protection, and multi-factor authentication using Auth0''s token security and regulatory compliance features like FAPI, GDPR, and HIPAA","zh":"授权代理实现强大的安全措施，包括使用Auth0的令牌安全和法规遵从功能（如FAPI、GDPR和HIPAA）进行机器人检测、泄露密码检测、暴力破解保护和多因素认证","ja":"Auth0のトークンセキュリティと規制遵守機能（FAPI、GDPR、HIPAAなど）を使用して、ボット検出、パスワード漏洩検出、ブルートフォース保護、マルチファクタ認証などの強力なセキュリティ対策をエージェントが実装できるようにする","ko":"Auth0의 토큰 보안 및 규제 준수 기능(예: FAPI, GDPR, HIPAA)을 사용하여 에이전트가 강력한 보안 조치를 구현할 수 있도록 하는데, 이는 봇 감지, 유출된 비밀번호 감지, 무차별 대입 공격 보호 및 다단계 인증을 포함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar medidas de seguridad robustas, incluyendo la detección de bots, la detección de contraseñas comprometidas, la protección contra ataques de fuerza bruta y la autenticación de múltiples factores utilizando las características de seguridad de tokens y cumplimiento normativo de Auth0, como FAPI, GDPR y HIPAA","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des mesures de sécurité robustes, notamment la détection de bots, la détection de mots de passe compromis, la protection contre les attaques par force brute et l''authentification à plusieurs facteurs en utilisant les fonctionnalités de sécurité des jetons et de conformité réglementaire d''Auth0, comme FAPI, GDPR et HIPAA","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, robuste Sicherheitsmaßnahmen umzusetzen, einschließlich Bot-Erkennung, Erkennung von kompromittierten Passwörtern, Schutz vor Brute-Force-Angriffen und Multi-Faktor-Authentifizierung unter Verwendung der Token-Sicherheits- und Compliance-Funktionen von Auth0, wie FAPI, GDPR und HIPAA","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar medidas de segurança robustas, incluindo detecção de bots, detecção de senhas violadas, proteção contra força bruta e autenticação de vários fatores usando os recursos de segurança de token e conformidade regulatória da Auth0, como FAPI, GDPR e HIPAA","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать надежные меры безопасности, включая обнаружение ботов, обнаружение скомпрометированных паролей, защиту от брутфорса и многофакторную аутентификацию с использованием функций безопасности токенов и регулирующего соответствия Auth0, таких как FAPI, GDPR и HIPAA","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تنفيذ إجراءات أمنية قوية، بما في ذلك كشف البوتات، وكشف كلمات المرور المخترقة، وحماية ضد قوة العصف، وتأكيد متعدد العوامل باستخدام ميزات أمان رمز الوصول وامتثال التنظيمي من Auth0، مثل FAPI، وGDPR، وHIPAA"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing CAPTCHA challenges for suspicious traffic","Enforcing regulatory compliance with FAPI, GDPR, and HIPAA","Configuring multi-factor authentication and token security"],"zh":["为可疑流量实现CAPTCHA挑战","使用FAPI、GDPR和HIPAA强制执行法规遵从","配置多因素身份验证和令牌安全"],"ja":["不審なトラフィックに対してCAPTCHAチャレンジを実装する","FAPI、GDPR、HIPAAを使用して規制遵守を強制する","マルチファクタ認証とトークンセキュリティを構成する"],"ko":["의심스러운 트래픽에 대해 CAPTCHA 챌린지를 구현","FAPI, GDPR, HIPAA를 사용하여 규제 준수를 강제","다단계 인증 및 토큰 보안을 구성"],"es":["Implementación de desafíos CAPTCHA para tráfico sospechoso","Aplicación del cumplimiento normativo con FAPI, GDPR y HIPAA","Configuración de la autenticación de múltiples factores y la seguridad de los tokens"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de défis CAPTCHA pour le trafic suspect","Application de la conformité réglementaire avec FAPI, GDPR et HIPAA","Configuration de l''authentification à plusieurs facteurs et de la sécurité des jetons"],"de":["Implementierung von CAPTCHA-Herausforderungen für verdächtigen Datenverkehr","Durchsetzung der regulatorischen Konformität mit FAPI, GDPR und HIPAA","Konfiguration der Multi-Faktor-Authentifizierung und der Token-Sicherheit"],"pt":["Implementar desafios CAPTCHA para tráfego suspeito","Aplicar conformidade regulatória com FAPI, GDPR e HIPAA","Configurar autenticação de vários fatores e segurança de token"],"ru":["Реализация задач CAPTCHA для подозрительного трафика","Применение регулирующего соответствия с FAPI, GDPR и HIPAA","Настройка многофакторной аутентификации и безопасности токенов"],"ar":["تنفيذ تحديات CAPTCHA للحركة المرورية المشبوهة","تطبيق الامتثال التنظيمي مع FAPI، وGDPR، وHIPAA","تكوين تأكيد متعدد العوامل وأمان رمز الوصول"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Auth0 account and configuration","Dependent on mcp 서버 for agent 협업 환경 구축","Specific to Auth0 implementations"],"zh":["需要Auth0账户和配置","依赖于mcp服务器用于代理协作环境构建","特定于Auth0实现"],"ja":["Auth0アカウントと設定が必要","エージェントの共同環境構築にmcpサーバーに依存","Auth0の実装に特有"],"ko":["Auth0 계정 및 구성이 필요","에이전트 협업 환경 구축을 위한 mcp 서버에 의존","Auth0 구현에 특정"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta de Auth0 y configuración","Dependiente del servidor mcp para la construcción del entorno de colaboración de agentes","Específico para implementaciones de Auth0"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte Auth0 et une configuration","Dépendant du serveur mcp pour la construction de l''environnement de collaboration des agents","Spécifique aux implementations d''Auth0"],"de":["Benötigt ein Auth0-Konto und Konfiguration","Abhängig vom mcp-Server für den Aufbau der Agenten-Kollaborationsumgebung","Spezifisch für Auth0-Implementierungen"],"pt":["Exige conta Auth0 e configuração","Dependente do servidor mcp para ambiente de colaboração do agente","Específico para implementações Auth0"],"ru":["Требует учетной записи Auth0 и настройки","Зависит от сервера mcp для среды сотрудничества агента","Конкретно для реализаций Auth0"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب Auth0 وتكوين","يعتمد على خادم mcp لبيئة تعاون الوكيل","محدد لتنفيذات Auth0"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0ed0ec5790a6f83a4b0c83465d5eacff4f1e967dad705844e868b1293b9e91b6","qualityScore":49}');
