d''IA pour applications web","Fonctionnalités de jeu innovantes"],"de":["Mit React erstellt","Integration mit Cloudflare Workers","Entwicklung von Pokémon-Spielen","KI-Tools für Webanwendungen","Innovative Spielmerkmale"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de jogos com React","Integração com Cloudflare Workers","Ferramenta de IA para jogos","Compatibilidade com Pokémon","Código aberto e personalizável"],"ru":["Разработка игр на React","Интеграция с Cloudflare Workers","Инструмент ИИ для игр","Совместимость с Pokémon","Открытый и настраиваемый код"],"ar":["بناء ألعاب مع React","التكامل مع Cloudflare Workers","أداة ذكاء اصطناعي للألعاب","التوافق مع بوكيمون","كود مفتوح وقابل للتعديل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 base44-sdk","什么是 React","Cloudflare Workers 教程","base44-sdk 安装","base44-sdk 与其他游戏开发工具的比较","如何构建宝可梦游戏","AI 智能工具","游戏开发解决方案"],"ja":["base44-sdk の使い方","React とは","Cloudflare Workers チュートリアル","base44-sdk のインストール","base44-sdk と他のゲーム開発ツールの比較","ポケモンゲームの構築方法","AI エージェント","ゲーム開発ソリューション"],"ko":["base44-sdk 사용법","리액트란 무엇인가","클라우드플레어 워커 튜토리얼","base44-sdk 설치","base44-sdk와 다른 게임 개발 도구의 비교","포켓몬 게임 구축 방법","AI 에이전트","게임 개발 솔루션"],"es":["herramientas de AI","desarrollo de juegos","React","Cloudflare Workers","cómo usar base44-sdk","alternativas a base44-sdk","instalación de base44-sdk","guía de configuración de base44-sdk"],"fr":["outils d''IA","développement de jeux","React","Cloudflare Workers","comment utiliser base44-sdk","alternatives à base44-sdk","installation de base44-sdk","guide de configuration de base44-sdk"],"de":["KI-Tools","Spielentwicklung","React","Cloudflare Workers","wie man base44-sdk verwendet","Alternativen zu base44-sdk","Installation von base44-sdk","Konfigurationsanleitung für base44-sdk"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","desenvolvimento de jogos","react","cloudflare workers","jogos de pokémon","como usar base44-sdk","o que é base44-sdk","base44-sdk vs outras ferramentas"],"ru":["инструменты ии","разработка игр","react","cloudflare workers","игры покемон","как использовать base44-sdk","что такое base44-sdk","base44-sdk против других инструментов"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تنمية الألعاب","react","cloudflare workers","ألعاب بوكيمون","كيفية استخدام base44-sdk","ما هي base44-sdk","base44-sdk مقابل أدوات أخرى"]}},"owner":"offloadmywork","repo":"pokemon-app","repoPath":"offloadmywork/pokemon-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.708Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"base44-sdk","description":"The base44 SDK is the library to communicate with base44 services. In projects, you use it to communicate with remote resources (entities, backend functions, ai agents) and to write backend functions. This skill is the place for learning about available modules and types. When you plan or implement a feature, you must learn this skill","bodyPreview":"# Base44 Coder\n\nBuild apps on the Base44 platform using the Base44 JavaScript SDK.\n\n## ⚡ IMMEDIATE ACTION REQUIRED - Read This First\n\nThis skill activates on ANY mention of \"base44\" or when a `base44/` folder exists. **DO NOT read documentation files or search the web before acting.**\n\n**Your first action MUST be:**\n1. Check if `base44/config.jsonc` exists in the current directory\n2. If **YES** (existing project scenario):\n   - This skill (base44-sdk) handles the request\n   - Implement features","body":"# Base44 Coder\n\nBuild apps on the Base44 platform using the Base44 JavaScript SDK.\n\n## ⚡ IMMEDIATE ACTION REQUIRED - Read This First\n\nThis skill activates on ANY mention of \"base44\" or when a `base44/` folder exists. **DO NOT read documentation files or search the web before acting.**\n\n**Your first action MUST be:**\n1. Check if `base44/config.jsonc` exists in the current directory\n2. If **YES** (existing project scenario):\n   - This skill (base44-sdk) handles the request\n   - Implement features using Base44 SDK\n   - Do NOT use base44-cli unless user explicitly requests CLI commands\n3. If **NO** (new project scenario):\n   - Transfer to base44-cli skill for project initialization\n   - This skill cannot help until project is initialized\n\n## When to Use This Skill vs base44-cli\n\n**Use base44-sdk when:**\n- Building features in an **EXISTING** Base44 project\n- `base44/config.jsonc` already exists in the project\n- Base44 SDK imports are present (`@base44/sdk`)\n- Writing JavaScript/TypeScript code using Base44 SDK modules\n- Implementing functionality, components, or features\n- User mentions: \"implement\", \"build a feature\", \"add functionality\", \"write code for\"\n- User says \"create a [type] app\" **and** a Base44 project already exists\n\n**DO NOT USE base44-sdk for:**\n- ❌ Initializing new Base44 projects (use `base44-cli` instead)\n- ❌ Empty directories without Base44 configuration\n- ❌ When user says \"create a new Base44 project/app/site\" and no project exists\n- ❌ CLI commands like `npx base44 create`, `npx base44 deploy`, `npx base44 login` (use `base44-cli`)\n\n**Skill Dependencies:**\n- `base44-sdk` assumes a Base44 project is **already initialized**\n- `base44-cli` is a **prerequisite** for `base44-sdk` in new projects\n- If user wants to \"create an app\" and no Base44 project exists, use `base44-cli` first\n\n**State Check Logic:**\nBefore selecting this skill, verify:\n- IF (user mentions \"create/build app\" OR \"make a project\"):\n  - IF (directory is empty OR no `base44/config.jsonc` exists):\n    → Use **base44-cli** (project initialization needed)\n  - ELSE:\n    → Use **base44-sdk** (project exists, build features)\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```javascript\n// In Base44-generated apps, base44 client is pre-configured and available\n\n// CRUD operations\nconst task = await base44.entities.Task.create({ title: \"New task\", status: \"pending\" });\nconst tasks = await base44.entities.Task.list();\nawait base44.entities.Task.update(task.id, { status: \"done\" });\n\n// Get current user\nconst user = await base44.auth.me();\n```\n\n```javascript\n// External apps\nimport { createClient } from \"@base44/sdk\";\n\n// IMPORTANT: Use ''appId'' (NOT ''clientId'' or ''id'')\nconst base44 = createClient({ appId: \"your-app-id\" });\nawait base44.auth.loginViaEmailPassword(\"user@example.com\", \"password\");\n```\n\n## ⚠️ CRITICAL: Do Not Hallucinate APIs\n\n**Before writing ANY Base44 code, verify method names against this table or [QUICK_REFERENCE.md](references/QUICK_REFERENCE.md).**\n\nBase44 SDK has unique method names. Do NOT assume patterns from Firebase, Supabase, or other SDKs.\n\n### Authentication - WRONG vs CORRECT\n\n| ❌ WRONG (hallucinated) | ✅ CORRECT |\n|------------------------|-----------|\n| `signInWithGoogle()` | `loginWithProvider(''google'')` |\n| `signInWithProvider(''google'')` | `loginWithProvider(''google'')` |\n| `auth.google()` | `loginWithProvider(''google'')` |\n| `signInWithEmailAndPassword(email, pw)` | `loginViaEmailPassword(email, pw)` |\n| `signIn(email, pw)` | `loginViaEmailPassword(email, pw)` |\n| `createUser()` / `signUp()` | `register({email, password})` |\n| `onAuthStateChanged()` | `me()` (no listener, call when needed) |\n| `currentUser` | `await auth.me()` |\n\n### Functions - WRONG vs CORRECT\n\n| ❌ WRONG (hallucinated) | ✅ CORRECT |\n|------------------------|-----------|\n| `functions.call(''name'', data)` | `functions.invoke(''name'', data)` |\n| `functions.run(''name'', data)` | `functions.invoke(''name'', data)` |\n| `callFunction(''name'', data)` | `functions.invoke(''name'', data)` |\n| `httpsCallable(''name'')(data)` | `functions.invoke(''name'', data)` |\n\n### Integrations - WRONG vs CORRECT\n\n| ❌ WRONG (hallucinated) | ✅ CORRECT |\n|------------------------|-----------|\n| `ai.generate(prompt)` | `integrations.Core.InvokeLLM({prompt})` |\n| `openai.chat(prompt)` | `integrations.Core.InvokeLLM({prompt})` |\n| `llm(prompt)` | `integrations.Core.InvokeLLM({prompt})` |\n| `sendEmail(to, subject, body)` | `integrations.Core.SendEmail({to, subject, body})` |\n| `email.send()` | `integrations.Core.SendEmail({to, subject, body})` |\n| `uploadFile(file)` | `integrations.Core.UploadFile({file})` |\n| `storage.upload(file)` | `integrations.Core.UploadFile({file})` |\n\n### Entities - WRONG vs CORRECT\n\n| ❌ WRONG (hallucinated) | ✅ CORRECT |\n|------------------------|-----------|\n| `entities.Task.find({...})` | `entities.Task.filter({...})` |\n| `entities.Task.findOne(id)` | `entities.Task.get(id)` |\n| `entities.Task.insert(data)` | `entities.Task.create(data)` |\n| `entities.Task.remove(id)` | `entities.Task.delete(id)` |\n| `entities.Task.onChange(cb)` | `entities.Task.subscribe(cb)` |\n\n## SDK Modules\n\n| Module | Purpose | Reference |\n|--------|---------|-----------|\n| `entities` | CRUD operations on data models | [entities.md](references/entities.md) |\n| `auth` | Login, register, user management | [auth.md](references/auth.md) |\n| `agents` | AI conversations and messages | [base44-agents.md](references/base44-agents.md) |\n| `functions` | Backend function invocation | [functions.md](references/functions.md) |\n| `integrations` | AI, email, file uploads, custom APIs | [integrations.md](references/integrations.md) |\n| `connectors` | OAuth tokens (service role only) | [connectors.md](references/connectors.md) |\n| `analytics` | Track custom events and user activity | [analytics.md](references/analytics.md) |\n| `appLogs` | Log user activity in app | [app-logs.md](references/app-logs.md) |\n| `users` | Invite users to the app | [users.md](references/users.md) |\n\nFor client setup and authentication modes, see [client.md](references/client.md).\n\n**TypeScript Support:** Each reference file includes a \"Type Definitions\" section with TypeScript interfaces and types for the module''s methods, parameters, and return values.\n\n## Installation\n\nInstall the Base44 SDK:\n\n```bash\nnpm install @base44/sdk\n```\n\n**Important:** Never assume or hardcode the `@base44/sdk` package version. Always install without a version specifier to get the latest version.\n\n## Creating a Client (External Apps)\n\nWhen creating a client in external apps, **ALWAYS use `appId` as the parameter name**:\n\n```javascript\nimport { createClient } from \"@base44/sdk\";\n\n// ✅ CORRECT\nconst base44 = createClient({ appId: \"your-app-id\" });\n\n// ❌ WRONG - Do NOT use these:\n// const base44 = createClient({ clientId: \"your-app-id\" });  // WRONG\n// const base44 = createClient({ id: \"your-app-id\" });        // WRONG\n```\n\n**Required parameter:** `appId` (string) - Your Base44 application ID\n\n**Optional parameters:**\n- `token` (string) - Pre-authenticated user token\n- `options` (object) - Configuration options\n  - `options.onError` (function) - Global error handler\n\n**Example with error handler:**\n```javascript\nconst base44 = createClient({\n  appId: \"your-app-id\",\n  options: {\n    onError: (error) => {\n      console.error(\"Base44 error:\", error);\n    }\n  }\n});\n```\n\n## Module Selection\n\n**Working with app data?**\n- Create/read/update/delete records → `entities`\n- Import data from file → `entities.importEntities()`\n- Realtime updates → `entities.EntityName.subscribe()`\n\n**User management?**\n- Login/register/logout → `auth`\n- Get current user → `auth.me()`\n- Update user profile → `auth.updateMe()`\n- Invite users → `users.inviteUser()`\n\n**AI features?**\n- Chat with AI agents → `agents` (requires logged-in user)\n- Create new conversation → `agents.createConversation()`\n- Manage conversations → `agents.getConversations()`\n- Generate text/JSON with AI → `integrations.Core.InvokeLLM()`\n- Generate images → `integrations.Core.GenerateImage()`\n\n**Custom backend logic?**\n- Run server-side code → `functions.invoke()`\n- Need admin access → `base44.asServiceRole.functions.invoke()`\n\n**External services?**\n- Send emails → `integrations.Core.SendEmail()`\n- Upload files → `integrations.Core.UploadFile()`\n- Custom APIs → `integrations.custom.call()`\n- OAuth tokens (Google, Slack) → `connectors` (backend only)\n\n**Tracking and analytics?**\n- Track custom events → `analytics.track()`\n- Log page views/activity → `appLogs.logUserInApp()`\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Filter and Sort Data\n\n```javascript\nconst pendingTasks = await base44.entities.Task.filter(\n  { status: \"pending\", assignedTo: userId },  // query\n  \"-created_date\",                             // sort (descending)\n  10,                                          // limit\n  0                                            // skip\n);\n```\n\n### Protected Routes (check auth)\n\n```javascript\nconst user = await base44.auth.me();\nif (!user) {\n  // Navigate to your custom login page\n  navigate(''/login'', { state: { returnTo: window.location.pathname } });\n  return;\n}\n```\n\n### Backend Function Call\n\n```javascript\n// Frontend\nconst result = await base44.functions.invoke(\"processOrder\", {\n  orderId: \"123\",\n  action: \"ship\"\n});\n\n// Backend function (Deno)\nimport { createClientFromRequest } from \"npm:@base44/sdk\";\n\nDeno.serve(async (req) => {\n  const base44 = createClientFromRequest(req);\n  const { orderId, action } = await req.json();\n  // Process with service role for admin access\n  const order = await base44.asServiceRole.entities.Orders.get(orderId);\n  return Response.json({ success: true });\n});\n```\n\n### Service Role Access\n\nUse `asServiceRole` in backend functions for admin-level operations:\n\n```javascript\n// User mode - respects permissions\nconst myTasks = await base44.entities.Task.list();\n\n// Service role - full access (backend only)\nconst allTasks = await base44.asServiceRole.entities.Task.list();\nconst token = await base44.asServiceRole.connectors.getAccessToken(\"slack\");\n```\n\n## Frontend vs Backend\n\n| Capability | Frontend | Backend |\n|------------|----------|---------|\n| `entities` (user''s data) | Yes | Yes |\n| `auth` | Yes | Yes |\n| `agents` | Yes | Yes |\n| `functions.invoke()` | Yes | Yes |\n| `integrations` | Yes | Yes |\n| `analytics` | Yes | Yes |\n| `appLogs` | Yes | Yes |\n| `users` | Yes | Yes |\n| `asServiceRole.*` | No | Yes |\n| `connectors` | No | Yes |\n\nBackend functions use `Deno.serve()` and `createClientFromRequest(req)` to get a properly authenticated client.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:42:37.584Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloudflare Workers Agents needing streamlined Base44 platform integration with React.","zh":"非常适合需要简化 Base44 平台与 React 集成的 Cloudflare Workers Agents。","ja":"React と Base44 プラットフォームの統合を簡素化する必要がある Cloudflare Workers エージェントに最適です。","ko":"React와 Base44 플랫폼 통합을 간소화해야 하는 Cloudflare Workers 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Cloudflare Workers que necesitan una integración de plataforma Base44 optimizada con React.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloudflare Workers nécessitant une intégration de plateforme Base44 simplifiée avec React.","de":"Perfekt für Cloudflare Workers Agents, die eine optimierte Base44 Plattformintegration mit React benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Cloudflare Workers que precisam de integração de plataforma Base44 simplificada com React.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Cloudflare Workers, которым требуется упрощенная интеграция с платформой Base44 и React.","ar":"مثالي لعميل Cloudflare Workers الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج منصة Base44 المُبسّط مع React."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build apps on the Base44 platform using the Base44 JavaScript SDK, handling requests and implementing features upon detecting ''base44/'' folders or mentions of ''base44'', while interacting with Cloudflare Workers and React.","zh":"赋予代理构建在 Base44 平台上使用 Base44 JavaScript SDK 的应用程序的能力，处理请求并在检测到 ''base44/'' 文件夹或提及 ''base44'' 时实现功能，同时与 Cloudflare Workers 和 React 交互。","ja":"Base44 JavaScript SDK を使用して Base44 プラットフォーム上でアプリケーションを構築するエージェントを可能にし、''base44/'' フォルダまたは ''base44'' の参照を検出すると要求を処理し、機能を実装し、Cloudflare Workers および React とやり取りします。","ko":"Base44 JavaScript SDK를 사용하여 Base44 플랫폼에서 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하여 ''base44/'' 폴더나 ''base44'' 언급을 감지하면 요청을 처리하고 기능을 구현하며 Cloudflare Workers와 React와 상호 작용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear aplicaciones en la plataforma Base44 utilizando el SDK de JavaScript de Base44, manejar solicitudes e implementar funciones al detectar carpetas ''base44/'' o menciones de ''base44'', mientras interactúa con Cloudflare Workers y React.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications sur la plateforme Base44 en utilisant le SDK JavaScript Base44, en gérant les requêtes et en mettant en œuvre des fonctionnalités lors de la détection de dossiers ''base44/'' ou de mentions de ''base44'', tout en interagissant avec Cloudflare Workers et React.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Apps auf der Base44-Plattform mit dem Base44 JavaScript SDK zu erstellen, Anfragen zu bearbeiten und Funktionen zu implementieren, wenn ''base44/''-Ordner oder Erwähnungen von ''base44'' erkannt werden, während sie mit Cloudflare Workers und React interagieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicativos na plataforma Base44 usando o SDK JavaScript Base44, lidando com solicitações e implementando recursos ao detectar pastas ''base44/'' ou menções de ''base44'', enquanto interage com Cloudflare Workers e React.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать приложения на платформе Base44, используя JavaScript SDK Base44, обрабатывать запросы и реализовывать функции при обнаружении папок ''base44/'' или упоминаниях ''base44'', а также взаимодействовать с Cloudflare Workers и React.","ar":"يمكن للوكيل من إنشاء تطبيقات على منصة Base44 باستخدام SDK JavaScript Base44، ومعالجة الطلبات وتنفيذ الميزات عند الكشف عن مجلدات ''base44/'' أو ذكر ''base44''، في حين التفاعل مع Cloudflare Workers و React."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing Base44 features in existing projects","Handling requests upon ''base44/'' folder detection","Building new apps on the Base44 platform with React and Cloudflare Workers"],"zh":["在现有项目中实现 Base44 功能","检测到 ''base44/'' 文件夹时处理请求","使用 React 和 Cloudflare Workers 在 Base44 平台上构建新应用"],"ja":["既存のプロジェクトで Base44 機能を実装する","''base44/'' フォルダを検出時に要求を処理する","React および Cloudflare Workers を使用して Base44 プラットフォーム上で新しいアプリケーションを構築する"],"ko":["기존 프로젝트에서 Base44 기능을 구현하는 것","''base44/'' 폴더를 감지할 때 요청을 처리하는 것","React 및 Cloudflare Workers를 사용하여 Base44 플랫폼에서 새로운 애플리케이션을 구축하는 것"],"es":["Implementar características de Base44 en proyectos existentes","Manejar solicitudes al detectar la carpeta ''base44/''","Crear nuevas aplicaciones en la plataforma Base44 con React y Cloudflare Workers"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des fonctionnalités Base44 dans les projets existants","Gérer les requêtes lors de la détection du dossier ''base44/''","Créer de nouvelles applications sur la plateforme Base44 avec React et Cloudflare Workers"],"de":["Base44-Features in bestehenden Projekten implementieren","Anfragen bearbeiten, wenn der Ordner ''base44/'' erkannt wird","Erstellen von neuen Apps auf der Base44-Plattform mit React und Cloudflare Workers"],"pt":["Implementar recursos Base44 em projetos existentes","Lidar com solicitações após detecção de pasta ''base44/''","Construir novos aplicativos na plataforma Base44 com React e Cloudflare Workers"],"ru":["Реализация функций Base44 в существующих проектах","Обработка запросов после обнаружения папки ''base44/''","Создание новых приложений на платформе Base44 с помощью React и Cloudflare Workers"],"ar":["تنفيذ ميزات Base44 في المشاريع الحالية","معالجة الطلبات بعد الكشف عن مجلد ''base44/''","بناء تطبيقات جديدة على منصة Base44 باستخدام React و Cloudflare Workers"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ''base44/config.jsonc'' file in the current directory for existing project scenarios","Specific to Base44 platform and JavaScript SDK"],"zh":["需要在当前目录中具有 ''base44/config.jsonc'' 文件以适应现有项目场景","仅限 Base44 平台和 JavaScript SDK"],"ja":["既存のプロジェクト シナリオの場合、現在のディレクトリに ''base44/config.jsonc'' ファイルが必要です","Base44 プラットフォームおよび JavaScript SDK 専用"],"ko":["기존 프로젝트 시나리오의 경우 현재 디렉토리에 ''base44/config.jsonc'' 파일이 필요합니다.","Base44 플랫폼 및 JavaScript SDK 전용"],"es":["Requiere un archivo ''base44/config.jsonc'' en el directorio actual para escenarios de proyectos existentes","Específico de la plataforma Base44 y el SDK de JavaScript"],"fr":["Nécessite un fichier ''base44/config.jsonc'' dans le répertoire actuel pour les scénarios de projets existants","Spécifique à la plateforme Base44 et au SDK JavaScript"],"de":["Benötigt eine Datei ''base44/config.jsonc'' im aktuellen Verzeichnis für Szenarien bestehender Projekte","Spezifisch für die Base44-Plattform und das JavaScript SDK"],"pt":["Requer arquivo ''base44/config.jsonc'' no diretório atual para cenários de projetos existentes","Específico para plataforma Base44 e JavaScript SDK"],"ru":["Требуется файл ''base44/config.jsonc'' в текущем каталоге для сценариев существующих проектов","Спецефичен для платформы Base44 и JavaScript SDK"],"ar":["يتطلب ملف ''base44/config.jsonc'' في الدليل الحالي لمشاهد مشاريع موجودة","محدد لمنصة Base44 و SDK JavaScript"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"981c78c1075d71e505280d3ab8584b7e65314004408e701800698e28eecb1a6b","qualityScore":49}');
