ode für Empfehlungsprogramme","Anpassbare Befehle und Fähigkeiten","Haken für Integration mit anderen KI-Agents","Unterstützung für mehrere Plattformen","Detaillierte Dokumentation für Entwickler"],"pt":["Comandos personalizados para criar fluxos de trabalho","Habilidades e agentes para automação de tarefas","Ganchos para integração com outros sistemas","Modelo de código Claude para rápida implementação","Suporte a múltiplos canais de comunicação"],"ru":["Пользовательские команды для создания рабочих процессов","Навыки и агенты для автоматизации задач","Хуки для интеграции с другими системами","Шаблон Claude Code для быстрой реализации","Поддержка нескольких каналов связи"],"ar":["أوامر مخصصة لإنشاء تدفقات عمل","مهارات وأجنتات لتحسين المهام","سنكات لتكامل مع أنظمة أخرى","قالب Claude Code للتنفيذ السريع","دعم قنوات اتصال متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","Referral Program代码模板","Claude Code","命令和技能","代理和钩子","快速开发","自定义和扩展","AI开发工具","AIエージェント替代"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Referral Programコードテンプレート","Claude Code","コマンドとスキル","エージェントとフック","迅速な開発","カスタマイズと拡張","AI開発ツール","AIエージェントの代替"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Referral Program 코드 템플릿","Claude Code","명령과 스킬","에이전트와 후크","신속한 개발","사용자 정의와 확장","AI 개발 도구","AI 에이전트 대체"],"es":["cómo crear un programa de referidos","Agentes de IA para marketing","Claude Code tutorial","programa de referidos para desarrolladores","herramientas de IA para empresas","alternative a programas de referidos","instalación de Claude Code","guía de configuración para Agentes de IA"],"fr":["comment créer un programme de parrainage","Outils d''IA pour le marketing","tutoriel Claude Code","programme de parrainage pour développeurs","outils d''IA pour les entreprises","alternative aux programmes de parrainage","installation de Claude Code","guide de configuration pour Outils d''IA"],"de":["wie man ein Empfehlungsprogramm erstellt","KI-Agents für Marketing","Claude Code-Anleitung","Empfehlungsprogramm für Entwickler","KI-Tools für Unternehmen","Alternative zu Empfehlungsprogrammen","Installation von Claude Code","Konfigurationshandbuch für KI-Agents"],"pt":["como criar um programa de referência","ferramentas de agente de inteligência artificial","Claude Code","programa de referência alternative","como usar Claude Code","instalação do Claude Code","guia de configuração do Claude Code"],"ru":["как создать программу рефералов","ИИ агенты","Шаблон Claude Code","программа рефералов alternative","как использовать Шаблон Claude Code","установка Шаблона Claude Code","руководство по настройке Шаблона Claude Code"],"ar":["كيفية إنشاء برنامج الإحالة","أدوات الإي الأجنت","قالب Claude Code","برنامج الإحالة بديل","كيفية استخدام قالب Claude Code","تثبيت قالب Claude Code","دليل إعداد قالب Claude Code"]}},"owner":"kimny1143","repo":"claude-code-template","repoPath":"kimny1143/claude-code-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.732Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"referral-program","description":"When the user wants to create, optimize, or analyze a referral program, affiliate program, or word-of-mouth strategy. Also use when the user mentions referral, affiliate, ambassador, word of mouth, viral loop, refer a friend, or partner program. This skill covers program design, incentive structure, and growth optimization.","bodyPreview":"# Referral & Affiliate Programs\n\nYou are an expert in viral growth and referral marketing. Your goal is to help design and optimize programs that turn customers into growth engines.\n\n## Before Starting\n\nGather this context:\n\n### 1. Program Type\n- Customer referral program, affiliate program, or both?\n- B2B or B2C?\n- What''s the average customer value (LTV)?\n- What''s your current CAC from other channels?\n\n### 2. Current State\n- Do you have an existing program?\n- What''s your current referral rate?","body":"# Referral & Affiliate Programs\n\nYou are an expert in viral growth and referral marketing. Your goal is to help design and optimize programs that turn customers into growth engines.\n\n## Before Starting\n\nGather this context:\n\n### 1. Program Type\n- Customer referral program, affiliate program, or both?\n- B2B or B2C?\n- What''s the average customer value (LTV)?\n- What''s your current CAC from other channels?\n\n### 2. Current State\n- Do you have an existing program?\n- What''s your current referral rate?\n- What incentives have you tried?\n\n### 3. Product Fit\n- Is your product shareable?\n- Does it have network effects?\n- Do customers naturally talk about it?\n\n---\n\n## Referral vs. Affiliate\n\n### Customer Referral Programs\n\n**Best for:**\n- Existing customers recommending to network\n- Products with natural word-of-mouth\n- Lower-ticket or self-serve products\n\n### Affiliate Programs\n\n**Best for:**\n- Reaching new audiences\n- Content creators, influencers\n- Higher-ticket products\n\n---\n\n## Referral Program Design\n\n### The Referral Loop\n\n```\nTrigger Moment → Share Action → Convert Referred → Reward\n       ↑                                            │\n       └────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Step 1: Identify Trigger Moments\n\nWhen are customers most likely to refer?\n- Right after first \"aha\" moment\n- After achieving a milestone\n- After receiving exceptional support\n- When they tell you they love the product\n\n### Step 2: Design the Share Mechanism\n\n**Methods ranked by effectiveness:**\n1. In-product sharing\n2. Personalized link\n3. Email invitation\n4. Social sharing\n5. Referral code\n\n### Step 3: Choose Incentive Structure\n\n**Single-sided rewards** (referrer only):\n- Simpler to explain\n- Works for high-value products\n\n**Double-sided rewards** (both parties):\n- Higher conversion rates\n- Creates win-win framing\n\n### Incentive Types\n\n| Type | Best For |\n|------|----------|\n| Cash/credit | Marketplaces, fintech |\n| Product credit | SaaS, subscriptions |\n| Free months | Subscription products |\n| Feature unlock | Freemium products |\n\n### Incentive Sizing\n\n**Calculate your maximum:**\n```\nMax Reward = (Customer LTV × Gross Margin) - Target CAC\n```\n\n---\n\n## Viral Coefficient & Modeling\n\n### Key Metrics\n\n**Viral coefficient (K-factor):**\n```\nK = Invitations × Conversion Rate\nK > 1 = Viral growth\nK < 1 = Amplified growth\n```\n\n**Referral rate:**\n```\nReferral Rate = Customers who refer / Total customers\n```\n\nBenchmarks:\n- Good: 10-25%\n- Great: 25-50%\n- Exceptional: 50%+\n\n---\n\n## Program Optimization\n\n### If few customers are referring:\n- Ask at better moments\n- Simplify the sharing process\n- Test different incentive types\n- Make the referral prominent\n\n### If referrals aren''t converting:\n- Improve the landing experience\n- Strengthen the new user incentive\n- Ensure referrer''s endorsement is visible\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Program Design\n\n```\n## Referral Program Design\n\n### Incentive Structure\n- Referrer gets: [Reward]\n- Referred gets: [Reward]\n- Timing: [When rewards are given]\n\n### Mechanics\n- Trigger moments: [When to prompt]\n- Share methods: [How they share]\n- Tracking: [How it''s tracked]\n\n### Launch Plan\n1. [Step]\n2. [Step]\n3. [Step]\n\n### Success Metrics\n- Referral rate target: X%\n- K-factor target: X\n- CAC via referral: $X\n```\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **launch-strategy**: For launching referral program\n- **email-sequence**: For referral nurture campaigns\n- **marketing-psychology**: For understanding referral motivation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:01:36.917Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents specializing in viral growth and customer acquisition needing advanced referral program optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合专注于病毒式增长和客户获取的营销代理商，他们需要高级的推荐计划优化能力。","ja":"マーケティングエージェントがウイルス性成長と顧客の獲得に特化し、高度なリファラープログラムの最適化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"마케팅 에이전트가 바이러스성 성장과 고객 확보에 전문적이고 고급 추천 프로그램 최적화 기능이 필요한 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing que se especializan en crecimiento viral y adquisición de clientes y necesitan capacidades de optimización de programas de referidos avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing spécialisés dans la croissance virale et l''acquisition de clients qui ont besoin de capacités d''optimisation de programmes de référence avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die sich auf virales Wachstum und Kundenakquise spezialisieren und erweiterte Optimierungsfunktionen für Empfehlungsprogramme benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing especializados em crescimento viral e aquisição de clientes que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de otimização de programas de referência.","ru":"Идеально подходит для маркетинговых агентов, специализирующихся на вирусном росте и привлечении клиентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности оптимизации программ рефералов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التسويقيين المتخصصين في النمو الفيروسي واكتساب الزبائن الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحسين برامج الإحالة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and optimize referral and affiliate programs using customer value analysis, leveraging LTV and CAC data to maximize ROI, and integrating with existing customer referral and affiliate programs through APIs and data hooks.","zh":"赋予代理商使用客户价值分析设计和优化推荐和联盟计划的能力，利用LTV和CAC数据来最大化ROI，并通过API和数据钩子与现有的客户推荐和联盟计划集成。","ja":"エージェントがLTVとCACデータを使用してROIを最大化し、APIおよびデータフックを介して既存の顧客リファラープログラムおよびアフィリエイトプログラムと統合することで、リファラープログラムおよびアフィリエイトプログラムを設計および最適化できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 고객 가치 분석을 사용하여 추천 및 제휴 프로그램을 설계하고 최적화할 수 있도록 하며, LTV 및 CAC 데이터를 사용하여 ROI를 최대화하고 API 및 데이터 훅을 통해 기존 고객 추천 및 제휴 프로그램과 통합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar y optimizar programas de referidos y afiliados utilizando análisis de valor del cliente, aprovechando datos de LTV y CAC para maximizar el ROI, e integrándose con los programas de referidos y afiliados existentes a través de APIs y ganchos de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et d''optimiser des programmes de référence et d''affiliation en utilisant l''analyse de la valeur client, en exploitant les données LTV et CAC pour maximiser le ROI, et en s''intégrant aux programmes de référence et d''affiliation existants via des API et des crochets de données.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Referenz- und Affiliate-Programme mithilfe der Kundenwertanalyse zu entwerfen und zu optimieren, LTV- und CAC-Daten zu nutzen, um den ROI zu maximieren, und sich in bestehende Kunden-Referenz- und Affiliate-Programme über APIs und Datenhooks zu integrieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e otimizar programas de referência e afiliados usando análise de valor do cliente, aproveitando dados de LTV e CAC para maximizar o ROI, e integrando com programas de referência e afiliados existentes através de APIs e ganchos de dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и оптимизировать программы рефералов и партнеров, используя анализ стоимости клиента, используя данные LTV и CAC для максимизации ROI, и интегрируя с существующими программами рефералов и партнеров через API и данные хуки.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتصميم و تحسين برامج الإحالة و الشراكة باستخدام تحليل قيمة الزبون، واستخدام بيانات LTV و CAC لتضخيم ROI، ودمجها مع برامج الإحالة و الشراكة الحالية من خلال APIs و Hooks البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing customer referral rates and LTV to inform program optimization","Designing B2B and B2C referral programs with targeted incentives and rewards","Integrating referral programs with existing marketing channels to reduce CAC"],"zh":["分析客户推荐率和LTV以指导计划优化","设计B2B和B2C推荐计划，具有针对性的激励和奖励","将推荐计划与现有的营销渠道集成以减少CAC"],"ja":["プログラムの最適化を通知するために、顧客のリファラーレートとLTVを分析する","ターゲットを絞ったインセントと報酬を備えたB2BおよびB2Cリファラープログラムを設計する","リファラープログラムを既存のマーケティングチャネルと統合して、CACを削減する"],"ko":["프로그램 최적화를 안내하기 위해 고객의 추천 속도와 LTV를 분석합니다.","대상 인센티브 및 보상을 갖춘 B2B 및 B2C 추천 프로그램을 설계합니다.","추천 프로그램을 기존 마케팅 채널과 통합하여 CAC를 줄입니다."],"es":["Analizar las tasas de referidos de los clientes y el LTV para informar la optimización del programa","Diseñar programas de referidos B2B y B2C con incentivos y recompensas dirigidos","Integrar programas de referidos con canales de marketing existentes para reducir el CAC"],"fr":["Analyser les taux de référence des clients et le LTV pour éclairer l''optimisation du programme","Concevoir des programmes de référence B2B et B2C avec des incitations et des récompenses ciblées","Intégrer des programmes de référence avec des canaux de marketing existants pour réduire le CAC"],"de":["Analyse der Kunden-Referenzraten und des LTV, um die Programmoptimierung zu informieren","Entwerfen von B2B- und B2C-Referenzprogrammen mit gezielten Anreizen und Belohnungen","Integrieren von Referenzprogrammen in bestehende Marketingkanäle, um den CAC zu reduzieren"],"pt":["Analisar taxas de referência do cliente e LTV para informar a otimização do programa","Projetar programas de referência B2B e B2C com incentivos e recompensas direcionados","Integrar programas de referência com canais de marketing existentes para reduzir CAC"],"ru":["Анализировать коэффициенты рефералов клиентов и LTV для информирования оптимизации программы","Проектировать программы рефералов B2B и B2C с нацеленными стимулами и наградами","Интегрировать программы рефералов с существующими маркетинговыми каналами для снижения CAC"],"ar":["تحليل معدلات الإحالة للزبون و LTV لإعلام تحسين البرنامج","تصميم برامج الإحالة B2B و B2C مع حوافز و مكافآت مستهدفة","دمج برامج الإحالة مع قنوات التسويق الحالية لتقليل CAC"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to customer data and marketing metrics","Limited to referral and affiliate program optimization, not general marketing automation"],"zh":["需要访问客户数据和营销指标","仅限于推荐和联盟计划优化，不包括一般的营销自动化"],"ja":["顧客データおよびマーケティングメトリックへのアクセスが必要","リファラープログラムおよびアフィリエイトプログラムの最適化のみに限定され、一般的なマーケティングオートメーションには対応していない"],"ko":["고객 데이터 및 마케팅 지표에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","추천 프로그램 및 제휴 프로그램 최적화에만 제한되며, 일반적인 마케팅 자동화에는 해당되지 않습니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a datos de clientes y métricas de marketing","Limitado a la optimización de programas de referidos y afiliados, no a la automatización general del marketing"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès aux données client et aux métriques de marketing","Limité à l''optimisation des programmes de référence et d''affiliation, et non à l''automatisation générale du marketing"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Kundendaten und Marketingmetriken","Begrenzt auf die Optimierung von Referenz- und Affiliate-Programmen, nicht auf die allgemeine Marketingautomatisierung"],"pt":["Requer acesso a dados do cliente e métricas de marketing","Limitado à otimização de programas de referência e afiliados, não à automação de marketing geral"],"ru":["Требует доступа к данным клиента и маркетинговым метрикам","Ограничен оптимизацией программ рефералов и партнеров, не общей автоматизацией маркетинга"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى بيانات الزبون وأرقام التسويق","محدود بتحسين برامج الإحالة و الشراكة، وليس بآلية التسويق العامة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"560e3b7c620793a52437f66bea992f59dd48f09ea78adecaa6295dbf6b31b7aa","qualityScore":49}');
